msgid "aardart_description"
msgstr ""
"It keeps count of every ant it has eaten, and celebrates significant \n"
"numbers."

msgid "aardart"
msgstr "Bonnie BlueBelt"

msgid "aardorn_description"
msgstr "When born it is placed in an anthill and left to eat its way out."

msgid "aardorn"
msgstr "Vegan Niall"

msgid "abesnaki_description"
msgstr ""
"Each face is a different pattern, and some say the symbols spell out words \n"
"in a dead language."

msgid "abesnaki"
msgstr "Slutty Sarah"

msgid "agnidon_description"
msgstr ""
"It prefers four legs, but can stand on two to open doors, push over trees "
"or\n"
" hold things."

msgid "agnidon"
msgstr "Only Dans"

msgid "agnigon_description"
msgstr ""
"It is called a 'false dragon', because it appears to be a dragon, but \n"
"actually evolved from a different line of ancient reptiles."

msgid "agnigon"
msgstr "Mat Bastard"

msgid "agnite_description"
msgstr "It is playful, but must be taught early on to keep its fire in check."

msgid "agnite"
msgstr "Gi Goblin"

msgid "allagon_description"
msgstr ""
"ALLAGON are drawn to relics made from the metals left behind by their \n"
"ancestors, and will be violent to retrieve them."

msgid "allagon"
msgstr "Dr Kimura"

msgid "altie_description"
msgstr ""
"ALTIE floated down to earth in a bubble. Now its bubble has popped, it \n"
"cannot float more than a few meters in the air."

msgid "altie"
msgstr "Coach Atlas"

msgid "ambuwl_description"
msgstr ""
"The egg in its pouch does not hatch. Instead, it secretes a delicious "
"drink \n"
"with restorative powers."

msgid "ambuwl"
msgstr "Spazzy Steve"

msgid "ampystoma_description"
msgstr ""
"You would think AMPYSTOMA's warning coloration would make ambush "
"impossible,\n"
" but the murky waters it hunts in obscure it until it is ready to reveal \n"
"itself. It likes to go on land during thunderstorms."

msgid "ampystoma"
msgstr "Acai Slut"

msgid "angesnow_description"
msgstr ""
"Those who survive getting lost in hostile, icy conditions often mention a \n"
"mysterious presence guiding them even when the snow is too heavy to see \n"
"through."

msgid "angesnow"
msgstr "Craig NoGi"

msgid "angrito_description"
msgstr ""
"It cannot understand why humans feel rage and hatred, but ANGRITO feels \n"
"these urges too."

msgid "angrito"
msgstr "Wristlock Wes"

msgid "anoleaf_description"
msgstr ""
"It considers the plants growing near it to be its brothers and sisters."

msgid "anoleaf"
msgstr "Stinky Gi"

msgid "anu_description"
msgstr "It is said that it enters others' dreams to search for its lost love."

msgid "anu"
msgstr "Nasty Nate"

msgid "apeoro_description"
msgstr ""
"The kings of old used psychic powers to transfer their souls into these \n"
"golden computing machines. Now they live on, unable to communicate but "
"still\n"
" dreaming of empires."

msgid "apeoro"
msgstr "Oilcheck Oz"

msgid "araignee_description"
msgstr ""
"Pedants who say all spiders have eight legs are strangely quiet on the "
"case \n"
"of ARAIGNEE."

msgid "araignee"
msgstr "Leglock Larry"

msgid "arthrobolt_description"
msgstr ""
"It feels uncomfortable commanding its fellow NUT and BOLT, and usually "
"runs \n"
"away. But then the NUT and BOLT have no one to instruct them."

msgid "arthrobolt"
msgstr "Porrada Paul"

msgid "askylpaws_description"
msgstr ""
"It is an omen of disaster, often appearing in times of great trouble. This \n"
"has caused others to sometimes blame it for the misfortune."

msgid "askylpaws"
msgstr "Sandbag Sam"

msgid "asudopt_description"
msgstr ""
"According to legend, ASUDOPT created the world and one day will destroy "
"the \n"
"world. In the meantime, it sets the world's universal laws."

msgid "asudopt"
msgstr "Sweaty Kev"

msgid "av8r_description"
msgstr "If the sun is out, it can fly as far or as high as it likes."

msgid "av8r"
msgstr "Choke Chad"

msgid "axolightl_description"
msgstr ""
"It lights the deep waters with its tail, marking a safe shelter for fish."

msgid "axolightl"
msgstr "Tapout Tim"

msgid "b_ver_1_description"
msgstr ""
"It is designed for all those times you need something to be bitten by a \n"
"robot."

msgid "b_ver_1"
msgstr "Guard Slag"

msgid "babysnitch_description"
msgstr ""
"The fuming BABYSNITCH will throw itself into the attack, usually with "
"little\n"
" effect. But beware: if you laugh at its efforts, it will hunt you once it \n"
"grows into a BADDRSCRATCH."

msgid "babysnitch"
msgstr "Kimura Kev"

msgid "baddrscratch_description"
msgstr ""
"The furious BADDRSCRATCH is a fearsome hunter, and it will not stop in its \n"
"pursuit of its prey - even in the face of certain death."

msgid "baddrscratch"
msgstr "Mount Mick"

msgid "bamboon_description"
msgstr "It fights with its bamboo staff, which it also uses for balance."

msgid "bamboon"
msgstr "Halfguard Hal"

msgid "banling_description"
msgstr ""
"Each BANLING is waiting for a homeless spirit to nestle in its branches."

msgid "banling"
msgstr "Judo Jake"

msgid "bansaken_description"
msgstr ""
"As twilight hits, the spirits inside BANSAKEN come to life. They like to "
"add\n"
" naughty children who stay up too late to their number."

msgid "bansaken"
msgstr "Wrestle Dad"

msgid "banvengeance_description"
msgstr ""
"BANVENGEANCE seeks to make its own night by growing new trees from running \n"
"roots to drown out the light, smothering competing plant life."

msgid "banvengeance"
msgstr "Neck Crank Ned"

msgid "baobaraffe_description"
msgstr ""
"It stores mass amounts of water in its huge body so that it can travel "
"long \n"
"distances across hot, dry deserts. It will also share water with thirsty \n"
"creatures. When it has no water stored it is skinny."

msgid "baobaraffe"
msgstr "Buggy Ben"

msgid "baoby_description"
msgstr ""
"They travel from river to river in search of water to drink and store. The \n"
"leafy ossicones on its head conceal movable points that act similar to a \n"
"dowsing rod. Many creatures follow BAOBY in droughts."

msgid "baoby"
msgstr "Degen Dan"

msgid "bedoo_description"
msgstr ""
"It swallows its victims whole, forcing them into a deep sleep for a few \n"
"hours whilst it feasts on their dreams. Often, it will accidentally put \n"
"their victims into a permanent sleep."

msgid "bedoo"
msgstr "Bluebelt Ben"

msgid "beenstalker_description"
msgstr ""
"What BEENSTALKER lacks in sense and grace, it makes up for in sheer \n"
"enthusiasm and goodwill. It delights in scaring off vermin, but never \n"
"harming them."

msgid "beenstalker"
msgstr "Purple Paul"

msgid "bewhich_description"
msgstr ""
"When BEWHICH holds its breath, it can appear as a beautiful - though \n"
"sinister - human. "

msgid "bewhich"
msgstr "Brownbelt Bert"

msgid "bigfin_description"
msgstr ""
"A whole ecosystem exists on its back, so it tries not to go underwater."

msgid "bigfin"
msgstr "Blackbelt Baz"

msgid "birdee_description"
msgstr ""
"It is omnivorous, but whether it prefers meat or seed depends on its \n"
"experiences when young."

msgid "birdee"
msgstr "Fake Coach"

msgid "birdling_description"
msgstr ""
"The ignorant believe that it carries its own egg upon its back. It is the \n"
"guard for a far more important egg than that."

msgid "birdling"
msgstr "Trial Tony"

msgid "bishosand_description"
msgstr ""
"BISHOSAND is fascinated by religious or spiritual symbols it sees and "
"likes \n"
"to collect them, but is believed to not understand any of them."

msgid "bishosand"
msgstr "Creonte Carl"

msgid "blasdoor_description"
msgstr ""
"BLASDOOR shield those they care about behind their impenetrable bulk, but \n"
"macerate unwanted intruders and scrap machines between their steel teeth."

msgid "blasdoor"
msgstr "Manky Mike"

msgid "bolt_description"
msgstr ""
"The presence of a BOLT makes a NUT clamp down harder and spark more energy."

msgid "bolt"
msgstr "Spicy Steve"

msgid "boltnu_description"
msgstr ""
"It spends most of its time digging burrows into the ground, it remains "
"dizzy\n"
" from the constant vibrations and movement caused by them digging into the \n"
"soil."

msgid "boltnu"
msgstr "Gassy Gaz"

msgid "botbot_description"
msgstr "It is a universal robot that can be adapted for any purpose."

msgid "botbot"
msgstr "Toehold Tom"

msgid "boxali_description"
msgstr ""
"With its long blue cape, BOXALI can glide above the ground - allowing it "
"to \n"
"perform stunts and aerial attacks."

msgid "boxali"
msgstr "RNC Ray"

msgid "boxorox_description"
msgstr "The dumber it gets, the harder its rocky body becomes."

msgid "boxorox"
msgstr "Smash Pass Sam"

msgid "brachifor_description"
msgstr "BRACHIFOR can go without eating if it stays perfectly still."

msgid "brachifor"
msgstr "Juice Josh"

msgid "breem_description"
msgstr ""
"It punctures fruit to place new DUGGOT in them by night. By day it "
"pretends \n"
"to be a normal bee."

msgid "breem"
msgstr "Cringe Craig"

msgid "brewdin_description"
msgstr ""
"Born in neglected, once prized, pottery and similar treasures. Rumored to \n"
"grants wishes to those who can make it smile."

msgid "brewdin"
msgstr "Lazy Larry"

msgid "bricgard_description"
msgstr ""
"When the winter comes, IMBRICKCILE builds a defensive cocoon of bricks to \n"
"protect it from predators."

msgid "bricgard"
msgstr "Dojo Derek"

msgid "brickhemoth_description"
msgstr ""
"Be wary when kicking a BRICGARD's nest, because percussive force is the \n"
"trigger the tuxemon needs to burst forth once it has formed into a \n"
"BRICKHEMOTH."

msgid "brickhemoth"
msgstr "Shark Tank Sam"

msgid "brumi_description"
msgstr "Neglected brooms may be stolen by BRUMI. "

msgid "brumi"
msgstr "Nosebeer Neil"

msgid "budaye_description"
msgstr ""
"It can convince any group to cooperate for the common good with some \n"
"encouraging mewls and waves."

msgid "budaye"
msgstr "Kneeride Kev"

msgid "bugnin_description"
msgstr ""
"Its sword is actually an antenna grown and snapped off for that purpose."

msgid "bugnin"
msgstr "Pullguard Pat"

msgid "bumbulus_description"
msgstr ""
"BUMBULUS is a flying being that produces a cloud of smoke to disguise "
"itself\n"
" as a cloud. No one has ever seen its true body."

msgid "bumbulus"
msgstr "Dirty Dan"

msgid "burrlock_description"
msgstr ""
"BURRLOCK likes to stick to passerbys to help it spread from place to place."

msgid "burrlock"
msgstr "Tap Daddy"

msgid "bursa_description"
msgstr "It rejects fire as basic, and produces only the fire of the mind."

msgid "bursa"
msgstr "Gym Thot"

msgid "cacaburr_description"
msgstr ""
"CACABURR supports many pollinators like TUMBLEBEE and seed lovers like \n"
"CHICKADEE."

msgid "cacaburr"
msgstr "Acai Addict"

msgid "cackleen_description"
msgstr ""
"Some say CACKLEEN is a possessed child, others that is the lost spirit of "
"a \n"
"girl. "

msgid "cackleen"
msgstr "Blue Belt Ex"

msgid "cairfrey_description"
msgstr ""
"A jolly piece of furniture who awoke one morning and decided to explore."

msgid "cairfrey"
msgstr "Guard Goblin"

msgid "caper_description"
msgstr ""
"CAPER play and frolic with each other among the foam of mountain rivers, \n"
"cold as ice."

msgid "caper"
msgstr "Leglock Luke"

msgid "capinyah_description"
msgstr ""
"Only after intense training in the jungles, lifting logs and river "
"boulders,\n"
" can CAPITI graduate to become CAPINYAH."

msgid "capinyah"
msgstr "Wristlock Will"

msgid "capiti_description"
msgstr ""
"It looks like a baby, but some specimens have been found that are hundreds \n"
"of years old."

msgid "capiti"
msgstr "Mat Enforcer"

msgid "carcharock_description"
msgstr ""
"CARCHAROCK's ancient instincts are at odds with the modern world, where "
"the \n"
"scent of PHARFAN and the roar of PANTHERAFIRA have replaced the familiar \n"
"sounds of its homeland."

msgid "carcharock"
msgstr "Purple Perve"

msgid "cardiling_description"
msgstr "One wouldn't expect it to breathe fire, until it does."

msgid "cardiling"
msgstr "Coach Creepy"

msgid "cardinale_description"
msgstr ""
"It hates all predators with a passion, and makes war with them and their \n"
"young when it can."

msgid "cardinale"
msgstr "NoGi Niall"

msgid "cardiwing_description"
msgstr "Its song is remarkable, but few dare keep an explosive songbird."

msgid "cardiwing"
msgstr "Trial Guy"

msgid "cataspike_description"
msgstr ""
"It learns to fight from observation. Left to its own devices, it uses its \n"
"spike to pick up rubbish."

msgid "cataspike"
msgstr "Whitebelt Will"

msgid "cateye_description"
msgstr "They say it blinks once a year, in honor of summer's end."

msgid "cateye"
msgstr "Brownbelt Ben"

msgid "chenipode_description"
msgstr "It bites onto shoelaces and trouser legs when it wants to travel."

msgid "chenipode"
msgstr "Blackbelt Bob"

msgid "cherubat_description"
msgstr ""
"These inquisitive bats are drawn by the heady emotions of people in love, \n"
"and carry back unsupervised bouquets and chocolate boxes to build their \n"
"nests."

msgid "cherubat"
msgstr "Darce Dave"

msgid "chibiro_description"
msgstr ""
"It is found in forests and fields, where it is often mistaken for a turnip."

msgid "chibiro"
msgstr "Guillo Gary"

msgid "chickadee_description"
msgstr ""
"CHICKADEE gives longer repeated cries of 'dees' if the danger it senses \n"
"seems lesser than another."

msgid "chickadee"
msgstr "Armbar Andy"

msgid "chillimp_description"
msgstr ""
"It is rumored to live atop snowy mountains, but no clear photo of it has \n"
"ever been taken."

msgid "chillimp"
msgstr "Triangle Tom"

msgid "chloragon_description"
msgstr ""
"It hatches when an ancient egg is planted in fertile soil. When the eggs "
"run\n"
" out, there will be no more CHLORAGON."

msgid "chloragon"
msgstr "Berimbolo Ben"

msgid "chromeye_description"
msgstr "CHROMEYE was created to observe and learn how humans think and feel."

msgid "chromeye"
msgstr "Sambo Sam"

msgid "claymorior_description"
msgstr ""
"It is said that only one in a thousand can rule over the CLAYMORIOR as a \n"
"REGALANCE."

msgid "claymorior"
msgstr "Judo Judas"

msgid "coaldiak_description"
msgstr "This bear can set fire to anywhere and draw blood from anything."

msgid "coaldiak"
msgstr "Panic Pete"

msgid "cobarett_description"
msgstr ""
"It covers itself in thick, billowing smoke so that it can slide easily \n"
"through thick brush. The source of the smoke is its molten body "
"temperature,\n"
" which is so hot that tongues of flame shoot from its mouth."

msgid "cobarett"
msgstr "Sweat Goblin"

msgid "cochini_description"
msgstr ""
"It is as intelligent and aware as a three-year old child. It tastes \n"
"delicious."

msgid "cochini"
msgstr "Tape Finger"

msgid "cocrune_description"
msgstr "Whichever way it turns, the blood-red eye faces you."

msgid "cocrune"
msgstr "Cauli Carl"

msgid "cohldrabi_description"
msgstr ""
"It is born underground in cold, snowy areas, and learns how to fly within "
"a \n"
"few weeks."

msgid "cohldrabi"
msgstr "Shit Gi Sean"

msgid "coleorus_description"
msgstr "It has existed, unchanged, for millions of years."

msgid "coleorus"
msgstr "Toe Hold Ted"

msgid "conglolem_description"
msgstr "The gel has long ago dried out, but CONGLOLEM continues."

msgid "conglolem"
msgstr "Mouthguard Mo"

msgid "conifrost_description"
msgstr "If it sneezes, an avalanche occurs. It has a permanent sniffle."

msgid "conifrost"
msgstr "Open Mat Oz"

msgid "conileaf_description"
msgstr ""
"Foods placed in its pitcher are blended and pickled. They are used to "
"store \n"
"food without it going off."

msgid "conileaf"
msgstr "Comp Class Cam"

msgid "coppi_description"
msgstr ""
"COPPI's flowers are surprisingly bitter and smelly, but they are useful in \n"
"beer brewing and medicine."

msgid "coppi"
msgstr "Stall Steve"

msgid "coproblight_description"
msgstr ""
"Born from the feces of prehistoric Tuxemon, it used the shards of bone \n"
"within itself for defense."

msgid "coproblight"
msgstr "Grippy Greg"

msgid "corvix_description"
msgstr "It arms its wings with bone shards from its victims."

msgid "corvix"
msgstr "Underhook Ugo"

msgid "cowpignon_description"
msgstr "Some people dry it out and eat it as a medicinal enhancement."

msgid "cowpignon"
msgstr "Overhook Owen"

msgid "crankus_description"
msgstr ""
"From one mountaintop to another, CRANKUS can be heard bleating to one \n"
"another in running arguments that end only with the spring thaws."

msgid "crankus"
msgstr "Backtake Baz"

msgid "criniotherme_description"
msgstr ""
"Its mane shines during the day, grows big and red at sunset, and blows "
"away \n"
"as ash at night."

msgid "criniotherme"
msgstr "Snapdown Sid"

msgid "crustagu_description"
msgstr ""
"It fires piercing, poisonous spines from its claws to frighten away those \n"
"who threaten its underwater colonies."

msgid "crustagu"
msgstr "Ankle Pick Al"

msgid "dandicub_description"
msgstr ""
"After a litter is born, they float all over the world and never see their \n"
"family again."

msgid "dandicub"
msgstr "Collar Carl"

msgid "dandylion_description"
msgstr ""
"It gives birth to one litter in its life. Then it wanders the world trying \n"
"to find them."

msgid "dandylion"
msgstr "Lapel Larry"

msgid "dankush_description"
msgstr ""
"A DANKUSH can stop itself from burning by holding its breath, causing "
"plumes\n"
" of smoke to billow forth from each leaf."

msgid "dankush"
msgstr "Knee Slice Kai"

msgid "delfeco_description"
msgstr ""
"DELFECO's streamlined body allows for swift navigation through water, and \n"
"its intelligence is evident in its complex hunting strategies. Despite its \n"
"size, it's known for its playful nature and strong bond with its trainer."

msgid "delfeco"
msgstr "Turtle Terry"

msgid "demosnow_description"
msgstr ""
"DEMOSNOW delight in luring travelers deeper into the wilderness than is \n"
"strictly safe, promising them glory and adventure."

msgid "demosnow"
msgstr "Shrimp Sean"

msgid "devidin_description"
msgstr ""
"A dicynodont that came back to life and decided to become the dinosaur \n"
"everyone always mistakes it for."

msgid "devidin"
msgstr "Bridge Barry"

msgid "devidra_description"
msgstr ""
"Look closely, for ultra fine fur gives away it is devilishly pretending to \n"
"be a dinosaur."

msgid "devidra"
msgstr "Mounty Mike"

msgid "deviraptor_description"
msgstr ""
"The single pair of feathers on its head are fakes, hinting at its devilish \n"
"true identity."

msgid "deviraptor"
msgstr "SideCtrl Sid"

msgid "dinoflop_description"
msgstr ""
"DINOFLOP delights in quickly turning away from its attackers so their "
"blows \n"
"land on its shielded and spiny back."

msgid "dinoflop"
msgstr "Coach Big Ron"

msgid "djinnbo_description"
msgstr ""
"It is mistakenly believed that it is a human who died in a fire. Actually, \n"
"its relatives did."

msgid "djinnbo"
msgstr "Mum Said No"

msgid "doctsky_description"
msgstr ""
"The little hyena just wants to take care of others, but has a bad "
"reputation\n"
" after a movie with it as a villain came out."

msgid "doctsky"
msgstr "Mat Karen"

msgid "dollfin_description"
msgstr "Each one follows a ship from place to place, exploring the world."

msgid "dollfin"
msgstr "Drama Dan"

msgid "dracune_description"
msgstr "It is immobile during the day, but can wriggle and bite at night."

msgid "dracune"
msgstr "Daisy NoGi"

msgid "dragarbor_description"
msgstr ""
"When it feels it is coming to the end of its life, it travels to a "
"graveyard\n"
" where it plants itself. Its tail flower grows forever."

msgid "dragarbor"
msgstr "Sweaty Betty"

msgid "drashimi_description"
msgstr ""
"It lies on the ground, smelling delicious and tempting monsters to take a \n"
"bite - but when they approach, it bites them first."

msgid "drashimi"
msgstr "Bonk Barry"

msgid "drokoro_description"
msgstr ""
"Once it had a family, but it ate its parents, and it ate its children, and \n"
"it ate its mate, and it ate all of its kind."

msgid "drokoro"
msgstr "Shady Shane"

msgid "duggot_description"
msgstr ""
"When TUMBLEBEE tries to drink fruit juice, a DUGGOT may latch on and take \n"
"over its brain."

msgid "duggot"
msgstr "Creepy Craig"

msgid "dune_pincher_description"
msgstr ""
"These hermits will wrap themselves in whatever is closest. In the desert, \n"
"that is the burial shrouds of long-dead pharaohs."

msgid "dune_pincher"
msgstr "Moody Molly"

msgid "eaglace_description"
msgstr ""
"When it takes flight, clouds form. When it claps its wings, hail falls."

msgid "eaglace"
msgstr "Nasty Nancy"

msgid "elofly_description"
msgstr ""
"An ELOFLY on its own is patient and wise, but when it flocks in great \n"
"numbers it becomes violent and impulsive."

msgid "elofly"
msgstr "Porrada Pam"

msgid "elostorm_description"
msgstr ""
"Kings and queens, the ELOSTORM rule their people and have great ambition."

msgid "elostorm"
msgstr "Kimura Kim"

msgid "elowind_description"
msgstr ""
"The lieutenants of the ELOFLY family, ELOWIND shepherd the flock and keep "
"it\n"
" focused."

msgid "elowind"
msgstr "Heelhook Holly"

msgid "embazook_description"
msgstr "It is trained for use in war and it knows no other life."

msgid "embazook"
msgstr "Darce Debbie"

msgid "embra_description"
msgstr "It eats everything it can to grow big enough to become a RUPTION."

msgid "embra"
msgstr "Guillo Gina"

msgid "enduros_description"
msgstr ""
"ENDUROS is an aggressive brawler that does not pull its blows. Out of the \n"
"ring, it is quite sociable."

msgid "enduros"
msgstr "Acai Amy"

msgid "equill_description"
msgstr ""
"Its bitterness causes it to transform. It hides its ugliness in the dark."

msgid "equill"
msgstr "NoGi Nora"

msgid "eruptibus_description"
msgstr "Smiths work with it, heating up metals in its caldera."

msgid "eruptibus"
msgstr "Judo Jenny"

msgid "erythroskyte_description"
msgstr ""
"It has a friendly demeanor, but its giant syringe tail nonetheless scares \n"
"many away."

msgid "erythroskyte"
msgstr "Spazzy Sally"

msgid "eskipup_description"
msgstr "Even as a puppy, it can pull 1 ton loads."

msgid "eskipup"
msgstr "Tappy Tammy"

msgid "exapode_description"
msgstr ""
"It waves its legs to attract attention, but mostly people just run away."

msgid "exapode"
msgstr "Guard Gina"

msgid "exclawvate_description"
msgstr ""
"Often seen on construction sites, they can use their huge hands and tail "
"to \n"
"scoop up dirt and rubble. Underneath the Tuxemon are caterpillar tires, \n"
"giving them a better balance and grip while climbing heaps of rubble."

msgid "exclawvate"
msgstr "Mount Mandy"

msgid "eyenemy_description"
msgstr "It feeds on beautiful views and other spectacular sights."

msgid "eyenemy"
msgstr "Triangle Tina"

msgid "eyesore_description"
msgstr ""
"It remembers everything it has ever seen, but not the order that it has "
"seen\n"
" it in."

msgid "eyesore"
msgstr "Bonnie BlueBelt"

msgid "fancair_description"
msgstr ""
"If someone leaves their fan running when they do not need it, it comes "
"alive\n"
" and flies out the window to find someone who actually needs to be cooled."

msgid "fancair"
msgstr "Slutty Sarah"

msgid "ferricran_description"
msgstr ""
"Once, the FERRICRAN were covered all over with adamantine scales, and had \n"
"wings of mithril."

msgid "ferricran"
msgstr "Only Dans"

msgid "firomenis_description"
msgstr ""
"These tuxemon are large and tough from the many years spent as a MERLICUN. \n"
"Their jaws can crush through trees and bones, and their flight is strong \n"
"enough to carry people."

msgid "firomenis"
msgstr "Mat Bastard"

msgid "flacono_description"
msgstr ""
"It is totally unafraid of adversaries, and will attack an enemy of any "
"size \n"
"without hesitation."

msgid "flacono"
msgstr "Gi Goblin"

msgid "flambear_description"
msgstr ""
"It can be tracked from the trail of boiled berry bushes and roasted trout "
"it\n"
" leaves in its wake."

msgid "flambear"
msgstr "Heelhook Harry"

msgid "flisces_description"
msgstr ""
"It skims the surface of the water, evading detection until a powerful leap \n"
"brings its sharp fins into play."

msgid "flisces"
msgstr "Dr Kimura"

msgid "fluoresfin_description"
msgstr ""
"When threatened, it huddles together with other FLUORESFIN to create a "
"large\n"
" blinding light to disorientate predators."

msgid "fluoresfin"
msgstr "Craig NoGi"

msgid "fluttaflap_description"
msgstr ""
"It feeds on impurities, so it returns purified blood to those it sucks on."

msgid "fluttaflap"
msgstr "Wristlock Wes"

msgid "foofle_description"
msgstr "When one is in danger, all FOOFLE hear its cries, wherever they are."

msgid "foofle"
msgstr "Stinky Gi"

msgid "flounce_description"
msgstr ""
"FLOUNCE can be stubborn and solitary, flouncing all the rules unless given \n"
"good motivation."

msgid "flounce"
msgstr "Coach Atlas"

msgid "flummack_description"
msgstr ""
"FLUMMACK no longer desires to be eaten, but to eat - even other FLUMMBY "
"and \n"
"FLUMMACK go down a treat."

msgid "flummack"
msgstr "Spazzy Steve"

msgid "flummby_description"
msgstr ""
"FLUMMBY was invented by a scientist who thought food that wanted to be "
"eaten\n"
" would be more ethical. It leaps into the mouth of anyone who could eat it."

msgid "flummby"
msgstr "Acai Slut"

msgid "fordin_description"
msgstr "When threatened, it curls into a ball and bounces away."

msgid "fordin"
msgstr "Nasty Nate"

msgid "forturtle_description"
msgstr "It heats its shell to read the future from the cracks that emerge."

msgid "forturtle"
msgstr "Oilcheck Oz"

msgid "foxfire_description"
msgstr ""
"FOXFIRE cubs are found in fires that burned out overnight. No one knows \n"
"where they come from."

msgid "foxfire"
msgstr "Leglock Larry"

msgid "fribbit_description"
msgstr "It is said that it was once a boy who licked a freezing lamp post."

msgid "fribbit"
msgstr "Sandbag Sam"

msgid "frondly_description"
msgstr ""
"It can do anything with its prehensile tail, even shake hands and pick \n"
"fruit."

msgid "frondly"
msgstr "Sweaty Kev"

msgid "frostuce_description"
msgstr "One rarely expects to see green waltzing around in a snowstorm."

msgid "frostuce"
msgstr "Choke Chad"

msgid "fruitera_description"
msgstr ""
"FRUITERA is greedy for fruit, and carries as much as it can. When "
"startled, \n"
"it drops all its fruit, gathers it all up again, and only then runs away."

msgid "fruitera"
msgstr "Tapout Tim"

msgid "furnursus_description"
msgstr ""
"FURNURSUS are friendly, and often forget that their bodies are too hot for \n"
"others to touch."

msgid "furnursus"
msgstr "Guard Slag"

msgid "fuzzina_description"
msgstr ""
"When the child that abandoned a FUZZLET needs it again, it becomes a \n"
"FUZZINA, a brave protector and nurturer of the small and the weak."

msgid "fuzzina"
msgstr "Kimura Kev"

msgid "fuzzlet_description"
msgstr ""
"When a child is no longer around to play with their toys, they sometimes \n"
"come to life."

msgid "fuzzlet"
msgstr "Mount Mick"

msgid "galasces_description"
msgstr "GALASCES can distort its shape to engulf prey its own size."

msgid "galasces"
msgstr "Halfguard Hal"

msgid "galnec_description"
msgstr ""
"GALNEC buries itself deep in the hot sands of the desert, only its stony \n"
"tail above ground. In packs, they look like gardens of stone."

msgid "galnec"
msgstr "Judo Jake"

msgid "gastronium_description"
msgstr ""
"GASTRONIUM can eat almost anything but prefers heavy, radioactive materials."

msgid "gastronium"
msgstr "Wrestle Dad"

msgid "gectile_description"
msgstr "It is so quick and light that it can walk on leaves."

msgid "gectile"
msgstr "Neck Crank Ned"

msgid "ghosteeth_description"
msgstr "It smiles because it knows how everyone it meets is going to die."

msgid "ghosteeth"
msgstr "Buggy Ben"

msgid "dynastor_description"
msgstr ""
"DYNASTOR is a massive insectoid tuxemon with a deep, armored exoskeleton\n"
" and distinctive wings running along its back. Its mandibles can crush \n"
"steel. "

msgid "dynastor"
msgstr "Rough Rachel"

msgid "gliffary_description"
msgstr ""
"A mischievous fey creature that is rarely seen, it gathers by mushroom "
"rings\n"
" and melts iron zealously."

msgid "gliffary"
msgstr "Degen Dan"

msgid "glombroc_description"
msgstr ""
"It stores its memories in its rocky shell. If some fall off, it is \n"
"forgetful."

msgid "glombroc"
msgstr "Mat Rat"

msgid "glomon_description"
msgstr ""
"A colony of bacteria that became new life in a discarded medical glove. It \n"
"can see out of the back of its body."

msgid "glomon"
msgstr "Bluebelt Ben"

msgid "golnagi_description"
msgstr ""
"GOLNAGI's scales glow, making it almost invisible in the water during dawn \n"
"and dusk - its preferred times for hunting."

msgid "golnagi"
msgstr "Purple Paul"

msgid "gourda_description"
msgstr ""
"Competitions to grow the largest GOURDA have resulted in some reaching one \n"
"ton in weight, but normal GOURDA are much smaller."

msgid "gourda"
msgstr "Brownbelt Bert"

msgid "graffiki_description"
msgstr ""
"GRAFFIKI are as at home in cities as they are in the jungle, tagging their \n"
"territory with elaborate paintings."

msgid "graffiki"
msgstr "Blackbelt Baz"

msgid "grimachin_description"
msgstr "It was made by a toy company to be a pet, but was too dangerous."

msgid "grimachin"
msgstr "Fake Coach"

msgid "grinflare_description"
msgstr "It is said that each is the walking heart of a volcano."

msgid "grinflare"
msgstr "Trial Tony"

msgid "grintot_description"
msgstr "It is a GRINTROCK or GRINFLARE that has experienced erosion."

msgid "grintot"
msgstr "Creonte Carl"

msgid "grintrock_description"
msgstr ""
"It feeds by sitting out in thunderstorms, waiting to be struck by lightning."

msgid "grintrock"
msgstr "Manky Mike"

msgid "grumpi_description"
msgstr ""
"Once grabbed by a GRUMPI, its sticky tacky body is impossible to escape \n"
"from."

msgid "grumpi"
msgstr "Spicy Steve"

msgid "gryfix_description"
msgstr "Bone armor protects GRYFIX from all but the most powerful of attacks."

msgid "gryfix"
msgstr "Gassy Gaz"

msgid "gupphire_description"
msgstr ""
"GUPPHIRE's scales sparkle, making it a stunning sight to behold. Fishers "
"who\n"
" see a GUPPHIRE believe it means they will have good luck all year."

msgid "gupphire"
msgstr "Toehold Tom"

msgid "gupphish_description"
msgstr ""
"GUPPHISH loves to swim in schools, making it a popular choice for trainers \n"
"who value teamwork."

msgid "gupphish"
msgstr "RNC Ray"

msgid "hampotamos_description"
msgstr "It nibbles on RINOCEREED, clearing away dead skin, moss and weeds."

msgid "hampotamos"
msgstr "Smash Pass Sam"

msgid "happito_description"
msgstr ""
"Why can't people always be happy? HAPPITO will give them exactly what they \n"
"want, even if it is not what they need."

msgid "happito"
msgstr "Juice Josh"

msgid "hatchling_description"
msgstr ""
"When an egg does not want to hatch and begin its next life stage, it "
"becomes\n"
" a HATCHLING."

msgid "hatchling"
msgstr "Cringe Craig"

msgid "hectapod_description"
msgstr ""
"When it inflates its dome, it floats to the top of oceans, or even through \n"
"mist and clouds."

msgid "hectapod"
msgstr "Lazy Larry"

msgid "helipi_description"
msgstr ""
"It flies farther with one wing by rotating than with two, but sacrifices "
"the\n"
" ability to easily aim."

msgid "helipi"
msgstr "Dojo Derek"

msgid "heronquak_description"
msgstr ""
"The crystal on its chest is mistaken for a diamond by poachers. It melts \n"
"when it is removed from HERONQUAK's body."

msgid "heronquak"
msgstr "Shark Tank Sam"

msgid "hissiorite_description"
msgstr ""
"The base of its neck emits super-heated gas that envelopes its body and \n"
"causes it to hover a few inches off the ground, similar to a hot air \n"
"balloon. Because of this it can travel quickly, even over water."

msgid "hissiorite"
msgstr "Nosebeer Neil"

msgid "hoarse_description"
msgstr "It appears to be a farm animal, but it was mistreated by its owner."

msgid "hoarse"
msgstr "Kneeride Kev"

msgid "hoarseshoo_description"
msgstr "It is what is left when an EQUILL's shadow eats its body."

msgid "hoarseshoo"
msgstr "Pullguard Pat"

msgid "hoodoll_description"
msgstr ""
"It sometimes sticks a pin in itself to curse its foes, but no one can tell \n"
"the difference after."

msgid "hoodoll"
msgstr "Dirty Dan"

msgid "hotline_description"
msgstr ""
"These curious creatures can leap great distances, letting out a strange, \n"
"tinny cry that cannot be escaped however far their prey runs."

msgid "hotline"
msgstr "Tap Daddy"

msgid "houndice_description"
msgstr ""
"HOUNDICE loves sledding, but it can also sniff out lost hikers under snow."

msgid "houndice"
msgstr "Gym Thot"

msgid "howl_description"
msgstr ""
"HOWL's foolish exterior hides deep wisdom - if only it could communicate "
"it,\n"
" but its words come out as hoots and howls."

msgid "howl"
msgstr "Acai Addict"

msgid "hydrone_description"
msgstr "It utilizes an experimental technology that creates power from water."

msgid "hydrone"
msgstr "Blue Belt Ex"

msgid "ignibus_description"
msgstr ""
"When threatened it retreats into its shell and cools down dramatically by \n"
"venting steam. It could be mistaken for a rock."

msgid "ignibus"
msgstr "Guard Goblin"

msgid "imbrickcile_description"
msgstr ""
"IMBRICKCILE shelter inside a single brick, emerging only to lift it to "
"build\n"
" their strength."

msgid "imbrickcile"
msgstr "Leglock Luke"

msgid "incandesfin_description"
msgstr ""
"Its entire body has massively grown in size. However, its light is still "
"the\n"
" exact same."

msgid "incandesfin"
msgstr "Wristlock Will"

msgid "jelillow_description"
msgstr ""
"When a person rests their head on JELILLOW, its jelly-like skin causes "
"them \n"
"to fall into a deep sleep. If someone is having sleeping problems, then "
"this\n"
" monster will be used to help them."

msgid "jelillow"
msgstr "Mat Enforcer"

msgid "jeluna_description"
msgstr ""
"The moon exercises its strange influence on Jeluna, causing these aerial \n"
"jellyfish to change their forms over the course of a month."

msgid "jeluna"
msgstr "Purple Perve"

msgid "jemuar_description"
msgstr ""
"The gems on its back are the type found when it was born. There are \n"
"extensive ROCKITTEN breeding facilities over diamond veins."

msgid "jemuar"
msgstr "Coach Creepy"

msgid "joulraton_description"
msgstr ""
"Its static coat of bristly fur attracts seeds, flowers and feathers, which \n"
"it uses for food or nesting materials."

msgid "joulraton"
msgstr "NoGi Niall"

msgid "k9_description"
msgstr "It is a helpful companion that can pull a tonne of weight."

msgid "k9"
msgstr "Trial Guy"

msgid "katacoon_description"
msgstr ""
"It stays in a meditative pose for its chrysalis, moving only to jab enemies."

msgid "katacoon"
msgstr "Whitebelt Will"

msgid "katapill_description"
msgstr ""
"It is born fighting. It has to punch out of its eggshell or be trapped."

msgid "katapill"
msgstr "Brownbelt Ben"

msgid "kernel_description"
msgstr ""
"KERNEL is a core component of the monster system (kennel) and item system \n"
"(locker), and serves as the main interface between the computer's physical \n"
"hardware and the processes running on it. Known as JAS-KERI-BIT from its \n"
"creators."

msgid "kernel"
msgstr "Blackbelt Bob"

msgid "knightsand_description"
msgstr ""
"KNIGHTSAND patrols around sand castles inhabits by PAWSAND, but is "
"terrible \n"
"at building them."

msgid "knightsand"
msgstr "Darce Dave"

msgid "knindling_description"
msgstr "Any spark from a stone KNINDLING happily tenders into a fire."

msgid "knindling"
msgstr "Guillo Gary"

msgid "komodraw_description"
msgstr ""
"It uses its claws to carve its firearm out of wood, and uses it for "
"powerful\n"
" ranged attacks."

msgid "komodraw"
msgstr "Armbar Andy"

msgid "komoduel_description"
msgstr ""
"Many a wrongdoer has fled town after seeing just the silhouette of an \n"
"approaching KOMODUEL."

msgid "komoduel"
msgstr "Triangle Tom"

msgid "konuit_description"
msgstr ""
"In some places KONUIT is called 'drop bear' and believed to fall on \n"
"unsuspecting heads below."

msgid "konuit"
msgstr "Berimbolo Ben"

msgid "kroki_description"
msgstr ""
"KROKI spends most of its time in shallow waters, using its powerful jaws "
"to \n"
"snap at prey."

msgid "kroki"
msgstr "Kesa Ken"

msgid "krokivip_description"
msgstr ""
"This venomous crocodilian enjoys ambushing from the water. As it grows \n"
"closer to evolution, it seeks out larger bodies of water."

msgid "krokivip"
msgstr "Sambo Sam"

msgid "lambert_description"
msgstr ""
"It is placed in its nut by its parent, who then sends it into the world."

msgid "lambert"
msgstr "Panic Pete"

msgid "lapinou_description"
msgstr ""
"When SQUABBITS were taken as fashionable pets, they adapted to domestic "
"life\n"
" and lost their violent natures."

msgid "lapinou"
msgstr "Sweat Goblin"

msgid "legko_description"
msgstr "Long thought to be legless, its leaves are actually vestigial limbs."

msgid "legko"
msgstr "Tape Finger"

msgid "legoplaste_description"
msgstr ""
"It has a very fluid shape and may hunt by sending out random tendrils to \n"
"sniff or touch nearby prey."

msgid "legoplaste"
msgstr "Cauli Carl"

msgid "lendos_description"
msgstr "When two UNEYE become tangled, they form a single unified LENDOS."

msgid "lendos"
msgstr "Shit Gi Sean"

msgid "lesmagu_description"
msgstr ""
"It oozes along the sea floor, looking for hard nooks and crannies to hide "
"in\n"
" until it develops its shell."

msgid "lesmagu"
msgstr "Toe Hold Ted"

msgid "lettice_description"
msgstr "Cold weather concentrates the power and vitality of LETTICE."

msgid "lettice"
msgstr "Mouthguard Mo"

msgid "leviadile_description"
msgstr ""
"With its immense size and powerful venomous jaws, LEVIADILE is a dominant \n"
"predator of the deep sea."

msgid "leviadile"
msgstr "Open Mat Oz"

msgid "lightmare_description"
msgstr ""
"It lurks in the depths of the ocean, luring any unsuspecting prey using "
"its \n"
"light right into its large, gaping mouth."

msgid "lightmare"
msgstr "Comp Class Cam"

msgid "loliferno_description"
msgstr ""
"It is said that the LOLIFERNO's fire could not be extinguished. Yet, "
"despite\n"
" its power, LOLIFERNO has a playful side, and is known to dance among the \n"
"flames it creates."

msgid "loliferno"
msgstr "Stall Steve"

msgid "lucifice_description"
msgstr ""
"Is it the wind howling through the trees, or LUCIFICE calling the dark \n"
"spirits of the night to join its hunt?"

msgid "lucifice"
msgstr "Grippy Greg"

msgid "lunight_description"
msgstr ""
"LUNIGHT is the guardian of the night, and can control the moon and its \n"
"phases."

msgid "lunight"
msgstr "Underhook Ugo"

msgid "magmaturtle_description"
msgstr ""
"When threatened it retreats into its shell and cools down dramatically by \n"
"venting steam. It could be mistaken for a rock."

msgid "magmaturtle"
msgstr "Magmaturtle"

msgid "manosting_description"
msgstr "It floats across the tops of cities, contemplating sharks."

msgid "manosting"
msgstr "Overhook Owen"

msgid "marvantis_description"
msgstr ""
"When it evolves, the only trace of its original mimicry is its red \n"
"ornaments."

msgid "marvantis"
msgstr "Backtake Baz"

msgid "marvillar_description"
msgstr ""
"MARVILLAR mimes an ant larva using scent. It convinces SCARLANT and \n"
"MYRMISON to feed it, eating skeptics."

msgid "marvillar"
msgstr "Snapdown Sid"

msgid "masknake_description"
msgstr ""
"When frightened or aggressive, it flashes a beautiful pattern with its tail."

msgid "masknake"
msgstr "Ankle Pick Al"

msgid "mauai_description"
msgstr ""
"MAUAI gives itself over to the spirits of lost warriors trapped inside its \n"
"weapon."

msgid "mauai"
msgstr "Blast Dan"

msgid "medipup_description"
msgstr ""
"When MEDIPUP sniff out sickness, they bounce over and nuzzle the affected \n"
"creature. MEDIPUP's wet noses are effective, but some patients have been \n"
"crushed under an overly enthusiastic pack."

msgid "medipup"
msgstr "Collar Carl"

msgid "medushock_description"
msgstr ""
"Tend to stay away from shore and known to be aggressive to people. "
"Stingers \n"
"are used to stun its prey. Swim safely."

msgid "medushock"
msgstr "Lapel Larry"

msgid "megafruitera_description"
msgstr ""
"It has slightly better self control than its younger form, enlarging its \n"
"nest first if it needs to for extra fruit."

msgid "megafruitera"
msgstr "Knee Slice Kai"

msgid "memnomnom_description"
msgstr "It is said that each one's mask is the face of a different dead king."

msgid "memnomnom"
msgstr "Pressure Pat"

msgid "merlicun_description"
msgstr ""
"Merlicun is a hardy insect that has evolved to be efficient at both attack \n"
"and defense. They gather in the tree canopies of ancient forests to feed "
"on \n"
"fruits and leaves."

msgid "merlicun"
msgstr "Turtle Terry"

msgid "metesaur_description"
msgstr ""
"This Tuxemon would enjoy diving into the ground and leaving marks. \n"
"Sometimes, the Tuxemon would misjudge the hit and land in trees, starting \n"
"huge and dangerous forest fires."

msgid "metesaur"
msgstr "Shrimp Sean"

msgid "metoxic_description"
msgstr ""
"METOXIC sometimes acts as a flag for PAWSAND castles, spewing poisonous \n"
"fumes everywhere."

msgid "metoxic"
msgstr "Bridge Barry"

msgid "miaownolith_description"
msgstr "It can speak the human tongue, but only to say cryptic riddles."

msgid "miaownolith"
msgstr "Mounty Mike"

msgid "mingdyn_description"
msgstr ""
"Every 12 years, a single MINGDYN egg is laid. Its discovery marks a time "
"of \n"
"renewal and upheaval across the land."

msgid "mingdyn"
msgstr "SideCtrl Sid"

msgid "moloch_description"
msgstr "It can stiffen or soften its skin to respond to friends and foes."

msgid "moloch"
msgstr "Bonk Barry"

msgid "mrmoswitch_description"
msgstr ""
"These cheeky robots are used for their fine motor skills, but they love \n"
"pranks."

msgid "mrmoswitch"
msgstr "Shady Shane"

msgid "myrmison_description"
msgstr ""
"MYRMISON queens will emerge on humid days to try to establish new "
"colonies. \n"
"This is a very dangerous time for them."

msgid "myrmison"
msgstr "Creepy Craig"

msgid "mystikapi_description"
msgstr ""
"The MYSTIKAPI's saliva augments psychic powers. It licks its eyes and ears \n"
"to heighten its senses."

msgid "mystikapi"
msgstr "Moody Molly"

msgid "narcileaf_description"
msgstr ""
"When a SHYBULB has restored a garden to glory, it morphs and proudly takes \n"
"credit for its work."

msgid "narcileaf"
msgstr "Rough Rachel"

msgid "nebufin_description"
msgstr ""
"NEBUFIN's angelic appearance is deceptive, as the monster is predatory."

msgid "nebufin"
msgstr "Nasty Nancy"

msgid "ned_description"
msgstr ""
"NED has a rivalry with KONUIT, but KONUIT sleeps through most of their \n"
"arguments."

msgid "ned"
msgstr "Porrada Pam"

msgid "neutrito_description"
msgstr "NEUTRITO feels nothing. The perfect machine?"

msgid "neutrito"
msgstr "Kimura Kim"

msgid "nimbulex_description"
msgstr ""
"NIMBULEX dresses itself in sparks and storm clouds to protect its delicate \n"
"inner core."

msgid "nimbulex"
msgstr "Heelhook Holly"

msgid "ninjasmine_description"
msgstr "NINJASMINE poisons his opponents quickly using his two poison swords."

msgid "ninjasmine"
msgstr "Darce Debbie"

msgid "noctalo_description"
msgstr ""
"It inhabits only places abandoned by humans - castles, graveyards and \n"
"sewers."

msgid "noctalo"
msgstr "Guillo Gina"

msgid "noctula_description"
msgstr ""
"It eats fruit and PIPIS eat bugs, so despite living in close proximity "
"they \n"
"do not compete."

msgid "noctula"
msgstr "Acai Amy"

msgid "nostray_description"
msgstr "It can smell anything in the ocean, no matter how far away."

msgid "nostray"
msgstr "NoGi Nora"

msgid "novaquarius_description"
msgstr ""
"A NOVAQUARIUS sting sends the unwary to the hospital, but BUBBITOISE have \n"
"developed immunity and will nibble on them."

msgid "novaquarius"
msgstr "Judo Jenny"

msgid "nudiflot_female_description"
msgstr "It eats and stores the poison of the sea creatures that it feeds upon."

msgid "nudiflot_female"
msgstr "Spazzy Sally"

msgid "nudiflot_male_description"
msgstr ""
"Its feathery antennas snap off if it is attacked, confusing the predator."

msgid "nudiflot_male"
msgstr "Tappy Tammy"

msgid "nudikill_description"
msgstr ""
"They are called Dark Bishops because their heads are reminiscent of a \n"
"bishop's hat."

msgid "nudikill"
msgstr "Guard Gina"

msgid "nudimind_description"
msgstr "It dreams of oceans under other skies."

msgid "nudimind"
msgstr "Mount Mandy"

msgid "nuenflu_description"
msgstr "It snuggles in homes in the winter months, spreading diseases."

msgid "nuenflu"
msgstr "Triangle Tina"

msgid "nut_description"
msgstr ""
"In the great ships that cross the oceans, thousands of NUT and BOLT "
"provide \n"
"power and hold the steel plating together."

msgid "nut"
msgstr "Bonnie BlueBelt"

msgid "octabode_description"
msgstr ""
"OCTABODE make ancient vessels and artifacts their homes, dreaming of the \n"
"lives of those who used the relics before them."

msgid "octabode"
msgstr "Vegan Niall"

msgid "ouroboutlet_description"
msgstr ""
"The circuit focuses energy, creating a new type of electricity called \n"
"griefed-lightning."

msgid "ouroboutlet"
msgstr "Slutty Sarah"

msgid "pairagrim_description"
msgstr ""
"One of PAIRAGRIM's heads is always searching for prey, while the other \n"
"focuses on flying at great speed."

msgid "pairagrim"
msgstr "Only Dans"

msgid "pairagrin_description"
msgstr ""
"The young form of Pairagrim, it is a generally happy creature. It "
"struggles \n"
"to fly until the two heads learn to work together."

msgid "pairagrin"
msgstr "Mat Bastard"

msgid "pantherafira_description"
msgstr ""
"Each member of the pride lights their mane from a shared bonfire. As long "
"as\n"
" that fire burns, their strength is shared."

msgid "pantherafira"
msgstr "Gi Goblin"

msgid "parappi_description"
msgstr ""
"When cut PARAPPI oozes syrup that seals and hardens over its enemies, \n"
"turning them to amber."

msgid "parappi"
msgstr "Heelhook Harry"

msgid "pawsand_description"
msgstr ""
"PAWSAND inhabits sand castles and sand temples made by BISHOSAND and \n"
"ROOKSAND, some of which are actually ROOKSAND itself."

msgid "pawsand"
msgstr "Dr Kimura"

msgid "pearamanca_description"
msgstr ""
"PEARAMANCA sells insurance to innocent people just trying to buy fruit, \n"
"which makes it the most terrifying monster of all."

msgid "pearamanca"
msgstr "Coach Atlas"

msgid "pharavion_description"
msgstr ""
"After great effort, a trainer may evolve a clumsy PHARFAN calf into its \n"
"adult form, which gracefully floats despite its huge size."

msgid "pharavion"
msgstr "Spazzy Steve"

msgid "pharfan_description"
msgstr ""
"At the watering hole it keeps its friends RINOCEREED and HAMPOTAMOS well \n"
"watered."

msgid "pharfan"
msgstr "Acai Slut"

msgid "picc_description"
msgstr "It accompanies divers, providing much needed oxygen."

msgid "picc"
msgstr "Craig NoGi"

msgid "pickoon_description"
msgstr ""
"It enjoys picking things up and stuffing them discreetly into its scarf."

msgid "pickoon"
msgstr "Wristlock Wes"

msgid "pigabyte_description"
msgstr "Scientists found that the best computers have organic implants."

msgid "pigabyte"
msgstr "Stinky Gi"

msgid "pilthropus_description"
msgstr ""
"Found alongside Tuxemon such as RHINCUS, PILTHROPUS was one of the oldest \n"
"Tuxemon able to create its own tools."

msgid "pilthropus"
msgstr "Nasty Nate"

msgid "pipis_description"
msgstr "Its cries are considered a bad omen, but it is a gentle creature."

msgid "pipis"
msgstr "Oilcheck Oz"

msgid "poinchin_description"
msgstr ""
"POINCHIN make nests in the coral and can be tempted out by bread and milk."

msgid "poinchin"
msgstr "Leglock Larry"

msgid "polyrock_description"
msgstr ""
"It disguises itself as a human child to sneak into dojos and learn from \n"
"martial arts masters."

msgid "polyrock"
msgstr "Porrada Paul"

msgid "possessun_description"
msgstr "It is a ghost that inhabits a dead CAIRFREY."

msgid "possessun"
msgstr "Sandbag Sam"

msgid "potturmeist_description"
msgstr ""
"POTTURMEIST are spirits of the dead that take refuge in empty vessels. In \n"
"ancient temples, acolytes must distract the monsters lest they interrupt \n"
"important ceremonies."

msgid "potturmeist"
msgstr "Sweaty Kev"

msgid "potturney_description"
msgstr ""
"By the time a POTTURMEIST has reached its maturity, its protective urn has \n"
"so changed shape that it resembles no pottery made by human hands. Some \n"
"insist that the designs on a POTTURMEIST's urn are writings from the far \n"
"future."

msgid "potturney"
msgstr "Choke Chad"

msgid "primordia_description"
msgstr "It is rumored to be the ancestor of all tuxemon."

msgid "primordia"
msgstr "Tapout Tim"

msgid "propellercat_description"
msgstr "Is it a new species, or just the pet of an inventor?"

msgid "propellercat"
msgstr "Guard Slag"

msgid "prophetoise_description"
msgstr "Its heavenly fire is something foes rarely see coming."

msgid "prophetoise"
msgstr "Kimura Kev"

msgid "puparmor_description"
msgstr ""
"Its cocoon is so hard, people are knocked out if a PUPARMOR is dropped on \n"
"them. They were once loaded into cannons and catapults."

msgid "puparmor"
msgstr "Mount Mick"

msgid "pyraminx_description"
msgstr ""
"It has a tomb hidden somewhere in the land. If it finds it, it can sleep."

msgid "pyraminx"
msgstr "Halfguard Hal"

msgid "pythock_description"
msgstr ""
"Using its shadow puppets, it can use them to fight its opponent with great \n"
"accuracy and speed. They are much more confident, and will sometimes even \n"
"use their shadow puppets to entertain small children at puppet shows."

msgid "pythock"
msgstr "Judo Jake"

msgid "pythonova_description"
msgstr ""
"It is short tempered and when enraged, the flames on its back burn hotter \n"
"and its smoke tail becomes thicker and longer. It uses its smoke tail to \n"
"coil around and smother its target."

msgid "pythonova"
msgstr "Wrestle Dad"

msgid "pythwire_description"
msgstr ""
"Observations of wild PYTHWIRE inspired the inventor of the first "
"electrical \n"
"outlet."

msgid "pythwire"
msgstr "Neck Crank Ned"

msgid "qetzlrokilus_description"
msgstr ""
"This Tuxemon would dive into groups of other dinosaur Tuxemon and burn "
"them.\n"
" They also enjoy setting forests alight and dropping their ashes into "
"water \n"
"to spoil its purity."

msgid "qetzlrokilus"
msgstr "Buggy Ben"

msgid "rabbitosaur_description"
msgstr ""
"Its tunnels are extensive and wide, the site of tremendous wars between \n"
"burrows."

msgid "rabbitosaur"
msgstr "Mat Rat"

msgid "raccscal_description"
msgstr ""
"It has a baglike tail on its back that it can open and close, and even \n"
"detach and throw at enemies."

msgid "raccscal"
msgstr "Bluebelt Ben"

msgid "raptoucan_description"
msgstr "It is formidable and aggressive, but only eats fruit."

msgid "raptoucan"
msgstr "Purple Paul"

msgid "regalance_description"
msgstr "It can summon a halberd whenever it needs."

msgid "regalance"
msgstr "Brownbelt Bert"

msgid "rhincus_description"
msgstr "It has some properties of a reptile and some of a bird."

msgid "rhincus"
msgstr "Blackbelt Baz"

msgid "rhinocarpe_description"
msgstr ""
"RHINOCARPE are territorial, charging headfirst at any who swim too near to \n"
"their coral fortresses."

msgid "rhinocarpe"
msgstr "Fake Coach"

msgid "rinocereed_description"
msgstr ""
"It is voraciously hungry because it grows so quickly - and it does not "
"limit\n"
" itself to plants."

msgid "rinocereed"
msgstr "Trial Tony"

msgid "rockat_description"
msgstr "Despite its considerable weight, its footfalls are silent."

msgid "rockat"
msgstr "Creonte Carl"

msgid "rockitten_description"
msgstr "It uses its tiny rock ears for snuggling."

msgid "rockitten"
msgstr "Manky Mike"

msgid "rooksand_description"
msgstr ""
"ROOKSAND sometimes allows those it deems worthy to live inside its \n"
"sandcastle, and crushes all others."

msgid "rooksand"
msgstr "Gassy Gaz"

msgid "rosarin_description"
msgstr "ROSARIN's love is incredible, he's only asking some affection."

msgid "rosarin"
msgstr "Toehold Tom"

msgid "ruffalo_description"
msgstr ""
"RUFFALO possess incredible strength and can charge at high speeds, capable \n"
"of knocking over trees and small buildings."

msgid "ruffalo"
msgstr "RNC Ray"

msgid "runesquito_description"
msgstr ""
"The blood-red marking is RUNESQUITO. The rest is just a rocky shell it "
"rides\n"
" alongside."

msgid "runesquito"
msgstr "Smash Pass Sam"

msgid "ruption_description"
msgstr ""
"Once EMBRA's flame becomes hot enough, it engulfs its entire body, \n"
"essentially replacing it in the process."

msgid "ruption"
msgstr "Juice Josh"

msgid "sadito_description"
msgstr ""
"When a person is feeling too sad, SADITO will carry that burden for them."

msgid "sadito"
msgstr "Cringe Craig"

msgid "sampsack_description"
msgstr ""
"A scientist wanted to separate his personalities, but he split his body."

msgid "sampsack"
msgstr "Lazy Larry"

msgid "sampsage_description"
msgstr ""
"A scientist took a drug that made him clever by day and violent by night."

msgid "sampsage"
msgstr "Dojo Derek"

msgid "sapragon_description"
msgstr ""
"In olden times, each element had a mighty dragon - but those creatures "
"have \n"
"diminished and are rare in these days."

msgid "sapragon"
msgstr "Shark Tank Sam"

msgid "sapsnap_description"
msgstr "Its terrific anger is off putting, but it passes quickly."

msgid "sapsnap"
msgstr "Nosebeer Neil"

msgid "saurchin_description"
msgstr ""
"By night, SAURCHIN emerge from the coral reefs to hunt bigger prey on land."

msgid "saurchin"
msgstr "Kneeride Kev"

msgid "scarlant_description"
msgstr "Its worst enemy is MARVILLAR, which pretends to be its kin."

msgid "scarlant"
msgstr "Pullguard Pat"

msgid "sclairus_description"
msgstr ""
"When a crop is left unharvested - be it from laziness or disaster - its \n"
"scarecrow becomes a dark and living creature."

msgid "sclairus"
msgstr "Dirty Dan"

msgid "seirein_description"
msgstr ""
"It grows lonely in the swamps, so it burns brightly to draw travelers near \n"
"- but it is painfully shy and flits away when they approach."

msgid "seirein"
msgstr "Tap Daddy"

msgid "selket_description"
msgstr ""
"Lying in wait beneath the sand, they can feel their prey through the \n"
"vibrations of their footsteps."

msgid "selket"
msgstr "Gym Thot"

msgid "selmatek_description"
msgstr ""
"Kept by the ancient kings of the deserts, SELMATEK served as watchdogs, \n"
"hunting companions and - now - defenders against grave robbers."

msgid "selmatek"
msgstr "Acai Addict"

msgid "seraphice_description"
msgstr ""
"SERAPHICE can freeze in ice moments of great courage and joy, stored away "
"in\n"
" deep vaults beneath the mountains for the days when humanity will need "
"them\n"
" most."

msgid "seraphice"
msgstr "Blue Belt Ex"

msgid "shammer_description"
msgstr "In ancient times it hunted RHINCUS beneath ashen skies."

msgid "shammer"
msgstr "Guard Goblin"

msgid "sharpfin_description"
msgstr ""
"It is invisible in the water, being visible only when it leaps out of the \n"
"water to drag animals on the shore back into the deep."

msgid "sharpfin"
msgstr "Leglock Luke"

msgid "shelagu_description"
msgstr ""
"It wards off attackers by poisoning its spiky shell with goo spat from its \n"
"mouth."

msgid "shelagu"
msgstr "Wristlock Will"

msgid "sheye_description"
msgstr ""
"SHEYE are weighed down by heavy thoughts. Edgy trainers like them for "
"their \n"
"sinister appearance and solemn demeanor."

msgid "sheye"
msgstr "Mat Enforcer"

msgid "shimmerain_description"
msgstr ""
"They say that when a rainbow appears over water, the SHIMMERAIN are \n"
"spawning."

msgid "shimmerain"
msgstr "Purple Perve"

msgid "shnark_description"
msgstr ""
"SHNARK wears its last meal's flesh as a disguise so it can get close to "
"its \n"
"trusting prey."

msgid "shnark"
msgstr "Coach Creepy"

msgid "shrab_description"
msgstr ""
"When a SHEYE frees its mind from always contemplating serious thoughts, it \n"
"becomes a SHRAB, free in body to wander the world."

msgid "shrab"
msgstr "NoGi Niall"

msgid "shybulb_description"
msgstr ""
"When a garden is neglected, a SHYBULB moves in and quietly tends the "
"droopy \n"
"plants."

msgid "shybulb"
msgstr "Whitebelt Will"

msgid "shull_description"
msgstr ""
"SHULL doesn't need to eat or move, but it still enjoys treats and \n"
"supplements from its favorite person, especially if it is regularly being \n"
"sent into battle."

msgid "shull"
msgstr "Trial Guy"

msgid "skwib_description"
msgstr ""
"The SKWIB contentedly floats through the ocean, examining potential shell-\n"
"homes. It has to fear for its life before it will finally make a choice."

msgid "skwib"
msgstr "Brownbelt Ben"

msgid "slichen_description"
msgstr ""
"It is a gel that sparked to life and begins making a body for itself of \n"
"stone and rock."

msgid "slichen"
msgstr "Blackbelt Bob"

msgid "sludgehog_description"
msgstr ""
"It lives in rubbish, and eats it too. Its spikes seem sharp, but it can \n"
"soften them at will."

msgid "sludgehog"
msgstr "Darce Dave"

msgid "snaki_description"
msgstr ""
"SNAKI is a snake that has learned to grow legs by examining the motion of \n"
"lizards and crocodiles."

msgid "snaki"
msgstr "Guillo Gary"

msgid "snarlon_description"
msgstr ""
"It does not fly, but its feet never touch the ground. The king of paradox."

msgid "snarlon"
msgstr "Armbar Andy"

msgid "snock_description"
msgstr ""
"The snake-like creature hides under the safety of its sock cover. If \n"
"startled, it will flail and lie very still on the ground to avoid attention."

msgid "snock"
msgstr "Triangle Tom"

msgid "snokari_description"
msgstr "The two heads of SNOKARI each hold great wisdom, but they never agree."

msgid "snokari"
msgstr "Berimbolo Ben"

msgid "snowrilla_description"
msgstr "It delights in playing tag with skiers on desolate slopes."

msgid "snowrilla"
msgstr "Kesa Ken"

msgid "sockeserp_description"
msgstr ""
"An otherwise formidable enemy, SOCKESERP is easily dispatched if it gets \n"
"tangled up."

msgid "sockeserp"
msgstr "Sambo Sam"

msgid "solight_description"
msgstr ""
"A villainous team is plotting to use SOLIGHT to create a miniature sun in \n"
"order to create a new planet."

msgid "solight"
msgstr "Judo Judas"

msgid "spectera_description"
msgstr ""
"This leaf-winged bat is omnivorous, but prefers fruit. Both the male and \n"
"female look after young."

msgid "spectera"
msgstr "Panic Pete"

msgid "sphake_description"
msgstr ""
"SPHAKE is sometimes responsible for small earthquakes that inconveniently \n"
"vibrate books and cups off your shelves; it eats whatever falls down."

msgid "sphake"
msgstr "Sweat Goblin"

msgid "spighter_description"
msgstr ""
"It's not fair that something so good at sneaking up on people, can't be \n"
"snuck up on itself."

msgid "spighter"
msgstr "Tape Finger"

msgid "spirain_description"
msgstr ""
"If a SEIREIN's inner fire dims, its water spirit nature turns it into \n"
"SPIRAIN."

msgid "spirain"
msgstr "Cauli Carl"

msgid "spoilurm_description"
msgstr ""
"SPOILURM disguise themselves as apples, and wait in trees to eat the \n"
"unsuspecting."

msgid "spoilurm"
msgstr "Shit Gi Sean"

msgid "sprightly_description"
msgstr ""
"A timid plant, it pops its head aboveground to drink water and sunshine. "

msgid "sprightly"
msgstr "Toe Hold Ted"

msgid "sprorm_description"
msgstr "SPRORM is fed on by CARDINALE, which can melt it down."

msgid "sprorm"
msgstr "Mouthguard Mo"

msgid "spycozeus_description"
msgstr ""
"The whispered communications of the forest are given physical form in \n"
"SPYCOZEUS, which thinks like the trees."

msgid "spycozeus"
msgstr "Open Mat Oz"

msgid "squabbit_description"
msgstr ""
"To prove themselves, they will fight tooth and nail over even the smallest \n"
"thing."

msgid "squabbit"
msgstr "Comp Class Cam"

msgid "squink_description"
msgstr "It is named for the noise it makes when it is all out of ink."

msgid "squink"
msgstr "Stall Steve"

msgid "statursus_description"
msgstr ""
"STATURSUS has learned to channel its emotions into a single pure flame. "
"The \n"
"mere sight of it sends others into a trance."

msgid "statursus"
msgstr "Grippy Greg"

msgid "stegofor_description"
msgstr ""
"When it comes time to morph, STEGOFOR migrates in great herds along "
"ancient \n"
"paths, stripping all vegetation from plants growing along the way."

msgid "stegofor"
msgstr "Underhook Ugo"

msgid "stomic_description"
msgstr ""
"STOMIC is radioactive, but radiation resistant bacteria like GLOMON still \n"
"pose a threat to it."

msgid "stomic"
msgstr "Overhook Owen"

msgid "stonifly_description"
msgstr ""
"STONIFLY's sturdy, rock-hard exoskeleton is a natural armor, while its \n"
"translucent wings allow for swift flight."

msgid "stonifly"
msgstr "Backtake Baz"

msgid "strella_description"
msgstr "Its tails are lures to convince bugs to bite them and be trapped."

msgid "strella"
msgstr "Snapdown Sid"

msgid "sumchon_description"
msgstr ""
"It uses its weight to trip much larger enemies. It is as dense as a star."

msgid "sumchon"
msgstr "Ankle Pick Al"

msgid "sumobug"
msgstr "Sumobug"

msgid "sumobug_description"
msgstr ""
"It uses its weight to trip much larger enemies. It is as dense as a star."

msgid "tadcool_description"
msgstr "It croaks to warn people when they are walking near thin ice."

msgid "tadcool"
msgstr "Blast Dan"

msgid "tarpeur_description"
msgstr ""
"They rest and grow. They also grow and rest. Rarely, they rest without \n"
"growing or grow without resting."

msgid "tarpeur"
msgstr "Collar Carl"

msgid "taupypus_description"
msgstr ""
"Upon their birth, a TAUPYPUS' eyes are burst by its mother. That way, "
"their \n"
"eyes will never sting when they dive into the water."

msgid "taupypus"
msgstr "Lapel Larry"

msgid "teddisun_description"
msgstr ""
"TEDDISUN worships the sun - they're always seen carrying their sun toy."

msgid "teddisun"
msgstr "Knee Slice Kai"

msgid "tetrchimp_description"
msgstr ""
"They absorb any information they come across. Their constant chatter \n"
"communicates everything they have learned in order."

msgid "tetrchimp"
msgstr "Pressure Pat"

msgid "thumpurn_description"
msgstr ""
"They thump their enemies with their fists, and thump the ground to give \n"
"warnings."

msgid "thumpurn"
msgstr "Turtle Terry"

msgid "tigrock_description"
msgstr ""
"It is said that it had to invent itself because an evolution was not \n"
"designed."

msgid "tigrock"
msgstr "Shrimp Sean"

msgid "tikoal_description"
msgstr ""
"The guardian of a forest-dwelling people, it keeps guard and resolves \n"
"disputes."

msgid "tikoal"
msgstr "Bridge Barry"

msgid "tikorch_description"
msgstr ""
"It is the intermediary between forest and volcano, between sun and earth."

msgid "tikorch"
msgstr "Mounty Mike"

msgid "tobishimi_description"
msgstr ""
"TOBISHIMI spawn eggs in vast numbers, and carry them about under their "
"chins\n"
" for safekeeping until the next full moon - when they hatch."

msgid "tobishimi"
msgstr "SideCtrl Sid"

msgid "tornicane_description"
msgstr ""
"TORNICANE harnesses the power of both tornado and hurricane. It is a "
"living \n"
"force of nature and may be savior or doom to those hoping for rain."

msgid "tornicane"
msgstr "Coach Big Ron"

msgid "toucanary_description"
msgstr ""
"TOUCANARY only has bright feathers because it grew up surrounded by flowers."

msgid "toucanary"
msgstr "Mum Said No"

msgid "toufigel_description"
msgstr ""
"It appears to be a fluffy insect, but it is actually a reptile coated in \n"
"soft snow."

msgid "toufigel"
msgstr "Mat Karen"

msgid "tourbidi_description"
msgstr ""
"If you find a circle of mushrooms or clover, it is a place where TOURBIDI \n"
"dance."

msgid "tourbidi"
msgstr "Drama Dan"

msgid "toxiris_description"
msgstr ""
"TOXIRIS is extremely powerful, it violently poisons everything in its way."

msgid "toxiris"
msgstr "Daisy NoGi"

msgid "trapsnap_description"
msgstr "Its head is the only part of its body that doesn't grow as it ages."

msgid "trapsnap"
msgstr "Sweaty Betty"

msgid "trojerror_description"
msgstr ""
"TROJERROR is a tuxemon that disguises itself as legitimate code or "
"software.\n"
" Once inside the network, TROJERRORS are able to carry out any action that "
"a\n"
" legitimate user could perform (deposit, withdraw and delete)."

msgid "trojerror"
msgstr "Bonk Barry"

msgid "tsushimi_description"
msgstr ""
"While sometimes referred to as its armor, the fleshy plates on TSUSHIMI "
"are \n"
"softer than its skin. Their purpose remains unknown."

msgid "tsushimi"
msgstr "Shady Shane"

msgid "tumblebee_description"
msgstr ""
"It builds hives that are perfect spheres, with the TUMBLEBEE inside just \n"
"rolling about and buzzing with laughter."

msgid "tumblebee"
msgstr "Creepy Craig"

msgid "tumbledillo_description"
msgstr ""
"Tumbledillo have a mystical connection to a particular road, and they "
"guard \n"
"it from people who would interfere with it - even pothole repair crews!"

msgid "tumbledillo"
msgstr "Moody Molly"

msgid "tumblequill_description"
msgstr ""
"Tumblequill rolls along the highways, gathering up useful items for its \n"
"nests from the rubbish left by the side of the road."

msgid "tumblequill"
msgstr "Rough Rachel"

msgid "tumbleworm_description"
msgstr ""
"When they have outgrown their honeycomb eggs, they drop to the ground face \n"
"first."

msgid "tumbleworm"
msgstr "Nasty Nancy"

msgid "turnipper_description"
msgstr ""
"When a field is abandoned to the crows, locusts and mice, a TURNIPPER will \n"
"sometimes dig itself out of the ground to defend the crops."

msgid "turnipper"
msgstr "Porrada Pam"

msgid "tux_description"
msgstr ""
"Most comfortable in arctic climes, TUX hunt weaker prey by leaping upon "
"it, \n"
"and crack open the shells or armor of stronger prey by sliding it along "
"the \n"
"ice into hard rocks."

msgid "tux"
msgstr "Kimura Kim"

msgid "tweesher_description"
msgstr ""
"The colder the weather, the harder its beak. At below 0 degrees, it is \n"
"harder than diamond."

msgid "tweesher"
msgstr "Heelhook Holly"

msgid "uf0_description"
msgstr ""
"This strange creature seems to be drawn by sounds that are too high for \n"
"human ears to hear."

msgid "uf0"
msgstr "Darce Debbie"

msgid "uglip_description"
msgstr ""
"When it is pulled up too quick from its home in the deep waters, UGLIP \n"
"becomes puffy and pained."

msgid "uglip"
msgstr "Guillo Gina"

msgid "uneye_description"
msgstr "Uneye lurks in the shadows, and on the edge of vision."

msgid "uneye"
msgstr "Acai Amy"

msgid "uprout_description"
msgstr ""
"When it has grown, its ears peel away to show wings that it uses to fly "
"into\n"
" the trees above where it grew. "

msgid "uprout"
msgstr "NoGi Nora"

msgid "urcheedle_description"
msgstr ""
"It can't move or attack, so it sits still and prays that the opponent \n"
"damages itself on its many needles."

msgid "urcheedle"
msgstr "Judo Jenny"

msgid "urcine_description"
msgstr ""
"When a FURNURSUS is born without the fire inside, it is abandoned in the \n"
"forests as an URCINE."

msgid "urcine"
msgstr "Spazzy Sally"

msgid "vamporm_description"
msgstr "It thirsts for blood, but must make do with tree sap."

msgid "vamporm"
msgstr "Tappy Tammy"

msgid "velocitile_description"
msgstr "It can outrun a bullet, but only when it has warmed up."

msgid "velocitile"
msgstr "Guard Gina"

msgid "vigueur_description"
msgstr ""
"VIGUEUR compete to see who can lift the heaviest rocks. When they lift one \n"
"that is too heavy, it squashes them and scatters TARPEUR seeds."

msgid "vigueur"
msgstr "Mount Mandy"

msgid "virware_description"
msgstr ""
"VIRWARE is usually dormant until the victim activates it, either through \n"
"downloading a corrupt app or clicking an infected link. Once activated, \n"
"VIRWARE may complete any number of tasks."

msgid "virware"
msgstr "Triangle Tina"

msgid "vivicinder_description"
msgstr ""
"It makes its nest in long-burning fires, either of its own creation or in \n"
"memorials, smithies and glassworks."

msgid "vivicinder"
msgstr "Bonnie BlueBelt"

msgid "vividactil_description"
msgstr ""
"In ancient times, the Year of the VIVIDACTIL marked a time of renewal and \n"
"the restoration of authority."

msgid "vividactil"
msgstr "Vegan Niall"

msgid "vivipere_description"
msgstr ""
"It hatches in great numbers in the summer, but the rest of its lifespan is "
"a\n"
" mystery."

msgid "vivipere"
msgstr "Slutty Sarah"

msgid "viviphyta_description"
msgstr "It is the king of snakes - or at least believes itself to be such."

msgid "viviphyta"
msgstr "Only Dans"

msgid "vivisource_description"
msgstr "The spring it chooses for its home always has a peculiar oniony taste."

msgid "vivisource"
msgstr "Mat Bastard"

msgid "viviteel_description"
msgstr "It takes the armor of a fallen warrior and repurposes it for a shell."

msgid "viviteel"
msgstr "Gi Goblin"

msgid "vivitrans_description"
msgstr "The cold focuses VIVITRANS' mind to a keen edge."

msgid "vivitrans"
msgstr "Heelhook Harry"

msgid "vivitron_description"
msgstr ""
"Early philosophers used VIVITRON as evidence that natural forces can be \n"
"tamed and controlled."

msgid "vivitron"
msgstr "Dr Kimura"

msgid "volcoli_description"
msgstr "It is the spirit of a forest. Its hair changes with the seasons."

msgid "volcoli"
msgstr "Coach Atlas"

msgid "volconey_description"
msgstr ""
"When VOLCONEY thump the earth with their gigantic feet, they call more and \n"
"more THUMPURN and VOLCONEY to the warren. But when enough strike the earth \n"
"at once, it is said to cause volcanic eruptions."

msgid "volconey"
msgstr "Spazzy Steve"

msgid "vulpyre_description"
msgstr ""
"How it evolves and lives is very mysterious, but it is sometimes spotted \n"
"near a volcano."

msgid "vulpyre"
msgstr "Acai Slut"

msgid "waysprite_description"
msgstr "WAYSPRITE are said to form when a person faces a difficult decision."

msgid "waysprite"
msgstr "Craig NoGi"

msgid "weavifly_description"
msgstr "When it is heavy with egg, it becomes unable to fly."

msgid "weavifly"
msgstr "Wristlock Wes"

msgid "weedlantis_description"
msgstr ""
"It is said an ancient civilization once used WEEDLANTIS as advisors, but "
"it \n"
"has since disappeared beneath the sea."

msgid "weedlantis"
msgstr "Stinky Gi"

msgid "weedsea_description"
msgstr ""
"Once a year, it is pollinated beneath the waves by aquatic tuxemon like \n"
"Shrab."

msgid "weedsea"
msgstr "Nasty Nate"

msgid "wendigger_description"
msgstr "It is said corpses given an improper burial can grow into WENDIGGER."

msgid "wendigger"
msgstr "Oilcheck Oz"

msgid "windeye_description"
msgstr ""
"Like a mighty tree, WINDEYE plants itself on the top of hills to soak in "
"the\n"
" sun and wind. Recharged, it then leaves to find another place under the \n"
"sky."

msgid "windeye"
msgstr "Leglock Larry"

msgid "wolffsky_description"
msgstr ""
"This tuxemon is very friendly. It is common to go hunting with the help of \n"
"WOLFFSKY."

msgid "wolffsky"
msgstr "Porrada Paul"

msgid "wolololl_description"
msgstr "WOLOLOLL's sharp spines are tipped with a deadly venom."

msgid "wolololl"
msgstr "Sandbag Sam"

msgid "woodoor_description"
msgstr ""
"When a haunted house burns to the ground, sometimes all that is left is "
"the \n"
"front door. It hops away to find its next home."

msgid "woodoor"
msgstr "Sweaty Kev"

msgid "wrougon_description"
msgstr ""
"Each WROUGON is born with a patch of rust larger than the patch of its \n"
"parents."

msgid "wrougon"
msgstr "Choke Chad"

msgid "yiinaang_description"
msgstr "It was born the first time a star fell into a black hole."

msgid "yamada"
msgstr "Kimura Kev"

msgid "yamada_description"
msgstr ""
"While ghosts are known for being tricksters, YAMADA tend to take the law \n"
"seriously, even seeing good behavior as more important than physical might."

msgid "yiinaang"
msgstr "Mount Mick"

msgid "ziggurat_description"
msgstr ""
"No labyrinth can contain ZIGGURAT. It decorates its nests with carvings\n"
" of all the mazes it has traversed over the years."

msgid "ziggurat"
msgstr "Halfguard Hal"

msgid "zunna_description"
msgstr "Cheerful ZUNNA sucks up all the food it can find into its stomach."

msgid "zunna"
msgstr "Judo Jake"

msgid "agnsher_description"
msgstr "A fusion of two tuxemon."

msgid "agnsher"
msgstr "Heelhook Harry"

msgid "bearloch_description"
msgstr "A fusion of two tuxemon."

msgid "bearloch"
