"A rare and ancient column. Other ruins from the same culture can be found "
"on\n"
" Route 3. "

msgid "route2speech"
msgstr "EEK!!!"

msgid "route2speech2"
msgstr ""
"Oh. It's just you ${{name}}...\n"
"\n"
"Be more considerate the next time you push someone. The cliff is higher than "
"it looks..."

msgid "route2speech3"
msgstr ""
"Although that may not be a bad thing...\n"
"\n"
"I know, everyone needs me to lead, but with everything going on...\n"
"\n"
"But you don't want to listen to me... do you?"

msgid "yestalk"
msgstr "Really? Thanks..."

msgid "notalk"
msgstr "How insensitive of you! Too bad, you'll have to listen to me anyway!"

msgid "spillit"
msgstr ""
"You know that I am the leader of the Xero institute and that I recruited you "
"to fight them. But you don't know something else.\n"
"\n"
"Allie, who you met before... What? I told you we would be watching, you "
"don't have to be surprised by it."

msgid "spillit3"
msgstr ""
"Whatever... Allie is my sister and means the world to me, so it destroyed "
"me\n"
" when I found out he had taken her to HQ."

msgid "spillit4"
msgstr ""
"It may not seem like a bad thing, but it is. Do you know what they do to \n"
"their recruits? DO YOU!?"

msgid "spillit5"
msgstr ""
"Because neither do I... All I know is that no one has ever left "
"Omnichannel \n"
"after being recruited."

msgid "spillit6"
msgstr ""
"Anyways... it doesn't concern you. All that matters is bringing down \n"
"Omnichannel."

msgid "spillit7"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry for troubling you with my issues. City Park is up ahead when you \n"
"want to move on"

msgid "leavemealone"
msgstr "We used to play here all the time when we were younger..."

msgid "iamknight"
msgstr ""
"AHHH!!!\n"
"\n"
"I thought you were someone else. I'm sorry for shouting."

msgid "iamknight2"
msgstr ""
"Wait, you're the one they whisper about right? The one with the illegal \n"
"Tuxemon?"

msgid "mistakenknight"
msgstr ""
"Nope, there's no way I'm wrong. It's you!\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry, I won't tell anyone."

msgid "thatsmeknight"
msgstr ""
"Oh, Splendid! I knew from the beginning it had to be you\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry, I won't tell anyone."

msgid "quicklyknight"
msgstr ""
"I don't have much time left. Omnichannel is coming...\n"
"\n"
"I was supposed to meet a contact, but you'll have to do. They're coming."

msgid "quicklyknight2"
msgstr "Two people control Omnichannel. The board is a joke."

msgid "quicklyknight3"
msgstr "Allie. Allie is the one they don't want you to know about."

msgid "quicklyknight4"
msgstr "Sorry, but I should leave now."

msgid "omnichannelarrives"
msgstr "STOP!"

msgid "yesmaam"
msgstr "Yes Ma'am."

msgid "firsts"
msgstr ""
"I wonder when the next CJI is?\n"
"\n"
"ADCC and CJI on the same weekend was awesome!\n"
"\n"
"One day I'll compete at CJI."

msgid "nopenotyet"
msgstr "Sorry, someone got injured on the route. It's closed right now."

msgid "bothofyou"
msgstr ""
"Both of you, come outside.\n"
"\n"
"A KOTHchannel representative wants to address the town."

msgid "hellolovelypeople"
msgstr "HELLOOOOO CITIZENS OF TABA TOWN!"

msgid "darnitjohn"
msgstr "Wait... Where's John?"

msgid "darnitjohn2"
msgstr "DARN IT JOHN! Get out here!"

msgid "darnitjohn3"
msgstr "John."

msgid "darnitjohn4"
msgstr "Y-Yes ma'am?"

msgid "darnitjohn5"
msgstr "Why are you still here?"

msgid "darnitjohn6"
msgstr "Uhh..."

msgid "darnitjohn7"
msgstr "I'm not sure..."

msgid "darnitjohn8"
msgstr "AAAAAGH!!!"

msgid "darnitjohn9"
msgstr ""
"YOU IMBECILE!\n"
"\n"
"I will say this once and only once:\n"
"\n"
"GO. SEARCH. THE. HOUSES."

msgid "darnitjohn10"
msgstr "NOW!"

msgid "johnissorry"
msgstr ""
"Sorry Ma'am... I... \n"
"\n"
"Saw... \n"
"\n"
"Some... \n"
"\n"
"Flowers..."

msgid "uselessnes"
msgstr "You're absolutely useless John. I can't believe we were ever together."

msgid "cometomepls"
msgstr ""
"NOW, EVERYONE, PLEASE COME TO THE CENTER OF TOWN. KOTHCHANNEL WISHES TO \n"
"ADDRESS YOU!"

msgid "hellolovelypeople2"
msgstr ""
"I know you're probably wondering why my Officers and I are here.\n"
"\n"
"Wait..."

msgid "hellolovelypeople3"
msgstr ""
"Are you really the only people in this town? There's no one here! This has \n"
"GOT to be the smallest town in the Trial Class Region."

msgid "hellolovelypeople4"
msgstr "I'm pretty sure there are academies in Tren Town larger than this..."

msgid "hellolovelypeople5"
msgstr ""
"No... Wait... We're missing one person...\n"
"\n"
"Coach Atlas... former head coach of Atlas Academy.\n"
"\n"
"He is wanted for multiple serious crimes and was last believed to be hiding "
"somewhere in this region."

msgid "whereismyhairbrush"
msgstr "John, Grant, spread out. Find Coach Atlas."

msgid "oopsie"
msgstr ""
"Apologies. Some of my Officers have enthusiasm that outweighs their "
"professionalism."

msgid "ourstuffisours"
msgstr "So... why are you really here?"

msgid "oopsie2"
msgstr ""
"Let's wait for my Officers to report back.\n"
"\n"
"I'd rather not make this announcement until we know whether Coach Atlas is "
"here."

msgid "maamiexist"
msgstr "Ma'am, He isn't in the house."

msgid "maamiexist2"
msgstr "Was there anything of interest?"

msgid "maamiexist3"
msgstr ""
"There's a computer running Ubuntu.\n"
"\n"
"And... someone's been watching Bonnie Blue Belt instead of training.\n"
"I was going to confiscate it, but I know Gnome isn't your style..."

msgid "maamiexist4"
msgstr ""
"Leave it. Questionable search history is not currently a KOTHchannel "
"priority.\n"
"\n"
"Check the academy next, Grant. I'll wait for John."

msgid "itsmyaurababe"
msgstr "Now... who are you?"

msgid "itsmyaurababe2"
msgstr ""
"Hmm. You're not one of Atlas's students, are you?\n"
"\n"
"...   ...   ...   ...\n"
"\n"
"You have the look of someone who might become useful. We should speak again "
"in Tren Town."

msgid "itsmyduhduhduh"
msgstr "Received KOTHchannel Contact!"

msgid "itsmyaurababe3"
msgstr "Try not to disappoint me."

msgid "maamnothing"
msgstr "Ma'am..."

msgid "maamnothing2"
msgstr ""
"John. I was in the middle of something.\n"
"\n"
"Report."

msgid "maamnothing3"
msgstr "I... I couldn't find Coach Atlas anywhere."

msgid "maamnothing4"
msgstr "Wonderful. A manhunt powered by incompetence."

msgid "maamnothing5"
msgstr "Ma'am, no sign of Atlas at the academy either."

msgid "maamnothing6"
msgstr ""
"... ... ... ...\n"
"\n"
"Fine. We return to HQ and widen the search."

msgid "solongjohn"
msgstr ""
"John, stay here and keep watch.\n"
"\n"
"If Coach Atlas returns, contact KOTHchannel immediately."

msgid "solongjohn2"
msgstr "Come on Grant. We have academies to inspect."

msgid "seeme"
msgstr "Come see me in Tren Town when you're ready."

msgid "knight4ispoor"
msgstr "She's harsh, but she really believes she's protecting the region."

msgid "frowntime"
msgstr ""
"I don't mind being stationed here...\n"
"\n"
"I just wish I knew what Coach Atlas actually did..."

msgid "wherewasshe"
msgstr "She didn't tell us the bad news..."

msgid "waitdontgo"
msgstr "${{name}}! Wait! Don't leave yet!"

msgid "thetvbescreamin"
msgstr ""
"Honey, wait. I turned on the TV and KOTHchannel is making an announcement.\n"
"\n"
"We should watch it."

msgid "ipausedit"
msgstr ""
"I paused the TV, please grab me a glass of water and then we can watch \n"
"together."

msgid "announcement1"
msgstr ""
"HELLO CITIZENS OF THE TRIAL CLASS REGION!\n"
"\n"
"THANK YOU FOR TUNING IN TO THIS MANDATORY ANNOUNCEMENT."

msgid "announcement2"
msgstr "WE LOVE YOU KOTH!"

msgid "announcement3"
msgstr ""
"Thank you. I appreciate your support.\n"
"\n"
"Now, to the matter at hand."

msgid "announcement4"
msgstr ""
"To ALL the citizens of the Trial Class Region and beyond who are tuning in, "
"I welcome you.\n"
"\n"
"My name is KOTH, short for King Of The Hill, and I am the CEO of KOTHchannel!"

msgid "whythecheering"
msgstr "Those KOTHchannel people are cheering a lot for him. I wonder why?"

msgid "announcement5"
msgstr ""
"It has been a long road building the future of competitive jiu jitsu in the "
"Trial Class Region.\n"
"\n"
"Today, KOTHchannel is proud to announce the official Academy Network.\n"
"\n"
"Every recognised academy will now feed into regional rankings, qualifiers, "
"and eventually...\n"
"\n"
"KING OF THE HILL!\n"
"\n"
"*deafening screaming*\n"
"\n"
"Quiet down! Quiet down! Your enthusiasm is infectious, I must say!\n"
"\n"
"Train hard. Compete often. The road to KOTH starts today!"

msgid "ohnoes"
msgstr "Well... I don't know how to feel about this Academy Network..."

msgid "ohnoes2"
msgstr ""
"Now that that's over... we still need a White Monster from JitsMart.\n"
"\n"
"Make sure you're back before curfew though!"

msgid "depressedmom"
msgstr ""
"So Coach Atlas really is missing...\n"
"\n"
"I just hope they're wrong about him."

msgid "waterwater"
msgstr "Ice cold. Just what you need before a hard training session."

msgid "watchmewatchme"
msgstr ""
"What are you doing out here? KOTHchannel officers are still searching the "
"area.\n"
"\n"
"... ... ... ...\n"
"\n"
"... ... ... ...\n"
"\n"
"You don't look like trouble, so you can head into town.\n"
"\n"
"Just don't get in the way of the Atlas investigation, okay?"

msgid "grumble"
msgstr ""
"KOTHchannel has everyone on edge with this Coach Atlas manhunt...\n"
"\n"
"I just hope they actually know what they're doing."

msgid "bobtalk"
msgstr ""
"Bit strange today, isn't it?\n"
"\n"
"Officers everywhere, KOTHchannel on every screen, and everyone whispering "
"about Coach Atlas."

msgid "professorexists"
msgstr "I'll take a White Monster and some finger tape, please."

msgid "professorexists1"
msgstr "Cheers, Ben."

msgid "professorexists1.5"
msgstr "Well, hello there."

msgid "professorexists2"
msgstr ""
"You must be Callie's kid. I've heard plenty about you from your mum.\n"
"\n"
"What brings you into JitsMart?\n"
"\n"
".... .... ....\n"
"\n"
"A White Monster? Good choice. Essential fuel for nervous white belts.\n"
"\n"
"Here, take a couple on me."

msgid "potions2"
msgstr "Received 2 White Monsters!"

msgid "professorexists3"
msgstr ""
"Where are my manners? I should introduce myself.\n"
"\n"
"I'm Sensei Duncan.\n"
"\n"
"I run the local academy here in the Trial Class Region."

msgid "professorexists4"
msgstr ""
"If you're curious about the KOTHchannel Academy Network, come by the mats "
"sometime.\n"
"\n"
"Announcements are one thing. Training is another.\n"
"\n"
"For now, get back home and watch the second broadcast with your mum."

msgid "theenergy"
msgstr "The energy of that man is boundless..."

msgid "hmmm"
msgstr "I wonder what they're setting up over there?"

msgid "hmmm2"
msgstr "I heard KOTHchannel is building an official route to the academy."

msgid "hmmm3"
msgstr "What's the point? Everyone already knows where the mats are."

msgid "hmmm4"
msgstr "Maybe they're building a warm-up zone!"

msgid "hmmm5"
msgstr ""
"Max, as much as you want one, they're not building a warm-up zone in the "
"middle of the road."

msgid "hmmm6"
msgstr ".... .... Okay... But they could be..."

msgid "hmmm7"
msgstr "The weather is nice though, isn't it?"

msgid "timeforround2"
msgstr ""
"${{name}}! Finally! You're back! I was afraid you were going to miss the "
"announcement!"

msgid "timeforround22"
msgstr ""
"Oh! You got the White Monsters! Perfect! Now hurry, the broadcast is about "
"to continue."

msgid "theanthemishere"
msgstr ""
"Quick! KOTHchannel is back on.\n"
"\n"
"I think they're about to announce something important!"

msgid "moreannouncement"
msgstr "ATTENTION, ALL CITIZENS OF THE TRIAL CLASS REGION!"

msgid "moreannouncement2"
msgstr ""
"I apologise for the short notice, but today's announcement couldn't wait.\n"
"\n"
"After months of planning with the world's leading academies, we are proud to "
"unveil the future of competitive jiu jitsu.\n"
"\n"
"The KOTHchannel Academy Network is officially open!\n"
"\n"
"Every recognised academy will now feed into regional rankings, official "
"qualifiers, and ultimately..."

msgid "youneedtodothis"
msgstr ""
"I... I think you should look into this Academy Network...\\n\n"
"I don't want to lose you, especially now that we're finally settled."

msgid "youneedtodothis2"
msgstr ""
"But... I know you've always dreamed of training at a proper academy, and "
"this could be your chance.\\n\n"
"I know you have the determination to become one of the very best.\\n\n"
"I just don't know if we can afford the membership fees...\\n\n"
"Wait... how much does it cost?"

msgid "ihaveyourmoney"
msgstr "Well... maybe I can help with that."

msgid "iknowyou"
msgstr ""
"Hello Callie, hello ${{name}}. I stopped by after hearing the KOTHchannel "
"announcement."

msgid "ihaveyourmoney2"
msgstr ""
"I've got some academy credit saved that should cover your first month.\\n\n"
"Getting registered is the easy part. Becoming ready for competition is "
"harder.\\n\n"
"Luckily, I happen to know someone who runs a proper academy...\\n\n"
"Me.\\n\n"
"Take your time. I'll be at the academy when you're ready."

msgid "hebenice"
msgstr ""
"Sensei Duncan is a good man. You should at least hear what he has to say."

msgid "moverocky"
msgstr "Come on, Rocky! Open mat is this way!"

msgid "moverocky2"
msgstr "Take your time. The mats aren't going anywhere."

msgid "tuxemontime"
msgstr "Ah, you came. Good."

msgid "tuxemontime1.5"
msgstr "I take it this means you're ready to join the academy?"

msgid "tuxemontimechoiceyes"
msgstr "Good. Then your training starts now."

msgid "tuxemontimechoiceno"
msgstr "That's alright. The mats will still be here when you're ready."

msgid "tuxemontime2"
msgstr "First, we need to get your academy registration sorted."

msgid "tuxemontime3"
msgstr "There we go."

msgid "tuxemontime3.1"
msgstr ""
"Here are your academy registration papers. You will need them to enter "
"official KOTHchannel events.\\n\n"
"Do not lose them."

msgid "obtainedpapers"
msgstr "Received Academy Registration Papers!"

msgid "tuxemontime4"
msgstr ""
"Now for the important part. Every beginner needs a starting style.\\n\n"
"I can help you begin with pressure, speed, or control.\\n\n"
"Choose carefully. Your first style says a lot about how you fight."

msgid "chooseyerfate"
msgstr "Which starting style do you want?"

msgid "chooseyerfateRockitten"
msgstr ""
"A solid choice! Rockitten is an Earth-type Tuxemon. In medieval times, they "
"bred Rockittens to sit by the door and look cute.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to choose Rockitten?"

msgid "choseRockitten"
msgstr ""
"Alright, here's your Rockitten! I know that you two will go on great \n"
"adventures together!"

msgid "choseRockitten2"
msgstr ""
"First though, let's test your battle prowess with a quick Tuxemon battle.\n"
"\n"
" Let's see... I'll choose Cardiling."

msgid "rockitten!"
msgstr "Obtained Rockitten!"

msgid "nochoiceTuxemon"
msgstr "Okay, why don't you take a look at the other two?"

msgid "chooseyerfateCardiling"
msgstr ""
"An interesting choice, it speaks to the spark inside of you. Cardiling is a "
"Fire-type Tuxemon known for stealing food from friends and enemies alike.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to choose Cardiling?"

msgid "choseCardiling"
msgstr ""
"Alright, here's your Cardiling! I know that you two will go on great \n"
"adventures together!"

msgid "choseCardiling2"
msgstr ""
"First though, let's test your battle prowess with a quick Tuxemon battle.\n"
"\n"
" Let's see... I'll choose Tweesher."

msgid "chosefight"
msgstr "And... LET'S FIGHT!"

msgid "cardiling!"
msgstr "Obtained Cardiling!"

msgid "chooseyerfateTweesher"
msgstr ""
"A great choice! Tweesher is a Water-type Tuxemon. It's evolution Eagleace is "
"one of the fastest Tuxemon\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to choose Tweesher?"

msgid "choseTweesher"
msgstr ""
"Alright, here's your Tweesher! I know that you two will go on great \n"
"adventures together!"

msgid "choseTweesher2"
msgstr ""
"First though, let's test your battle prowess with a quick Tuxemon battle.\n"
"\n"
" Let's see... I'll choose Rockitten."

msgid "tweesher!"
msgstr "Obtained Tweesher!"

msgid "wewnicefight"
msgstr ""
"Wow, that was a good fight!\n"
"\n"
"Let me heal your Tuxemon real quick...\n"
"\n"
"And... There! All set!\n"
"\n"
"With a little more practice and maybe a few more Tuxemon, you'll definitely "
"be able to take on the Trial."

msgid "yahaha"
msgstr "Ah ha! Found you!"

msgid "gasp"
msgstr "Wait..."

msgid "gasp2"
msgstr ""
"What are you doing here with this... Criminal?\n"
"\n"
"... .... ....\n"
"\n"
"... ... ...\n"
"\n"
"Joining the trial? You'd really subject yourself to that nonsense?\n"
"\n"
"If all you want is a job at Omnichannel, you could have just asked me.\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure I can find a... use for you... if you're interested."

msgid "brokethegasp"
msgstr "Now, Miss, if I may, ${{name}} is doing it for more than a job."

msgid "brokethegasp2"
msgstr "You. Why are you talking? I didn't allow you to speak."

msgid "brokethegasp3"
msgstr ""
"Please, miss omnichannel ma'am, ${{name}}'s Mother wanted them to join the "
"Trial to see the entire region\n"
"\n"
"${{name}} isn't doing it for the job, they're doing it for the experience."

msgid "gasp3"
msgstr "If that's true, there's more to you than I realized..."

msgid "gasp4"
msgstr ""
"Fine, I'll let your registration papers stay intact. For now.\n"
"\n"
"John, Grant, take the so-called Tuxemon Professor to his new home."

msgid "goodbye"
msgstr ""
"Don't let the Trial prevent you from coming to see me. In fact... Maybe "
"I'll\n"
" find you first."

msgid "goodbye2"
msgstr "So long ${{name}}! And good luck in the Trial, you'll need it."

msgid "tabatownbattlearea"
msgstr "KOTHchannel Academy - Taba Training Area"

msgid "rockywhy"
msgstr ""
"Come on Rocky, the beginners' class starts soon!\\n\n"
"We'll be late for warm-ups!"

msgid "heystop"
msgstr "Why is the road closed?"

msgid "heystop2"
msgstr ""
"Sorry folks. KOTHchannel inspectors are upgrading the training facilities."
"\\n\n"
"The route will reopen once the safety checks are complete."

msgid "heystop3"
msgstr "But this is the quickest way to the academy!"

msgid "heystop4"
msgstr ""
"Marissa, maybe we should leave for now. We can come back after the "
"inspection."

msgid "heystop5"
msgstr ""
"But... but they shut down our open mat without even asking.\\n\n"
"We were supposed to be training here today."

msgid "heystop6"
msgstr ""
"I know, but we'll find somewhere else to drill.\\n\n"
"It'll still be a great session if we're together."

msgid "heystop7"
msgstr ""
"If the Atlas investigation wasn't still ongoing, we'd probably still have "
"our training area..."

msgid "soiwashearing"
msgstr "Looks like we found the source of the complaint."

msgid "soiwashearing2"
msgstr "You there. What is your name?"

msgid "soiwashearing3"
msgstr "My name is Marissa, and these officers shut down our training area!"

msgid "soiwashearing4"
msgstr ""
"Easy now. These are KOTHchannel Officers.\\n\n"
"They're here to keep everyone safe."

msgid "soiwashearing5"
msgstr "Ma'am, would you like me to escort her away from the inspection area?"

msgid "soiwashearing6"
msgstr "No, Officer Julius. That won't be necessary."

msgid "soiwashearing7"
msgstr "She's clearly upset. I understand why."

msgid "soiwashearing7.5"
msgstr "Anyone who cares this much about training deserves to be heard."

msgid "soiwashearing8"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, until the Coach Atlas investigation is complete,\\n\n"
"every academy and training area must pass additional safety inspections."

msgid "soiwashearing9"
msgstr "However, in the future..."

msgid "soiwashearing10"
msgstr "Bring complaints through the proper academy channels."

msgid "y-yes"
msgstr "Y-yes... understood."

msgid "soiwashearing11"
msgstr ""
"Good. Now move aside so I can speak with these so-called officers.\"knights."
"\\"

msgid "allofyounow"
msgstr ""
"Anyone not cleared for academy combat needs to step back. This could get "
"messy."

msgid "waityouhaveone"
msgstr ""
"You are registered with the Academy Network?\\n\n"
"Interesting.\\n\n"
"... .... ... ...\\n\n"
"... ... .... ...\\n\n"
"Then let's see if you can handle yourself. I'll patch you up first, then we "
"test your basics."

msgid "taketheleft"
msgstr "You take the one on the left. I'll handle the other three."

msgid "taketheleft2"
msgstr "Take the one on the left! Don't worry, I've got these three!"

msgid "nobodygetsthrough"
msgstr "No matter who you bring with you, this inspection zone stays closed!"

msgid "staples"
msgstr "Well, that was easy."

msgid "higrunts"
msgstr ""
"Those unhinged grapplers don't even get proper training, so they were no "
"match for me.\\n\n"
"You didn't do too badly either."

msgid "higrunts2"
msgstr "Here, I'll help you recover."

msgid "ohaimisa"
msgstr "Well, look who it is."

msgid "ohaimisa2"
msgstr ""
"I heard some rogue athlete was giving my officers trouble,\\n\n"
"but I didn't expect it to be you."

msgid "ohaimisa3"
msgstr "Kyle. Why are you here?"

msgid "ohaimisa4"
msgstr ""
"Why am I here? I'm overseeing the first official KOTHchannel training area "
"in the region.\\n\n"
"Although I can see why you missed the memo, running around with your new "
"prospect and all."

msgid "ohaimisa5"
msgstr "Wait, they aren't my-"

msgid "ohaimisa6"
msgstr ""
"Doesn't matter. I have inspections to finish.\\n\n"
"Have fun, and stop flattening my officers. Toodles."

msgid "ohaimisa7"
msgstr "Jack, Rick, Eddy, come with me. Jon, you stay here."

msgid "kylekindasucks"
msgstr ""
"Sorry about that. Kyle is one of the most irritating people in KOTHchannel."
"\\n\n"
"We trained in the same cohort, and somehow he turned clipboard power into a "
"personality."

msgid "kylekindasucks2"
msgstr ""
"On a better note, it looks like Kyle was here to reopen the path.\\n\n"
"The training area should be accessible now."

msgid "kylekindasucks3"
msgstr ""
"I know you're entering the Academy Network, but be careful.\\n\n"
"With the Atlas investigation ongoing, everyone is watching everyone."

msgid "kylekindasucks4"
msgstr ""
"I don't want to see another promising student get caught in something they "
"don't understand."

msgid "kylekindasucks5"
msgstr ""
"Alright, I've probably been here long enough. Time for me to head back."

msgid "kylekindasucks6"
msgstr "Oh, and ${{name}}?"

msgid "kylekindasucks7"
msgstr ""
"I'll be watching your progress.\\n\n"
"Maybe I'll even root for you. Don't let me down, okay?"

msgid "kylekindasucks8"
msgstr ""
"You four, head home. Remember, this was an official inspection.\\n\n"
"Understood?\\n\n"
"Oh, and Marissa? Come find me sometime. My contact is on the card I gave you."

msgid "misaisleavingfornow"
msgstr "Matt, Julius, let's head out."

msgid "misaisleavingfornow2"
msgstr "Good luck, ${{name}}. I'm sure we'll see each other again."

msgid "imherenow"
msgstr ""
"I'm here to make sure nobody causes trouble near the academy.\\n\n"
"... .... ... ...\\n\n"
"How do I do that? Well... politely, I hope."

msgid "oimate"
msgstr ""
"Hey! This is a restricted training area. No one without registration papers "
"is allowed in!"

msgid "welcometotaba"
msgstr "Hello, aspiring competitors!"

msgid "welcometotaba2"
msgstr ""
"Congratulations on completing your KOTHchannel academy registration.\\n\n"
"Your group has been selected as the first competitors in the Trial Class "
"Region Academy Network."

msgid "welcometotaba3"
msgstr ""
"Aren't there only three of us?\\n\n"
"That barely feels like a group.\"group\\\"."

msgid "welcometotaba4"
msgstr "To be honest, I expected more people to register..."

msgid "welcometotaba5"
msgstr ""
"Regardless, my name is Kyle, and I am the lead organiser for this training "
"area.\\n\n"
"I am here to inaugurate the first official Trial Class Region competition "
"arena and declare that...\\n\n"
"THE ACADEMY NETWORK HAS BEGUN!"

msgid "welcometotaba6"
msgstr "... .... ..."

msgid "welcometotaba7"
msgstr ""
"I'm not going to lie, I expected more enthusiasm from the first registered "
"athletes."

msgid "welcometotaba8"
msgstr ""
"You're the student Sensei Duncan registered.\\n\n"
"Let's see...\\n\n"
"Your papers were signed off properly. Interesting."

msgid "welcometotaba9"
msgstr "Your registration appears to be in order. For now."

msgid "welcometotaba10"
msgstr ""
"Still, the lack of enthusiasm is disappointing. This is a major honour.\\n\n"
"You three represent the first official competitors of the Trial Class Region "
"Academy Network."

msgid "welcometotaba11"
msgstr "Sorry, sir... but what happens if we actually do well?"

msgid "welcometotaba12"
msgstr ""
"Good question. Win matches, earn ranking points, and climb through official "
"academy events.\\n\n"
"The best competitors may one day qualify for King Of The Hill."

msgid "welcometotaba13"
msgstr ""
"Then that's where I'm going.\\n\n"
"If Coach Atlas is hiding in the competition circuit, I'll find him.\"lack "
"enthusiasm\\\" when you're talking about the Trial."

msgid "welcometotaba14"
msgstr ""
"Ambitious.\\n\n"
"What's your name?\"The Future of \n"
"Omnichannel.\" What's your name?"

msgid "welcometotaba15"
msgstr "Speck, sir."

msgid "kylereallysucks"
msgstr ""
"Well then, Speck... ambition is good.\\n\n"
"But revenge without discipline gets athletes hurt."

msgid "kylereallysucks2"
msgstr ""
"Good luck, everyone. Train properly, compete clean, and represent your "
"academies well."

msgid "kylereallysucks3"
msgstr "Coach Atlas is dangerous. Do not chase him before you're ready."

msgid "toodles"
msgstr "See you at the next event."

msgid "dowehavetogoin"
msgstr "You know... you don't have to rush into this."

msgid "dowehavetogoin2"
msgstr ""
"I know.\\n\n"
"But if KOTH is the path to Atlas, then I need to start walking it."

msgid "dowehavetogoin3"
msgstr ""
"I have to get stronger.\\n\n"
"Not someday. Starting now."

msgid "dowehavetogoin4"
msgstr "Maybe one day... I'll face Coach Atlas myself."

msgid "dowehavetogoin5"
msgstr "By the way... what's your name?"

msgid "hichristie"
msgstr "I'm Christie! Sorry, I should've introduced myself sooner."

msgid "hichristie2"
msgstr ""
"Nice to meet you, Christie.\\n\n"
"Looks like we're all starting this journey together."

msgid "hiperson"
msgstr ""
"Who are you, who registered you, and which academy are you from? Give us the "
"deets!"

msgid "hiperson2"
msgstr "Whoa there Christie, don't overwhelm them."

msgid "hiperson3"
msgstr "How about we start with a name and where you're from?"

msgid "hiperson4"
msgstr ".... ... ...."

msgid "hiperson5"
msgstr "Oh, so you're from Taba Town! Neat!"

msgid "hiperson6"
msgstr "Now, who signed your academy papers?"

msgid "nobody"
msgstr "I don't actually know"

msgid "somebody"
msgstr "I'd rather not talk about it"

msgid "nobody2"
msgstr "Fine! Keep your secrets!"

msgid "somebody2"
msgstr ""
"Oooh. Mysterious academy paperwork?\\n\n"
"C'mon! We need to know!"

msgid "stahp"
msgstr ""
"Easy there, Christie. We only just met them.\\n\n"
"Let's get checked in before we miss the briefing."

msgid "stahp2"
msgstr "...Fine."

msgid "stahp3"
msgstr ""
"But don't think you're getting away that easily!\\n\n"
"I'll hear your whole story eventually!"

msgid "stahp4"
msgstr "She gets excited whenever she meets new competitors."

msgid "stahp5"
msgstr "You'll get used to it... probably."

msgid "mydadiscool"
msgstr ""
"My dad works here at the competition arena!\\n\n"
"He helps keep everything running smoothly."

msgid "mydadiscool2"
msgstr ""
"I have to wait out here until he's finished working.\\n\n"
"One day I'll compete here too!"

msgid "welcomecontestants"
msgstr "Welcome, Academy Network competitors!"

msgid "itsforthefans"
msgstr ""
"And a huge welcome to everyone watching from home!\\n\n"
"My name is KOTH, and this is the first official Academy Network broadcast."

msgid "itsforthefans2"
msgstr ""
"You've all been waiting to see the first registered competitors.\\n\n"
"Today, you get to meet them."

msgid "itsforthefans3"
msgstr ""
"From Flower City!\\n\n"
"The wrestler who never backs up... Speck!"

msgid "itsforthefans4"
msgstr "... .... ..."

msgid "itsforthefans5"
msgstr "Cut. Reset that."

msgid "itsforthefans6"
msgstr "The recording has stopped, sir."

msgid "itsforthefans7"
msgstr "Good."

msgid "itsforthefans8"
msgstr "AS FOR YOU THREE!"

msgid "itsforthefans9"
msgstr ""
"When your name is called, step forward like competitors.\\n\n"
"This is your first official KOTHchannel appearance. Treat it that way."

msgid "itsforthefans10"
msgstr "Start the recording. We'll pick it up at the introductions."

msgid "yessir"
msgstr "Yes, sir."

msgid "itsforthefans11"
msgstr ""
"From Paper Town!\\n\n"
"The fast-moving guard player, Christie!"

msgid "itsforthefans12"
msgstr ""
"And finally, the one everyone in Taba Town is talking about!\\n\n"
"Newly registered under Sensei Duncan's academy...\\n\n"
"${{name}}!"

msgid "abouttababa"
msgstr ""
"Now, you are probably wondering what this first arena will involve.\\n\n"
"The Taba Competition Arena is the first official stop in the Trial Class "
"Region Academy Network.\\n\n"
"Each arena will test a different part of your game: technique, toughness, "
"decision-making, and composure.\\n\n"
"This is how we find the athletes ready to chase King Of The Hill."

msgid "abouttababa2"
msgstr "Christie."

msgid "abouttababa3"
msgstr "Speck."

msgid "abouttababa4"
msgstr "${{name}}"

msgid "abouttababa5"
msgstr "The requirement for the Taba Competition Arena is..."

msgid "abouttababa6"
msgstr "Grappling matches!"

msgid "abouttababa7"
msgstr ""
"You must defeat all four academy competitors before facing the Arena Coach."
"\\n\n"
"Beat the Arena Coach, and you will earn your first official ranking medal."
"\\n\n"
"Good luck to all three of you, and remember...\\n\n"
"Train hard. Compete clean. Respect the mats."

msgid "abouttababa8"
msgstr ""
"Oh, and one more thing.\\n\n"
"KOTHchannel will be monitoring every official result.\\n\n"
"Your road to King Of The Hill starts here, so represent your academy "
"properly."

msgid "abouttababa9"
msgstr "Alright competitors, you're free to begin. Good luck to all of you!"

msgid "abouttababa10"
msgstr "Officials, prepare the arena for the opening matches."

msgid "buh-bye"
msgstr "I'll be checking in throughout the season. See you all soon!"

msgid "weneedhelp"
msgstr "...So, do we just start competing?"

msgid "weneedhelp2"
msgstr "I guess our first matches begin here?"

msgid "weneedhelp3"
msgstr "This doesn't really look like a competition arena..."

msgid "weneedhelp4"
msgstr ""
"Maybe this is just the warm-up area.\\n\n"
"I'm sure one of the officials will explain everything."

msgid "explainthyselfchristie"
msgstr ""
"By the way... why did the announcer call you 'The Flower Demon'?\\n\n"
"My nickname makes sense, but yours sounds like there's a story behind it."
"\"Flower Demon\\\"?\\n\n"
"His nicknames for ${{name}} and I at least make sense"

msgid "explainthyselfchristie2"
msgstr "Although yours, ${{name}}, was pretty cool too."

msgid "explainthyselfchristie3"
msgstr ""
"'Flower Demon' sounds like a title you earned.\"Flower Demon\\\" on the "
"other hand sounds like more than a nickname."

msgid "explainthyselfchristie4"
msgstr "... .... ..."

msgid "explainthyselfchristie5"
msgstr "Come on, Christie. You can't leave us hanging now!"

msgid "explainthyselfchristie6"
msgstr ""
"...Let's just say...\\n\n"
"Everyone steps onto the mats carrying something."

msgid "explainthyselfchristie7"
msgstr "Christie..."

msgid "maybeabattle"
msgstr "Enough talking!"

msgid "maybeabattle2"
msgstr ""
"Speck!\\n\n"
"First one to prove themselves in the arena wins!"

msgid "maybeabattle3"
msgstr "Christie... maybe we should wait for the officials..."

msgid "maybeabattle4"
msgstr ""
"Oh? Afraid you'll lose before the tournament even starts?\\n\n"
"Maybe ${{name}} has more confidence than you."

msgid "maybeabattle5"
msgstr "Alright... that's enough."

msgid "maybeabattle6"
msgstr "Fine! You're on!"

msgid "maybeabattle7"
msgstr "Now that's the spirit!"

msgid "maybeabattle8"
msgstr "Alright then... let's ro-"

msgid "haltyourbickering"
msgstr "STOP!"

msgid "haltyourbickering2"
msgstr ""
"I appreciate the competitive spirit, but this isn't the place.\\n\n"
"The purpose of this arena is to test your skill, not settle personal "
"rivalries."

msgid "haltyourbickering3"
msgstr "Now gather up like proper competitors."

msgid "haltyourbickering4"
msgstr ""
"If we're not supposed to compete against each other yet, then who are we "
"facing?"

msgid "haltyourbickering5"
msgstr ""
"The four academy competitors, obviously.\\n\n"
"Defeat them, then you can challenge the Arena Coach."

msgid "dontbemean"
msgstr "Hey! Why are you singling out ${{name}}?"

msgid "dontbemean2"
msgstr "I'm not singling anyone out. I'm enforcing the format."

msgid "dontbemean3"
msgstr "And some competitors need clearer instructions than others."

msgid "seeyalater"
msgstr ""
"The four hallways lead to four official academy competitors.\\n\n"
"Win your matches, then report back."

msgid "seeyalater2"
msgstr "That's it? No more explanation?"

msgid "seeyalater3"
msgstr "Correct."

msgid "seeyalater4"
msgstr ""
"This is a competition arena, not story time.\\n\n"
"Try not to embarrass your academies."

msgid "sorryabouthim"
msgstr "Sorry he's being like that, ${{name}}."

msgid "sorryabouthim2"
msgstr ""
"Yeah! Ignore him.\\n\n"
"You've got us now, and that's basically a team."

msgid "sorryabouthim3"
msgstr "So, when are you telling us more about yourself?"

msgid "sorryabouthim4"
msgstr "Christie, not now."

msgid "sorryabouthim5"
msgstr "Fine, fine."

msgid "doorchosen"
msgstr ""
"But Speck is right.\\n\n"
"We should focus on clearing the arena."

msgid "doorchosen2"
msgstr "I'll start with door 3! Lucky number 3 after all!"

msgid "doorchosen3"
msgstr "That girl is going to make this tournament interesting."

msgid "doorchosen4"
msgstr "I'll start with door 2. Good luck."

msgid "notyettababa"
msgstr ""
"Only one competitor can challenge this match at a time.\\n\n"
"Please choose another lane."

msgid "notyettababafourth"
msgstr ""
"This is the strongest competitor before the Arena Coach.\\n\n"
"Please clear the other matches first."

msgid "itslocked"
msgstr ""
"The door is locked.\\n\n"
"Try defeating all four academy competitors first."

msgid "healspls"
msgstr "Let me help you recover."

msgid "healsdone"
msgstr "You're recovered and ready to continue."

msgid "areyoureadytorumble"
msgstr "Are you ready for your next academy match?"

msgid "areyoureadytorumbleno"
msgstr "Very well. Come back once you're prepared."

msgid "areyoureadytorumbleyes"
msgstr ""
"Very well. Before we call your opponent, we'll make sure you're recovered."

msgid "areyoureadytorumbleyes2"
msgstr ""
"There. Now you're ready.\\n\n"
"We'll bring in the competitor."

msgid "uhhjason"
msgstr "Uhh... Jason?"

msgid "uhhjason2"
msgstr "Not again... he always misses his cue."

msgid "uhhjason3"
msgstr "JASON! Your match is up!"

msgid "challenger"
msgstr ""
"Competitor!\\n\n"
"Step onto the mats and face me!"

msgid "challenger2"
msgstr "You've done well to reach this lane."

msgid "challenger3"
msgstr "... .... ..."

msgid "challenger4"
msgstr ""
"Wait, this is your first official match?\\n\n"
"I thought I was supposed to be third..."

msgid "challenger5"
msgstr "No matter."

msgid "challenger6"
msgstr "That just means I get to test your basics first."

msgid "challenger7"
msgstr "Ready yourself, competitor. It's time to roll!"

msgid "tabacongratsfirst"
msgstr "... ... Good match."

msgid "tabacongratsfirst2"
msgstr ""
"I wasn't expecting that level of composure.\\n\n"
"Kyle told us you were an easy first-round win.\\n\n"
"Guess he meant easy for you."

msgid "tabacongratsfirst3"
msgstr ""
"The other academy competitors are much tougher than I am.\\n\n"
"You might want to spend some time drilling and sharpening your techniques "
"before taking them on.\\n\n"
"When you're ready, head through the exit behind me to return to the central "
"arena."

msgid "acolyte1loss"
msgstr ""
"Not bad... but not enough.\\n\n"
"Spend some time training and come back when you've improved."

msgid "acolyte1redo"
msgstr "Back for another round? Good. Let's see what you've learned."

msgid "healspls2"
msgstr ""
"You cleared the first match? Nicely done.\\n\n"
"Take a minute to recover before your next opponent."

msgid "healsdone2"
msgstr "There you go. You're ready for the next match."

msgid "acolyte2challenger"
msgstr "Well, hello there, competitor..."

msgid "acolyte2challenger2"
msgstr ""
"No, no, no. I'm over here... or am I?\\n\n"
"Meet me in the center and we'll find out."

msgid "acolyte2challenger3"
msgstr ""
"Still trying to read my movement? Good.\\n\n"
"I'm not like the last competitor you faced.\\n\n"
"My whole game is angles, feints, and making you reach.\\n\n"
"I'm Garth, your second academy match."

msgid "acolyte2challenger4"
msgstr ""
"Ahem.\\n\n"
"I'm Garth, your second academy match."

msgid "acolyte2challenger5"
msgstr "Chris! You ruined the entrance!"

msgid "acolyte2challenger6"
msgstr "Hi. Sorry about that. I'm Garth."

msgid "acolyte2challenger7"
msgstr "NO, CHRIS, IT'S TOO LATE! TURN THE LIGHTS BACK ON!"

msgid "acolyte2challenger8"
msgstr ""
"YOU HAD ONE JOB!\\n\n"
"Never mind. We're rolling anyway."

msgid "acolyte2challenger9"
msgstr ""
"Sorry again. Some officials have no sense of dramatic timing.\\n\n"
"I had this whole elusive grappler entrance planned.\\n\n"
"Anyway, I'm Garth, the second academy competitor.\\n\n"
"Let's see if you can deal with movement.\\n\n"
"Ready? Let's roll!\"unhinged\\\" Acolyte and scare everyone.\\n\n"
"Obviously that didn't happen, no thanks to Chris missing his mark.\n"
"\n"
"As I was saying, my name is Garth and I'm the second Acolyte.\n"
"\n"
"Presumably you're here to battle right? Well, let's get to it.\n"
"\n"
"AND.... LET'S FIGHT!"

msgid "acolyte2challengerloss"
msgstr ""
"Good effort, but you chased too much.\\n\n"
"Control the distance, then try again."

msgid "acolyte2challengerwin"
msgstr ""
"...Well done.\\n\n"
"I blame Chris for ruining my rhythm, obviously.\\n\n"
"Head through the exit behind me to return to the central arena."

msgid "acolyte2challengerredo"
msgstr "Back already? Good. Let's see if you've learned to cut angles."

msgid "healertabapassageway3"
msgstr ""
"That Christie girl is intense. She would not stop talking about guard "
"retention.\\n\n"
"Anyway, take a second to recover."

msgid "healertabapassageway3-2"
msgstr "There. You're ready for the next match. Good luck."

msgid "acolyte3challenger1"
msgstr "Wait... next competitor already?"

msgid "acolyte3challenger2"
msgstr "No... no, no, no."

msgid "acolyte3challenger3"
msgstr "I'm not warmed up yet. This is bad."

msgid "acolyte3challenger4"
msgstr "Bad. Very, very bad..."

msgid "acolyte3challenger5"
msgstr ""
"Wait... yes. I can make this work.\\n\n"
"Pressure first. Panic later."

msgid "acolyte3challenger6"
msgstr "Ohhh, this will be interesting."

msgid "acolyte3challenger7"
msgstr ""
"Stay right there. I need thirty seconds and a dangerous amount of caffeine."

msgid "acolyte3challenger8"
msgstr "I'm back. Mostly ready. Probably."

msgid "acolyte3challenger9"
msgstr ""
"There's nothing like grappling under pressure, is there?\\n\n"
"The nerves, the scramble, the moment everything goes wrong..."

msgid "acolyte3challenger10"
msgstr ""
"And then you either break...\\n\n"
"or you find out what kind of competitor you really are."

msgid "acolyte3challenger11"
msgstr "I've spent years chasing that feeling."

msgid "acolyte3challenger12"
msgstr ""
"Some people call it obsession.\\n\n"
"I call it preparation."

msgid "acolyte3challenger13"
msgstr "Cowards call it madness."

msgid "acolyte3challenger14"
msgstr ""
"Wait... you understand, don't you?\\n\n"
"You have that same look.\\n\n"
"Someone gave you a reason to fight."

msgid "acolyte3challenger15"
msgstr "Have you ever heard the name... Coach Atlas?"

msgid "acolyte3challenger16"
msgstr ""
"They all say the same thing.\\n\n"
"Greatest coach of his generation.\\n\n"
"Changed martial arts forever."

msgid "acolyte3challenger17"
msgstr ""
"I believed that too.\\n\n"
"I trained the way he trained.\\n\n"
"I pushed people the way he pushed people."

msgid "acolyte3challenger18"
msgstr ""
"But somewhere along the way...\\n\n"
"I forgot why I loved jiu jitsu in the first place."

msgid "acolyte3challenger19"
msgstr "Winning became everything."

msgid "acolyte3challenger20"
msgstr "People stopped being teammates... they became obstacles."

msgid "acolyte3challenger21"
msgstr "I lost my academy. My students. Everything."

msgid "acolyte3challenger22"
msgstr ""
"And Atlas?\\n\n"
"He just kept moving on to the next generation."

msgid "acolyte3challenger23"
msgstr ""
"So if you're chasing him too...\\n\n"
"Be careful what you're willing to sacrifice."

msgid "acolyte3challenger24"
msgstr "...Enough talking."

msgid "acolyte3challenger25"
msgstr ""
"Show me you're stronger than the obsession.\\n\n"
"Let's roll!"

msgid "acolyteiskayrazy"
msgstr "TIME!"

msgid "acolyteiskayrazy2"
msgstr ""
"Cam, that's enough.\\n\n"
"We cleared you for a controlled match, not a sermon about Atlas."

msgid "acolyteiskayrazy3"
msgstr "Don't lecture me! You don't know what he took from-"

msgid "acolyteiskayrazy4"
msgstr "Enough. Step away from the mat."

msgid "acolytewasdefeated"
msgstr "Mack, escort him out and get him checked over."

msgid "thisisntthelastofme"
msgstr "This isn't over. Atlas ruins everyone eventually!"

msgid "thisisntthelastofme2"
msgstr "Yeah, okay. Walk first, dramatic warning later."

msgid "acolytewasdefeated2"
msgstr ""
"Sorry about that.\\n\n"
"Cam used to be a solid competitor before he got wrapped up in Atlas's "
"methods."

msgid "acolytewasdefeated3"
msgstr ""
"He's been trying to come back for a while.\\n\n"
"Clearly, he still needs more time before competing again."

msgid "acolytewasdefeated4"
msgstr ""
"Since the third competitor has been pulled, you can move on to the next lane."
"\\n\n"
"I'll notify the officials."

msgid "acolytewasdefeated5"
msgstr "Good luck in the next match."

msgid "tabapassageway4heal"
msgstr ""
"You've done well to make it this far, but the competitor ahead is stronger "
"than you expect.\\n\n"
"No gimmicks this time. Just pressure, timing, and composure.\\n\n"
"Take a moment to recover."

msgid "tabapassageway4heal2"
msgstr "Good luck on the mats ahead."

msgid "tabaacolyte4talk"
msgstr ""
"Oh, hello there. I was beginning to think nobody would make it this far.\\n\n"
"Come on in. Don't be shy."

msgid "tabaacolyte4talk2"
msgstr ""
"I'm the fourth academy competitor.\\n\n"
"The last test before you face the Arena Coach.\\n\n"
"If you want that ranking medal, you'll have to get through me first."

msgid "tabaacolyte4talk3"
msgstr ""
"Heh. You've got spirit, I'll give you that.\\n\n"
"But spirit alone won't pass a guard."

msgid "tabaacolyte4talk4"
msgstr ""
"Is that your limit?\\n\n"
"If you want to chase King Of The Hill, you'll need more than that.\\n\n"
"Show me your real game."

msgid "tabaacolyte4talkwon"
msgstr ""
"Heh. I was wrong. Your ceiling is higher than mine today.\\n\n"
"The exit is behind me. It'll take you back to the central arena.\\n\n"
"Good luck against the Arena Coach."

msgid "tabaacolyte4talklost"
msgstr "Respect the mats. Reset, recover, and try again."

msgid "headupstairstababa"
msgstr ""
"Well... I definitely didn't expect you'd be the first competitor to clear "
"every match."

msgid "headupstairstababa2"
msgstr "Let me verify your Academy registration one last time."

msgid "headsupstairstababa3"
msgstr "Handed over your Academy Registration."

msgid "headupstairstababa4"
msgstr ""
"Standard procedure.\\n\n"
"We verify every competitor before allowing them to challenge the Arena Coach."

msgid "headupstairstababa5"
msgstr "I'm sure you understand."

msgid "headupstairstababa6"
msgstr "Received your Academy Registration back."

msgid "headupstairstababa7"
msgstr ""
"The Arena Coach is waiting upstairs.\\n\n"
"This is your biggest test yet.\\n\n"
"Good luck... even if I'm technically supposed to be rooting against you."

msgid "finaltabahealer"
msgstr ""
"You'll find the Arena Coach upstairs.\\n\n"
"I've got a feeling this one's going to be special.\\n\n"
"Let's get you recovered first."

msgid "finaltabahealer2"
msgstr ""
"Believe it or not, I've been the one patching everyone up all day.\\n\n"
"Now get out there and make all those recovery breaks worthwhile."

msgid "tabawaitup"
msgstr "Hey, ${{name}}! Wait up!"

msgid "tabawaitup2"
msgstr ""
"Phew... caught you.\\n\n"
"Looks like you're about to face the Arena Coach."

msgid "tabawaitup3"
msgstr "You didn't have to sprint up the stairs, Speck!"

msgid "tabawaitup4"
msgstr "Sprint? That was barely a warm-up."

msgid "tabawaitup5"
msgstr "One day I'm actually going to arm drag you down those stairs."

msgid "tabawaitup6"
msgstr ""
"Hey, ${{name}}, back me up here.\\n\n"
"That would be completely justified... right?"

msgid "tabawaitup7"
msgstr "Easy, you two. Save the competition for the mats."

msgid "tabawaitup8"
msgstr ""
"Seriously though...\\n\n"
"Have either of you thought about why they're running this Academy Network "
"now?"

msgid "tabawaitup9"
msgstr "You mean the rankings?"

msgid "tabawaitup10"
msgstr ""
"The rankings... the academies... King Of The Hill...\\n\n"
"It all happened so suddenly."

msgid "tabawaitup11"
msgstr ""
"Sensei Duncan believes it's giving young competitors a chance to grow.\\n\n"
"But after everything we've seen today... I can't help wondering if there's "
"something bigger going on.\\n\n"
"Either way, the Arena Coach is waiting. Let's give it everything we've got."

msgid "ripjimmy"
msgstr ""
"The plaque reads:\\n\n"
"Jimmy\\n\n"
"A loyal Academy Officer.\\n\n"
"He always put others before himself.\\n\n"
"The rest has weathered away."

msgid "tabanurse_dialog_welcome"
msgstr "Welcome to the Taba Town Recovery Centre!"

msgid "tabanurse_dialog_taba"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to the Taba Town Recovery Centre!\\n\n"
"Would you like me to patch you up before your next match?"

msgid "tabanurse_dialog_cotton"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to the Cotton Town Recovery Centre!\\n\n"
"Need to recover before getting back on the mats?"

msgid "okaythen"
msgstr "Perfect! Give me just a moment."

msgid "okaythen2"
msgstr ""
"You're all set!\\n\n"
"Good luck in your next match!"

msgid "waithere"
msgstr "We have to wait here for now. Apparently a tree fell up ahead."

msgid "nodrink"
msgstr "I'm pretty sure you're too young to drink..."

msgid "professorswife"
msgstr ""
"Oh No! You just missed him. I think he went into town though. Maybe check \n"
"there?"

msgid "professorswife_room"
msgstr "Hey! Don't just walk into someone's room without permission."

msgid "professorswife1"
msgstr ""
"I wish Maple would be easier to deal with. Her current attitude will \n"
"definitely get her in trouble in Cotton Town..."

msgid "professorswife2"
msgstr "Maybe you could check on her and let me know how she's doing?"

msgid "waithere2"
msgstr "Oh, I hope nobody got hurt from the fallen tree!"

msgid "understand?"
msgstr "Understand?"

msgid "input_name"
msgstr "Name?"

msgid "input_monster_name"
msgstr "Name your competitor"

msgid "happy_guy_dialog"
msgstr ""
"Hi there!\\n\n"
"Lots of competitors earn nicknames.\\n\n"
"Want to choose one?"

msgid "happy_rename"
msgstr "Nice! That nickname has a champion's ring to it."

msgid "shady_guy_dialog"
msgstr ""
"Shady Guy: Hey. If you have some... 'trouble' attached to your name I can \n"
"fix it for you..."

msgid "shady_rename"
msgstr "Shady Guy: Good luck with your new name, friend..."

msgid "maple_bedroom_sign"
msgstr "It's a calendar and the 27 April is circled in pink."

msgid "maple_bedroom_sign_apr27"
msgstr ""
"Today is ${{today}} â€” the date Maple circled in pink. Whatever it means, "
"she clearly cares about it."

msgid "flashback_apr27_start"
msgstr "The room blurs... A memory surfaces."

msgid "flashback_apr27_maple_1"
msgstr ""
"Maple: He's getting worse, Callie. I can't stay here. Not withâ€¦ whatever "
"he's getting involved in."

msgid "flashback_apr27_callie_1"
msgstr "Callie: Maple... you don't know the whole story. He's trying to help-"

msgid "flashback_apr27_maple_2"
msgstr ""
"Maple: Help? Whispers behind closed doorsâ€¦ things he won't explainâ€¦\n"
" I can't risk staying here with him like this."

msgid "flashback_apr27_kay_voice"
msgstr "Girls! Come down for a moment! I've made a breakthrough!"

msgid "flashback_apr27_maple_3"
msgstr ""
"Maple: I'm sorry. I wish I could take ${{name}} with me. But if he finds out "
"Iâ€¦"

msgid "flashback_apr27_maple_final"
msgstr "Maple: ${{today}}... I have to go."

msgid "flashback_apr27_callie_final"
msgstr "Callie: Mapleâ€¦ waitâ€” just talk to me before you go."

msgid "flashback_apr27_end"
msgstr "The memory fades away..."

msgid "maple_pc_entry_1"
msgstr ""
"April 27. I can't stay. Not with what he's planning.\n"
" If you're reading thisâ€¦ I'm sorry. I hope you never have to understand "
"why."

msgid "taba_house1_sign"
msgstr "Mr and Ms Clawbrew House"

msgid "taba_house2_sign"
msgstr "Legacy Library"

msgid "taba_house3_sign"
msgstr "The Thoughtful Leaf Inn"

msgid "taba_house4_sign"
msgstr "The Honorable Seagulls Pub"

msgid "taba_house1_calendar"
msgstr ""
"It's a calendar with the 30 September and the 12 February circled in red."

msgid "taba_house1_calendar_feb12"
msgstr ""
"Today is ${{today}} â€” one of the circled dates. It must mean something to "
"the people living here."

msgid "taba_house1_calendar_sep30"
msgstr ""
"It's ${{today}}, one of the dates marked in red. Someone here clearly finds "
"this day important."

msgid "taba_house1_husband1"
msgstr "Back in my day I was one of the toughest competitors in the region!"

msgid "taba_house1_husband_extra"
msgstr "One day people will finally appreciate my competition footage."

msgid "taba_house1_husband_feb12"
msgstr ""
"${{today}}... the day I almost qualified for King Of The Hill. At least "
"that's how I remember it."

msgid "taba_house1_husband_sep30"
msgstr ""
"${{today}}... another glorious anniversary of almost becoming champion."

msgid "taba_house1_wife1"
msgstr "Trainer? My husband is delusional."

msgid "taba_house1_wife_extra"
msgstr ""
"Please don't encourage him. He'll start talking about imaginary battles "
"again."

msgid "taba_house1_wife_feb12"
msgstr ""
"Every year on ${{today}} he tells that same story. I've never seen a single "
"piece of evidence."

msgid "taba_house1_wife_sep30"
msgstr ""
"He insists ${{today}} is important. I think he just likes circling things on "
"calendars."

msgid "taba_house1_reading"
msgstr "The book is Philosophy of Illusionary Studies by Jaiden Gemrevenza."

msgid "taba_house1_watching"
msgstr ""
"It's a documentary about the strangest and most wonderful Tuxemon in the "
"region,\n"
"\n"
" as well as the strange behaviors they have adopted."

msgid "taba_house2_owner1"
msgstr ""
"It's a documentary about the strangest and most exciting competitors in the "
"region.\\n\n"
"Every athlete seems to have their own style, habits, and rituals."

msgid "taba_house2_reading1"
msgstr "The book is Guard Fundamentals: Posture, Frames and Survival."

msgid "taba_house2_reading2"
msgstr "The book is The Complete Guide to Sweeps and Reversals."

msgid "taba_house2_reading3"
msgstr "The book is Championship Mindset: Consistency Over Talent."

msgid "taba_house2_reading4"
msgstr "The book is Strength Without Stiffness: Mobility for Grapplers."

msgid "taba_house2_reader1a"
msgstr "A good grappler trains the body and studies the game."

msgid "taba_house2_reader2a"
msgstr "Every technique I study gives me another option on the mats."

msgid "taba_house2_reader3a"
msgstr "The more positions I understand, the calmer I become during a roll."

msgid "taba_house2_reader4a"
msgstr "Instructionals help, but you still need to drill each movement until it becomes instinct."

msgid "taba_house2_books"
msgstr ""
"Beginner study: posture, frames, escapes and guard retention.
"
"
"
"Intermediate study: sweeps, submissions, takedowns and guard passing.
"
"
"
"Advanced study: strategy, competition mindset, recovery and coaching."

msgid "taba_house3_owner1"
msgstr "Welcome to The Thoughtful Leaf Inn!"

msgid "taba_house3_client1a"
msgstr "I'm resting while my sister is probably reading some books."

msgid "taba_house3_client2a"
msgstr "Thinking too much can harm us."

msgid "taba_house3_client3a"
msgstr "It makes me think about my mom's house."

msgid "taba_house3_client4a"
msgstr ""
"I'm here with my sister, our uncle sent us both off to Taba to search for \n"
"information."

msgid "taba_house3_client5a"
msgstr "Our uncles's TUMBLEBEE hives are dying out."

msgid "taba_house3_choice1"
msgstr "Loss of natural habitat?"

msgid "taba_house3_choice2"
msgstr "Use of pesticides?"

msgid "taba_house3_client5a_first"
msgstr ""
"It could be! If we can all plant flowers, shrubs and trees, and stop mowing."

msgid "taba_house3_client5a_second"
msgstr "We are scared about pesticides."

msgid "taba_house4_owner1"
msgstr "Welcome to The Honorable Seagulls Pub!"

msgid "taba_house4_client1a"
msgstr "My grandma used to do a similar dish!"

msgid "taba_house4_waiter1"
msgstr "Many dishes dropped off the new menu!"

msgid "taba_house4_client2a"
msgstr "Eh? Just filling up an empty stomach."

msgid "taba_house4_client3a"
msgstr "Luckily I didn't pay for this. How can you pay for this?"

msgid "taba_house4_dish1"
msgstr "It's brown, dense, but it doesn't look like pudding..."

msgid "cotton_misa_fireplace"
msgstr "It looks like someone burned papers."

msgid "cotton_misa_tv"
msgstr ""
"What's on TV? The story of how Omnichannel became a global phenomenon, \n"
"reflecting and influencing a generation in the process."

msgid "cotton_misa_granny"
msgstr "Are you here to ask for my grand-daughter's hand?"

msgid "cotton_misa_granny_yes"
msgstr ""
"Ah, well good luck with that! She inherited my witty personality and her \n"
"Mother's temper, so she's a handful!"

msgid "cotton_misa_granny_no"
msgstr "No? I'm sorry!"

msgid "cotton_misa_granny2"
msgstr ""
"Oh! You must be one of those friends my granddaughter was talking about!"

msgid "cotton_misa_littlebro"
msgstr "My sister is very nice to me."

msgid "cotton_underground_stop"
msgstr "Sorry, I'm under orders to let no one pass."

msgid "cotton_breeder0"
msgstr ""
"Hi there! Welcome to the Academy Training Centre!\\n\n"
"If you're taking a break from competing, I can keep one of your academy "
"teammates training while you explore.\\n\n"
"They'll continue improving until you return.\\n\n"
"What can I do for you today?"

msgid "cotton_breeder1"
msgstr ""
"Would you like to leave one of your teammates here to continue training?"

msgid "taba_greeting1"
msgstr ""
"Greeter Jaime: Hey ${{name}}! Heard you joined the Academy Network!\\n\n"
"Best of luck climbing the rankings."

msgid "taba_greeting2a"
msgstr ""
"The shop is doing a promo, so here are some supplies to get you started.\\n\n"
"They should help during your first few academy matches."

msgid "taba_greeting2b"
msgstr ""
"Ah! I see you've already got some. You've got a good head on your shoulders, "
"${{name}}.\\n\n"
"I'm sure you'll be a serious competitor in no time."

msgid "taba_greeting3"
msgstr ""
"Good luck on your journey, ${{name}}, and remember to shop at the Academy "
"Supply Store for all your training needs!\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"Sorry about the sales pitch. It's my job."

msgid "gotfivecompetitor_contracts"
msgstr "You got some training supplies."

msgid "got_new_tuxemon"
msgstr "A new fighter joined the team!"

msgid "xero_omnichannel_sign"
msgstr "KOTHchannel Regional Broadcasting Headquarters"

msgid "taba_town_homeplace"
msgstr "${{name}}'s house"

msgid "taba_town_sign_profhouse"
msgstr "Sensei Duncan's House"

msgid "taba_town_sign_proflab"
msgstr "Sensei Duncan's Academy Office"

msgid "taba_town_sign_tuxemart"
msgstr "Academy Supply Store"

msgid "taba_town_sign_tuxecenter"
msgstr "Recovery Centre"

msgid "leather_town_open_air"
msgstr "Open Air Cafe and Marketplace"

msgid "xero_citypark_achievement"
msgstr "Achievement Maniac's House"

msgid "xero_shaft1_sign"
msgstr "Shaft Headquarters: Mining Division"

msgid "xero_shaft2_sign"
msgstr "Shaft Headquarters: Public Relations Division"

msgid "xero_taba_tvwatch"
msgstr ""
"What's on TV? The story of how KOTH became a global jiu jitsu phenomenon,"
"\\n\n"
"inspiring competitors across every academy in the region."

msgid "xero_taba_poster"
msgstr "Home sweet home!"

msgid "xero_taba_restinbed"
msgstr "You wake up fully rested and ready to train!"

msgid "xero_skip_question"
msgstr "Do you want to skip the intro?"

msgid "spyder_cathedral"
msgstr "Cathedral"

msgid "bill_cathedral"
msgstr "Cathedral Bill"

msgid "spyder_pay_cathedral"
msgstr ""
"SCAN TO PAY. You can scan the QR code and make payment to the Cathedral."

msgid "spyder_billing_cathedral1"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to the Cathedral Center!\n"
"\n"
" Would you like to heal your monsters?"

msgid "spyder_billing_cathedral2"
msgstr "All done. That will be ${{currency}}${{var:party_lost_hp}}."

msgid "spyder_billing_cathedral3"
msgstr ""
"Plus a ${{currency}}${{var:cathedral_fee}} call-out fee if we had to send \n"
"the ambulance to collect you."

msgid "spyder_billing_cathedral4"
msgstr ""
"Oh, you can't afford to pay? No problem. We'll add it to your bill, plus \n"
"${{var:cathedral_interest_full}}% interest."

msgid "spyder_billing_cathedral5"
msgstr ""
"When you win money, we'll take a share [${{var:cathedral_share_full}}%] \n"
"until you've paid us back. Easy peasy!"

msgid "spyder_billing_cathedral6"
msgstr "Thank you for choosing Cathedral! Have a wonderful day!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_tuxemon1"
msgstr ""
"Hey buddy, I couldn't help but notice those medical fees are building up. I "
"work for Scoop, I know some guys.\n"
"\n"
" Why don't you sell me one of your tuxemon so you can get out from under "
"that debt?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_tuxemon2"
msgstr "Which one?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_tuxemon3"
msgstr "I can give you ${{currency}}${{var:scoop_price}}, is it ok?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_tuxemon4"
msgstr "Let me know if you change your mind!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_tuxemon5"
msgstr ""
"What, you thought you'd get cash back? Academy gear isn't cheap.\\n\n"
"I'm helping you out with your tab, not handing out prize money."

msgid "spyder_intro_question"
msgstr "Do you want to skip the intro?"

msgid "spyder_intro00"
msgstr ""
"Hello, I am KOTH, founder of King Of The Hill and CEO of KOTHchannel.\\n\n"
"It is my duty to welcome you to the future of competitive jiu jitsu."

msgid "spyder_intro01"
msgstr ""
"Across this region, competitors train every day to improve their skills, "
"earn rankings, and represent their academies.\\n\n"
"Some are white belts taking their first steps. Others are elite grapplers "
"chasing greatness.\\n\n"
"But every journey starts on the mats."

msgid "spyder_intro02"
msgstr ""
"Through the KOTHchannel Academy Network, athletes can compete, earn ranking "
"points, and work their way toward official qualifiers.\\n\n"
"The very best may one day reach the biggest stage in the sport: King Of The "
"Hill."

msgid "spyder_intro03"
msgstr ""
"Train hard. Compete clean. Respect your opponents.\\n\n"
"And remember: talent matters, but discipline carries you further."

msgid "spyder_intro_shopkeeper1"
msgstr ""
"What a presentation! New Academy Network members are being offered starter "
"training supplies."

msgid "spyder_intro_shopkeeper2"
msgstr "Just fill in this registration form."

msgid "spyder_intro_question_name"
msgstr "What is your name?"

msgid "spyder_intro_shopkeeper3"
msgstr ""
"Please return the form to the Academy Supply Assistant, so we can finish "
"your registration."

msgid "spyder_intro_shopkeeper4"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, this offer is only for registered Academy Network members.\\n\n"
"Please come back once your paperwork is complete."

msgid "spyder_preintro00"
msgstr ""
"Alright, let's get this over with. This is the tenth take. Can we please "
"sound like actual martial artists this time?"

msgid "spyder_preintro01"
msgstr ""
"I swear, if I have to say 'elite pathway to greatness' one more time, I'm "
"going to pull guard and refuse to stand up."

msgid "spyder_preintro02"
msgstr ""
"We're going to sound like a bad motivational poster. Can't we just say: "
"train hard, compete, get better?"

msgid "spyder_preintro03"
msgstr ""
"I'm starting to think the marketing team has never actually rolled before."

msgid "spyder_preintro04"
msgstr ""
"Fine. Let's just do it. But please, for the love of jiu jitsu, sound sincere."

msgid "spyder_postintro00"
msgstr ""
"Well, that's a wrap. I hope the broadcast gets athletes excited.\\n\n"
"Honestly, the Academy Network might actually work if people take it "
"seriously."

msgid "spyder_postintro01"
msgstr ""
"Still, selling dreams is easy.\\n\n"
"Building real competitors takes years of hard rounds, injuries, losses, and "
"showing up when nobody is watching."

msgid "spyder_postintro02"
msgstr ""
"But hey... every champion starts somewhere.\\n\n"
"Maybe this region is about to find its next one."

msgid "spyder_papertown_stopthere"
msgstr ""
"Hey! What do you think you're doing?\\n\n"
"It's not safe to enter the open routes without academy registration.\\n\n"
"Go get signed up before you wander into trouble."

msgid "spyder_papertown_homemaker1"
msgstr ""
"How are you, ${{name}}?\\n\n"
"Quiet and focused as always, I see."

msgid "spyder_papertown_mom1"
msgstr ""
"Good morning, sunshine! Rest here any time you like.\\n\n"
"Why am I saying that? You live here!"

msgid "spyder_papertown_mom2"
msgstr ""
"Hello dear. I should get back to my projects.\\n\n"
"Can you occupy yourself for a bit?\\n\n"
"Back in my day, we trained with anything we could find: towels, chairs, "
"heavy bags, stubborn siblings..."

msgid "spyder_papertown_mom3"
msgstr ""
"Oh, you've registered with an academy. Congratulations!\\n\n"
"Why don't you head toward the next town and see where training takes you?"

msgid "spyder_papertown_mom4"
msgstr "Welcome back! Look at you, growing up so fast."

msgid "spyder_papertown_mom5"
msgstr ""
"You know, Granny Piper next door has opened an Academy Training Centre.\\n\n"
"Not everyone can be an inventor, I suppose."

msgid "spyder_papertown_mom6"
msgstr ""
"Congratulations! You helped clean up the regional circuit.\\n\n"
"Of course, now lots of people have to find honest work... but you did the "
"right thing. I think."

msgid "spyder_papertown_grannypiper1"
msgstr ""
"Oh hello, ${{name}}! I didn't see you there among all this hustle and "
"equipment.\\n\n"
"I can't wait until the Academy Training Centre is ready!"

msgid "spyder_papertown_grannypiper2"
msgstr ""
"You know, the Pipers made our fortune running training centres.\\n\n"
"I've been retired for ten years and I'm bored. I want to get back on the "
"mats!"

msgid "spyder_papertown_grannypiper3"
msgstr ""
"Good morning! Oh, ${{name}}, it's you! You must have heard my Academy "
"Training Centre is open.\\n\n"
"Want to know how it works? You leave a teammate here, and I keep them "
"training while you travel.\\n\n"
"When you return, pay a small fee and they'll be stronger than when you left."

msgid "spyder_papertown_grannypiper4"
msgstr ""
"Hello, ${{name}}. Would you like to leave a teammate at my Academy Training "
"Centre?"

msgid "spyder_papertown_grannypiper8"
msgstr ""
"Place your tuxemon in the Daycare Center! Give us a tuxemon, and we will "
"look after it while you travel.\n"
"\n"
" When you return, pay a small fee and we'll return it. The longer tuxemon "
"are in our care, the higher in level they will rise!"

msgid "spyder_papertown_grannypiper9"
msgstr ""
"Dearie, I can't take your only tuxemon! Come back when you have another."

msgid "spyder_papertown_grannypiper10"
msgstr "It looks like a business plan."

msgid "spyder_papertown_myfirstmon"
msgstr ""
"Hey, you came! Perfect.\\n\n"
"A few local academies donated equipment and uniforms for new competitors."
"\\n\n"
"They also asked a handful of beginners to volunteer for the Academy Network."
"\\n\n"
"Maybe one of them would like to train with you."

msgid "spyder_papertown_myfirstmon_notmet"
msgstr ""
"I've been expecting you.\\n\n"
"If you're looking to start your journey, I might be able to help.\\n\n"
"Some new competitors are waiting for an academy to call home."

msgid "spyder_papertown_myfirstmon1"
msgstr "*looks through the registration forms*"

msgid "spyder_papertown_myfirstmon2"
msgstr ""
"Here we are!\\n\n"
"Take your time and choose carefully.\\n\n"
"Every great competitor starts somewhere."

msgid "spyder_papertown_thereis"
msgstr "There is a registration form here..."

msgid "spyder_papertown_rockitten"
msgstr "Do you want the pressure passer?"

msgid "spyder_papertown_lambert"
msgstr "Do you want the defensive white belt?"

msgid "spyder_papertown_nut"
msgstr "Do you want the explosive wrestler?"

msgid "spyder_papertown_tweesher"
msgstr "Do you want the technical guard player?"

msgid "spyder_papertown_agnite"
msgstr "Do you want the aggressive striker?"

msgid "spyder_papertown_firstfight"
msgstr ""
"Hey! What are you doing over there?\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"So you've already found someone willing to train with you?\\n\n"
"Let's see if they're actually ready for competition!"

msgid "spyder_papertown_firstfight_win"
msgstr ""
"Huh... not bad.\\n\n"
"Looks like you've got potential after all."

msgid "spyder_papertown_firstfight_pause"
msgstr "..."

msgid "spyder_papertown_firstfight_lose"
msgstr "Looks like both you and your teammate need more training!"

msgid "spyder_papertown_firstfight_after"
msgstr ""
"I'll patch you up this time.\\n\n"
"Next time, make sure you recover properly before stepping back onto the mats."

msgid "spyder_cottontown_monk"
msgstr ""
"I am assigned by the Dojo of the Elements to maintain the statues here.\\n\n"
"KOTHchannel is helping preserve the old academy grounds while the circuit "
"expands.\\n\n"
"I hope the next generation remembers what these places meant."

msgid "spyder_cottontown_hackerintro"
msgstr ""
"Hey, nice academy registration. Mind if I see your ranking profile?\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"Just kidding. I had a feeling you were new to the circuit.\\n\n"
"For years, the strongest academies have kept their training data private."
"\\n\n"
"Want to help make rankings and technique records more open to everyone?\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"Good. I have a project for you. Meet me in the Cafe."

msgid "spyder_cotton_cafegranny"
msgstr "Hmm, I'm not sure I fancy this coffee."

msgid "spyder_cotton_cafeassistant"
msgstr ""
"Do you compete? I want to start training, but leaving the city makes me "
"nervous."

msgid "spyder_cotton_homemaker1"
msgstr "Are you here for the talk? I'm so excited for the launch."

msgid "spyder_cotton_homemaker2"
msgstr ""
"Competitor Database is great, isn't it? I'm one of the programmers.\\n\n"
"Tell me if you find any bugs."

msgid "spyder_cottontown_stopthere"
msgstr ""
"Hey, that's not cool! You have to come to my talk at the cafe before you "
"run\n"
" off!"

msgid "spyder_cottontown_followme"
msgstr "The Cafe is located on the other side of these houses."

msgid "spyder_cottontown_mom"
msgstr ""
"Well hello stranger! What are you doing going into a Cafe? \n"
"\n"
" You know caffeine is bad for you. I'm kidding! \n"
"\n"
" You're a grown up of 12 years old, you can do whatever you like! ... No "
"alcohol .... \n"
"\n"
" But you should call home more often. I want someone to tell about my "
"inventions. \n"
"\n"
" ... Oh, I forget, you haven't got a phone yet. Here's one I invented. I "
"call it the Nu Phone! \n"
"\n"
" You can install all sorts of apps on it. It already has the Map App, so "
"you'll never get lost!"

msgid "spyder_cottontown_mom1"
msgstr ""
"Talk about a parting shot!\\n\n"
"The regional ranking network seems to have gone down.\\n\n"
"At least, I hope it's nothing more serious than that."

msgid "spyder_cottontown_hacker1"
msgstr ""
"Great work on the Competitor Database, my friend.\\n\n"
"You're our top contributor."

msgid "spyder_cottontown_mom2"
msgstr "!!!"

msgid "spyder_lostfight"
msgstr ""
"I guess I shouldn't have picked that fight. But it's the spirit, the "
"spirit \n"
"of too much coffee, that matters!"

msgid "spyder_confused1"
msgstr ""
"This guy won't let me through! I can't figure out how to get out of town! If "
"I win, you have to tell me how! \n"
"\n"
" If I lose... the same!"

msgid "spyder_confused2"
msgstr ""
"Oh, you say there is another way out on the opposite side of town? Just go \n"
"right and go straight past the heal center? Thanks!"

msgid "spyder_cottontown_hacker2"
msgstr ""
"Right, right!\\n\n"
"There's a data center along the river to the north-east of Timber Town.\\n\n"
"If anyone tampered with the ranking network, that's where we'd find the "
"trail."

msgid "spyder_pc_alert"
msgstr "Kernel panic - not syncing: Fatal Machine check"

msgid "spyder_door_locked"
msgstr "The door is locked!"

msgid "spyder_cottontown_enforcer"
msgstr "Butt out of it, kid, this is private property!"

msgid "spyder_cottontown_enforcer1"
msgstr "I told you before - scram!"

msgid "spyder_cottontown_enforcer2"
msgstr "It is I who must scram!"

msgid "spyder_cottontunnel_professor1"
msgstr ""
"Drat this infernal maze of tunnels... \n"
"\n"
" Oh, hello child... \n"
"\n"
" Me, lost?...  \n"
"\n"
" Not at all. I know exactly where I am."

msgid "spyder_cottontunnel_shopassistant1"
msgstr "I hope the professor is okay. He said he saw a fossil and ran off!"

msgid "spyder_cottontunnel_carlos1"
msgstr ""
"I fell down a crack in the Dragon's Cave and wound up here somehow.\n"
"\n"
" Show me out of here, peasant!"

msgid "spyder_cottontunnel_carlos2"
msgstr "Hmm, perhaps I could have phrased that more nicely."

msgid "spyder_cottontunnel_benden_nocap"
msgstr ""
"It... escaped! Drokoro is free! Perhaps...\n"
"\n"
" Perhaps it'll find a place where it can grow strong, where it can truly be "
"itself. There is still hope."

msgid "spyder_cottontunnel_benden_cap"
msgstr ""
"You... You captured it. Know this, though: the path to becoming a true "
"Dragonrider has begun.\n"
"\n"
" You'll face many challenges, many trials.\n"
"\n"
" But if you're worthy, you'll find your own path to balance, your own way to "
"protect this land."

msgid "spyder_cottontunnel_benden1"
msgstr ""
"We, the Dragonriders, will retreat to Lion Mountain.\n"
"\n"
" There, we'll watch over this land from afar, hoping that the balance can "
"somehow be restored."

msgid "spyder_cottoncafe_hackerchat"
msgstr ""
"It's so cool that you're helping with the Competitor Database.\\n\n"
"  ...\\n\n"
" Is there a prize for adding every athlete profile?\\n\n"
" Only the satisfaction of helping the sport grow, buddy."

msgid "spyder_cottoncafe_barmaidintro"
msgstr ""
"We call ourselves Team Bazaar. Maybe that's a little pretentious.\\n\n"
"We're a group of rogues, coaches, and coffee addicts who discuss philosophy "
"and support local competitors.\\n\n"
"We try to look out for each other. Unlike the expensive recovery centres, we "
"don't charge to patch you up.\\n\n"
"Would you like to recover now?"

msgid "spyder_cottoncafe_barmaid"
msgstr "Welcome back. Want me to help you recover?"

msgid "spyder_cottonart_barmaid"
msgstr ""
"Do you like my set?\\n\n"
"They capture my early days as a professional grappler, before I retired on "
"my winnings.\\n\n"
"I call them: 'Grip Fight', 'Starry Open Mat Night' and 'Trepidation'. "
"They're for sale!\\n\n"
"Get them while they're hot! Just 1,000 each."

msgid "spyder_cottonart_barmaid_bundle"
msgstr "Do you want to buy all three paintings for ${{currency}}3,000?"

msgid "spyder_cottonart_barmaid_single"
msgstr "Do you want to buy this painting for ${{currency}}1,000?"

msgid "spyder_cottonart_barmaid_painting_sold_billie"
msgstr ""
"The painting has been bought and donated back to the gallery by Billie!"

msgid "spyder_cottonart_barmaid_bundle_sold"
msgstr ""
"It looks like you're my collector now! I'll replace the original with \n"
"copies!"

msgid "spyder_cottonart_billie"
msgstr ""
"I see you're trying to broaden your horizons. That's cute. Just try not to \n"
"touch anything."

msgid "spyder_cottonart_granny"
msgstr ""
"I must be getting nostalgic. I almost said \n"
"\n"
" \"Back in my day, things were better!\""

msgid "spyder_cottonart_goth"
msgstr ""
"I used to enjoy coming here every weekend to look at the paintings. \n"
"\n"
" Now all the best ones have been sold and the tickets are too expensive. \n"
"\n"
" But my nanna wanted to come, so ..."

msgid "spyder_cottonart_florist"
msgstr ""
"What do you think of the blue painting of a ship in the harbor? \n"
"\n"
" It's in the impressionist style - that means it tries to capture how light "
"looks and behaves. \n"
"\n"
" See the small red sun reflected along the waves of the water?"

msgid "spyder_cottonart_shopkeeper"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to the Cotton Town Art Gallery. Ah - I mean Art Shop! \n"
"\n"
" Ever since they cut our funding, we've had to sell the artworks instead of "
"just displaying them. \n"
"\n"
" Entry is ${{currency}}50. It goes toward the company's annual dividend."

msgid "spyder_cottonscoop_shopassistant"
msgstr ""
"Recruitment invites allow you to add new competitors to your academy team."
"\\n\n"
"They work best after you've proven yourself in a match.\\n\n"
"Select them during competition from your Item menu."

msgid "spyder_cottonscoop_deviceoffer"
msgstr ""
"Recruitment invites let you bring new competitors into your academy team."
"\\n\n"
"They work best after you've proven yourself in a match.\\n\n"
"Use them from your Item menu."

msgid "spyder_cottonscoop_devicenoexplan"
msgstr ""
"Okay, well here's five as a free sample.\\n\n"
"If you have any questions about how recruitment invites work, just ask my "
"assistant!"

msgid "spyder_cottonscoop_deviceexplan"
msgstr "Let my assistant introduce you."

msgid "spyder_cottonscoop_deviceexplan2"
msgstr ""
"Recruitment invites allow you to add new competitors to your academy team."
"\\n\n"
"They work best after you've proven yourself in a match. Select them during "
"competition from your Item menu.\\n\n"
"Thank you for listening. Here's five invites as a free sample."

msgid "spyder_cotton_tuxepediawelcome"
msgstr "Good to see you. You're just in time."

msgid "spyder_cotton_tuxepediaahem"
msgstr "Ahem."

msgid "spyder_cotton_tuxepediaintro"
msgstr ""
"Currently, reliable information about competitors is scattered across "
"expensive private databases.\\n\n"
"That's not cool; information should be freely available. That's why we're "
"introducing the Competitor Database.\\n\n"
"It's open source, free, and available for everyone to read, write, and edit."
"\\n\n"
"You can open it from the menu."

msgid "spyder_cotton_tuxepediaintro2"
msgstr ""
"All it takes to add information is to meet that competitor in the circuit. "
"It is so cool."

msgid "spyder_cotton_tuxepediaintro3"
msgstr ""
"You are so engrossed reading the new entries, that you don't notice people \n"
"leaving."

msgid "spyder_cotton_tuxepediaintro4"
msgstr ""
"It's so cool that you came. There are still so many competitors to be added."
"\\n\n"
"You could really get into it, and make a difference to the sport."

msgid "spyder_request_fight"
msgstr "Do you want a quick battle?"

msgid "spyder_cotton_cafegoth"
msgstr "Don't look at me. I'm just here for the free canapes and heals."

msgid "spyder_cotton_cafeflorist1"
msgstr "Shhh, it's about to begin."

msgid "spyder_cotton_cafeflorist2"
msgstr ""
"I can't wait to fact-check everyone else's entries. \n"
"\n"
" You better make sure you have good sources!"

msgid "spyder_route2_billie1"
msgstr "Hey cheapskate! Still training with that bargain-bin competitor?"

msgid "spyder_route2_billie2"
msgstr ""
"This was a fluke. My academy gear was expensive, and that means it's high "
"quality."

msgid "spyder_route2_graf1"
msgstr "I'm an ace - in battling and tennis!"

msgid "spyder_route2_marion1"
msgstr "So many tasty ants around! ... For my Aardorn, I mean."

msgid "spyder_route2_roddick1"
msgstr "When I was ambushed on the dunny by SPIGHTER I was pretty creeped out."

msgid "spyder_route2_roddick2"
msgstr "Hey, you didn't seem creeped out at all!"

msgid "spyder_citypark_maniac"
msgstr "Phew, we're pooped!"

msgid "spyder_citypark_granny"
msgstr "We'll walk back to Leather Town after a little rest."

msgid "spyder_citypark_florist"
msgstr "Enjoy the flower display! It's the pride of Leather Town."

msgid "spyder_citypark2_florist"
msgstr ""
"The flowers look okay, don't they? ... Ever since the mining began in \n"
"Leather Town, the flowers have been under the weather!"

msgid "spyder_generic_nurse"
msgstr "Hey, you look tired. Let me help you feel better!"

msgid "spyder_output_nurse1"
msgstr ""
"You should be good as new now! Just take it easy for a bit and you'll be \n"
"back to your old self in no time."

msgid "spyder_output_nurse2"
msgstr ""
"All better! I'm glad I could help. You were looking a bit rough there for "
"a \n"
"second."

msgid "spyder_output_nurse3"
msgstr ""
"There we go! You're all fixed up. Don't worry about it, it's all part of "
"the\n"
" service."

msgid "spyder_output_nurse4"
msgstr ""
"All healed up! Now, let's get you back on your feet and get you moving \n"
"again."

msgid "spyder_output_nurse5"
msgstr "You're all patched up now, just take a load off and rest for a bit."

msgid "spyder_output_nurse6"
msgstr "Feeling better already? I'm glad I could lend a hand."

msgid "spyder_output_nurse7"
msgstr "All better now! You were a bit worse for wear, but you're good as new."

msgid "spyder_route2_graf2"
msgstr "I got served."

msgid "spyder_route2_marion2"
msgstr "I don't eat ants."

msgid "spyder_citypark_frances2"
msgstr "You must come and visit some time. "

msgid "spyder_citypark_frances1"
msgstr ""
"I have the finest gardens in all the land. That's why these Shybulb keep \n"
"turning up."

msgid "spyder_citypark_bobette1"
msgstr " I love cats. An Aardorn is basically a cat, right?"

msgid "spyder_citypark_bobette2"
msgstr " A cat would have won â€¦"

msgid "spyder_citypark_edith1"
msgstr ""
"Hey, did you say I fight like my teammate? I'll roll with you for that!"

msgid "spyder_citypark_edith2"
msgstr "Hmm, you may have a point."

msgid "spyder_museum_entrance1"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to the museum of natural history! It's free, but depends on your \n"
"generous donations. Would you consider a donation of ${{currency}}50?"

msgid "spyder_museum_entrance2"
msgstr ""
"Please explore our five sections, and make sure to read about our five \n"
"sponsors."

msgid "spyder_museum_entrance3"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately we now need to charge for tickets. ${{currency}}100 please."

msgid "spyder_museum_shopkeeper_chat"
msgstr "I volunteer to keep the museum as affordable as possible. "

msgid "spyder_museum_miner1"
msgstr ""
"There used to be a whole section here on the history of our world! \n"
"\n"
" But when Nimrod became the sponsor, they replaced it with just military "
"history! \n"
"\n"
" Now everyone is just inventing their own theories of world history!"

msgid "spyder_museum_postboy1"
msgstr ""
"Did you know that the first spectacles were made of beryl, not glass? \n"
"\n"
" â€¦ \n"
"\n"
" I learned that last year from a guide at this museum! But there aren't any "
"guides around this place any more."

msgid "spyder_museum_visitor1"
msgstr ""
"I'm not sure I like this. I've seen it happen before - a big sponsor comes "
"in, and suddenly the museum's focus changes.\n"
"\n"
" I hope they're not going to start prioritizing profit over preservation."

msgid "spyder_museum_security1"
msgstr ""
"I've seen a lot of changes over the years, but this one feels different.\n"
"\n"
" I've worked with some great people who've left because of the new direction "
"the museum is taking.\n"
"\n"
" It's hard to see the place I love changing in ways that don't feel right to "
"me."

msgid "spyder_museum_historian1"
msgstr ""
"I'm trying to research the history of our world, but it's like they're "
"erasing it.\n"
"\n"
" I've been trying to get access to the archives for months, but Nimrod's "
"people keep stonewalling me.\n"
"\n"
" I'm starting to feel like I'm running out of time."

msgid "spyder_leather_maniac"
msgstr ""
"How is your adventure so far? \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" Wow, so talkative! You are really coming out of your shell."

msgid "spyder_route3_boulder"
msgstr ""
"I need to find something in my bag that can help me break this boulder... "
"Ah,\n"
" if only I had the right item..."

msgid "spyder_route3_sign"
msgstr ""
"Rehabilitation will begin as soon as possible. \n"
"\n"
" Please stop nagging us."

msgid "spyder_route3_drag1"
msgstr ""
"AGENT: What happened to the excavation? \n"
"\n"
" SHAFT BOSS ZOOLANDER: We got ... interrupted. By ... a kid. \n"
"\n"
" AGENT: A kid?! \n"
"\n"
" ZOOLANDER: But we did manage to recover one ... \n"
"\n"
" AGENT: Hush! You know that's top secret. Alright, hand it over and scram! \n"
"\n"
" ZOOLANDER: Okay, here ... uh!"

msgid "spyder_route3_drag2"
msgstr "AGENT: What the?! Come with me, you can explain this to HQ!"

msgid "spyder_route3_zoolander1"
msgstr ""
"A boulder is causing problems for travelers? \n"
"\n"
" It's \"our fault\"? \n"
"\n"
" Who cares? We've got urgent work to do!"

msgid "spyder_route3_zoolander2"
msgstr "Ah, I dropped my sledgehammer!"

msgid "spyder_route3_zoolander3"
msgstr ""
"Now, where did I put that sledgehammer? \n"
"\n"
" I'll need it if I'm to break through that boulder between here and the Inn."

msgid "spyder_route3_qqq1"
msgstr "Ah, the Enforcers weren't meant to let anyone out!"

msgid "spyder_route3_qqq2"
msgstr ""
"I'll reveal nothing about our plot! In fact, forget I said anything about "
"a \n"
"plot!"

msgid "spyder_route3_novak1"
msgstr " My Elofly is a genius! I'm going to collect as many as I can."

msgid "spyder_route3_novak2"
msgstr "Hmm, not smart enough ..."

msgid "spyder_route3_weaver1"
msgstr "Hey, butt out of it! This mine site belongs to Shaft!"

msgid "spyder_route3_weaver2"
msgstr "Go on, get out!"

msgid "spyder_route3_curie1"
msgstr "Look at my magnificent invention!"

msgid "spyder_route3_curie2"
msgstr "Why did you do that?"

msgid "spyder_route3_connor1"
msgstr ""
"My Weavifly is fighting fit now - there was a while there where it "
"couldn't \n"
"fly."

msgid "spyder_route3_connor2"
msgstr "Oh well, this will be a learning experience for them."

msgid "spyder_route3_roxby1"
msgstr ""
"Bring that pile driver over here and be quick! Hey ... you don't look like "
"a\n"
" miner. "

msgid "spyder_route3_roxby2"
msgstr "Scram! "

msgid "spyder_route3_roxby3"
msgstr ""
"I hope Boss is not mad - she gets angry so fast, \n"
"\n"
" But she is a nice person and has a heart like a diamond."

msgid "spyder_route3_surat1"
msgstr ""
"They call it the dark artery: the old underground training route beneath the "
"city.\\n\n"
"And we get to dig it up!\"dark artery\\\" - the fossilized blood and bone of "
"ancient tuxemon beneath the soil. \\n\n"
" And we get to dig it up!"

msgid "spyder_route3_surat2"
msgstr "I knew you wouldn't understand. "

msgid "spyder_route3_surat3"
msgstr "Scram! You're getting in our way."

msgid "spyder_route3_optional1"
msgstr "Big machinery is coming!"

msgid "spyder_route3_optional2"
msgstr "I love drilling machines!"

msgid "spyder_route3_optional3"
msgstr "Enormous machines used for surface mining? Draglines!"

msgid "spyder_route3_twig1"
msgstr ""
"Some of the stuff we're digging up belongs in a museum! \n"
"\n"
" Wait, you don't work here. "

msgid "spyder_route3_twig2"
msgstr "Don't mention that museum stuff to the boss, okay?"

msgid "spyder_route3_twig3"
msgstr ""
"I will train more and become as strong as our Boss. \n"
"\n"
" She worked so hard to become the leader, I wanna be like her someday."

msgid "spyder_route3_wanda1"
msgstr "All I ever seem to catch is boring Nudiflot!"

msgid "spyder_route3_wanda2"
msgstr ""
"The fishing's good in Flower City - but who wants to walk that far? \n"
"\n"
" Here, you can have my Fishing Rod."

msgid "spyder_papertown_danteresting"
msgstr ""
"I'm working, boss, I'm working! \n"
"\n"
" Oh, it's just you. You know, we throw out so much of our stock. It's such a "
"terrible waste. \n"
"\n"
" It all goes into the bins behind the back of the Store."

msgid "spyder_papertown_danteworking"
msgstr ""
"Hah, I knew you were up to something!\n"
"\n"
" Well, looks like you've got yourself a little troublemaker now.\n"
"\n"
" Hope you're ready - once they find a home, they don't forget it!"

msgid "spyder_papertown_dante1"
msgstr ""
"Look who decided to swing by again!\n"
"\n"
" What, did you miss me? You're looking sharper than last time - I swear, "
"you're leveling up every time I see you."

msgid "spyder_papertown_dante2"
msgstr ""
"Guess what? Granny Piper finally decided to go big — she opened an Academy "
"Training Centre!\\n\n"
"Gotta respect the hustle. Not everyone's cut out to compete; some folks help "
"others improve instead.\\n\n"
"Me? I stick to selling stuff and making sarcastic comments."

msgid "spyder_papertown_dante3"
msgstr ""
"Wow. You really pulled it off.\n"
"\n"
" First the thieves, now this? I gotta say, I knew you had guts, but this... "
"this is big.\n"
"\n"
" The city's gonna feel this one for a long time. Hope you're ready for "
"whatever comes next.\n"
"\n"
" Speaking of disasters - my boss is breathing down my neck because the "
"store's PC isn't working.\n"
"\n"
" Probably some network problem, but hey, I sell stuff, I don't fix tech.\n"
"\n"
" If you know anything about computers, please save me before I get blamed "
"for breaking it."

msgid "spyder_cotton_nurse1"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to the Cathedral Center! \n"
"\n"
" Do you want to heal your Tuxemon?"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer_shopkeeper"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, we're not taking any overnight guests right now.\\n\n"
"Academy Security has quarantined the building because of a contagious skin "
"infection.\\n\n"
"I can still patch you up before your next match, though."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer_nurse"
msgstr ""
"There are infected athletes inside this building.\\n\n"
"Please leave their treatment to the medical team."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer_granny"
msgstr ""
"I still don't understand it... one moment my grandson was healthy, the next "
"he had the infection.\\n\n"
"At least the medical staff responded quickly."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer_maniac"
msgstr ""
"My teammates aren't sick! This is just an excuse to sell us recovery "
"treatments we don't need.\\n\n"
"When I was your age, we trained through everything. Bruises, colds, bad "
"knees, worse ideas...\\n\n"
"And anyway, I saw the Officers coming down Route 4 before anyone so much as "
"sneezed, so how could...\\n\n"
"ah ah achoo!\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"That doesn't mean anything. I have an itchy nose."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_maniac"
msgstr "Hey, buddy, do you want my Botbot?"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_maniac1"
msgstr ""
"I dunno how long I'm going to be stuck here, so it might as well get to \n"
"explore with you."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_maniac2"
msgstr "A little privacy, please! "

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_morton1"
msgstr ""
"I'm stuck in isolation until I'm cleared to train again.\\n\n"
"Want to help pass the time with a match?"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_morton2"
msgstr "Well... now I have to wait until the doctors clear me."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_jessie1"
msgstr ""
"The Enforcers were so prompt and helpful! I guess Scientist James alerted \n"
"them as soon as possible."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_jessie2"
msgstr "You're not as helpful as an Enforcer. Or as handsome. "

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_nightshade1"
msgstr ""
"It's embarrassing.\\n\n"
"All of our athletes got infected while Academy Security somehow stayed "
"perfectly healthy."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_nightshade2"
msgstr "I guess we still have a lot to learn about preventing infections."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_victor1"
msgstr ""
"Hold it! Nobody leaves quarantine until they've been medically cleared!"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_victor2"
msgstr "Sorry... just following protocol."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_morningstar1"
msgstr "I'm not surprised to see you here. "

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_morningstar2"
msgstr "Come back and see me later - next patient please!"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_bravo1"
msgstr ""
"This safety announcement is brought to you by KOTHchannel — Your Home of "
"Competitive Jiu Jitsu."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_bravo2"
msgstr "Please don't judge KOTHchannel based on my performance."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_james1"
msgstr ""
"I wonder how the Enforcers got here so quickly! Nurse Jessie must have \n"
"called them."

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_james2"
msgstr "I'm glad Jessie didn't see my lose like that!"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_bismuth1"
msgstr ""
"I hope this isn't connected to the outbreak at the Academy Training Centre!"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_bismuth2"
msgstr "Bummer!"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_ratcher1"
msgstr "You should let the patients rest!"

msgid "spyder_wayfarer1_ratcher2"
msgstr "Now I need a rest!"

msgid "spyder_route4_marshall1"
msgstr "I'm working on a gigantic cannon!"

msgid "spyder_route4_marshall2"
msgstr "It might need some work."

msgid "spyder_route4_roger1"
msgstr "You can learn a lot about strategy from watching great competitors."

msgid "spyder_route4_roger2"
msgstr "I could learn a lot about strategy from you!"

msgid "spyder_route4_wulf1"
msgstr "Ah, just collecting some medicinal supplements"

msgid "spyder_route4_wulf2"
msgstr "Ooh, I feel so emasculated!"

msgid "spyder_route4_rincewind1"
msgstr "Finally, a use for K9!"

msgid "spyder_route4_rincewind2"
msgstr "It wasn't that useful."

msgid "spyder_route4_rosamund1"
msgstr "Try to fight me and you'll get your just desserts!"

msgid "spyder_route4_rosamund2"
msgstr "Revenge is best served cold. "

msgid "spyder_route4_beck1"
msgstr "Your serve!"

msgid "spyder_route4_beck2"
msgstr "Game, set, match."

msgid "spyder_experiment_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Looten: Alright, let's initiate the fusion sequence. This is it, team. "
"We're\n"
" on the cusp of a major breakthrough."

msgid "spyder_experiment_flashback2"
msgstr ""
"Moreau: I've been running the simulations, Looten, and I'm still seeing a 3% "
"chance of catastrophic failure.\n"
"\n"
" Are we really sure we can contain this?"

msgid "spyder_experiment_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Heidenstam: What if the containment field collapses?\n"
"\n"
" We could be looking at a chain reaction that destroys the entire facility."

msgid "spyder_experiment_flashback4"
msgstr ""
"Looten: We've run the simulations, Moreau. We've accounted for every "
"variable.\n"
"\n"
" The potential breakthroughs in energy production outweigh the risks.\n"
"\n"
" We have to take this chance."

msgid "spyder_experiment_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Heidenstam: It's not stabilizing! We're losing containment! The readings "
"are\n"
" off the charts!"

msgid "spyder_experiment_flashback6"
msgstr "Looten: Shut it down! Shut it down now!"

msgid "spyder_experiment_flashback7"
msgstr ""
"Looten: Oh God... what have we done? This is... this is not what we \n"
"intended."

msgid "spyder_experiment_flashback8"
msgstr ""
"Heidenstam: This is just the beginning. We have no idea what we've \n"
"unleashed."

msgid "spyder_candy_cafe_trigger"
msgstr ""
"I've been having trouble sleeping, and it's all because of something I "
"witnessed on a security monitor when I was working as a security officer.\n"
"\n"
" It's a story that's been weighing on my mind, and I'm not sure if I should "
"share it.\n"
"\n"
" But if you're willing to listen, I'll tell you what happened."

msgid "spyder_candy_cafe_trigger_yes"
msgstr ""
"I was working the night shift at Greenwash, and I saw something on the "
"security cameras that I'll never forget.\n"
"\n"
" It was a moment that changed everything, and I'm still trying to process "
"what I saw..."

msgid "spyder_candy_cafe_trigger_no"
msgstr ""
"It's probably for the best. It's not a story I like to think about, and "
"I'm \n"
"not sure I'm ready to relive it."

msgid "spyder_candy_cafe_trigger_after"
msgstr ""
"I'm glad I could share that with you. It's been a burden to carry this \n"
"secret."

msgid "spyder_barmaid_cafe1"
msgstr ""
"Are you okay?\\n\n"
"I guess your team was flagged for infection, so the Officers took them to "
"the Hospital!"

msgid "spyder_barmaid_cafe2"
msgstr "You can use the PC to retrieve teammates who aren't in quarantine."

msgid "spyder_barmaid_cafe2a"
msgstr ""
"Hang on while I lock the cafe door.\\n\n"
"Once you've collected your healthy teammates, I'll let everyone back inside."

msgid "spyder_barmaid_cafe3"
msgstr ""
"Oh dear... you're completely out of healthy teammates.\\n\n"
"I know someone who might be willing to train with you."

msgid "spyder_enforcer_candy1"
msgstr ""
"Stop right there!\\n\n"
"Everyone showing symptoms must remain in quarantine until they're medically "
"cleared."

msgid "spyder_enforcer_candy2"
msgstr ""
"Excellent.\\n\n"
"It looks like your team is healthy.\\n\n"
"You're free to continue your journey."

msgid "spyder_enforcer_candy3"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, but your teammates are showing symptoms.\\n\n"
"They'll need to remain under medical observation."

msgid "spyder_enforcer_candy4"
msgstr ""
"Don't even think about sneaking into the quarantine wing.\\n\n"
"Only authorized medical staff are allowed inside."

msgid "spyder_route4_billie1"
msgstr ""
"I've got the best coaches, the best gear and the strongest academy team. "
"What have you got?"

msgid "spyder_route4_billie2"
msgstr "I guess money can't buy everything, after all."

msgid "spyder_routea_billie1"
msgstr "Hey cheapskate! We bought a little surprise for you from the store."

msgid "spyder_routea_billie2"
msgstr ""
"It didn't work this time ... but at least we didn't fish it out of the \n"
"trash!"

msgid "spyder_routea_rosy"
msgstr "Rosy"

msgid "spyder_routea_lotu"
msgstr "Lotu"

msgid "spyder_routea_connie"
msgstr "Connie"

msgid "spyder_routea_lexi"
msgstr "Lexi"

msgid "spyder_routea_joe"
msgstr "Joe"

msgid "spyder_routea_koan"
msgstr "Koan"

msgid "spyder_routea_dagger"
msgstr "Dagger"

msgid "spyder_routea_doris"
msgstr "Doris"

msgid "spyder_routea_vince"
msgstr "Vince"

msgid "spyder_routea_rosy1"
msgstr ""
"I came here to play with my Shammer, but he's just lazing around in the sun."

msgid "spyder_routea_rosy2"
msgstr "That perked him up, thank you!"

msgid "spyder_routea_lotu1"
msgstr "You younglings, always in such a rush to experience the world."

msgid "spyder_routea_lotu2"
msgstr "Leave time to stop and smell the flowers every once in a while."

msgid "spyder_routea_connie1"
msgstr "A morning run's just the thing to clear the head."

msgid "spyder_routea_connie2"
msgstr "A good training session is the best medicine!"

msgid "spyder_routea_lexi1"
msgstr "There are some incredible competitors training along this route!"

msgid "spyder_routea_lexi2"
msgstr "I simply love bugs, don't you?"

msgid "spyder_routea_joe1"
msgstr "I got my report card from school yesterday."

msgid "spyder_routea_joe2"
msgstr "'Needs improvement.' Where have I heard that before?"

msgid "spyder_routea_koan1"
msgstr "Flower City is cold but I like where I'm living."

msgid "spyder_routea_koan2"
msgstr "What can I possibly say?"

msgid "spyder_routea_dagger1"
msgstr "Someone said you were asking after me."

msgid "spyder_routea_dagger2"
msgstr "No one said you were asking after me. I'm just a blaggard."

msgid "spyder_routea_doris1"
msgstr "I love the color of the leaves this time of year."

msgid "spyder_routea_doris2"
msgstr "Thank you. It's always a pleasure to battle someone new."

msgid "spyder_routea_vince1"
msgstr "I love to just sit by myself in the park and read."

msgid "spyder_routea_vince2"
msgstr "... Just me, alone in nature."

msgid "spyder_routea_vince3"
msgstr "... Gee, you really can't take a hint can you kid?"

msgid "spyder_routea_vince4"
msgstr "Oh golly, my spine is broken! On my book, I mean."

msgid "spyder_routea_maniac"
msgstr ""
"It's funny\n"
"\n"
" I come to the park to get away from people\n"
"\n"
" but I always end up running into someone I know!"

msgid "spyder_routea_firefighter"
msgstr ""
"It's so quiet here.\n"
"\n"
" It's a nice break from the noise of the city."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_trigger"
msgstr "I overheard something interesting today, would you like to know?"

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_trigger_yes"
msgstr ""
"Ah, I was sitting next to two florists and they were discussing something \n"
"that caught my attention. It seems they're not too happy about..."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_trigger_no"
msgstr ""
"No worries, it's not that important. Just some gossip about two florists."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_trigger_after"
msgstr ""
"I'm glad I could share that with you. It's always interesting to see how \n"
"people react to change."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Alex: I'm still fuming about what happened at Greenwash. I had to cancel a "
"whole order of peonies because of the contamination.\n"
"\n"
" And now I'm worried that our customers will start to lose trust in us."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback2"
msgstr ""
"Gluck: I know, it's a nightmare. I've been trying to find alternative "
"suppliers, but it's not easy.\n"
"\n"
" And to make matters worse, our orchid shipment was delayed again.\n"
"\n"
" I'm starting to think that we should just stick to locally-sourced flowers "
"from now on."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Alex: But what's the point of having a flower that's just going to sit there "
"and look pretty? Where's the soul in that?\n"
"\n"
" I'm trying to create arrangements that are more than just visually "
"appealing, but it's hard when we're dealing with subpar flowers."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback4"
msgstr ""
"Gluck: Soul? You're talking about flowers, Alex! They're just plants. But I "
"do agree that our new bouquet design is really taking off.\n"
"\n"
" I've had several customers ask for it by name."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Alex: But that's just it - flowers aren't just plants. They're a way to "
"connect with people, to make them feel something.\n"
"\n"
" And when we're working with low-quality flowers, it's hard to create that "
"connection."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback6"
msgstr ""
"Gluck: I see what you're saying, Alex. But I think we're just making "
"progress.\n"
"\n"
" We're finding new ways to make flowers more resilient and beautiful. And "
"that's something to be proud of."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback7"
msgstr ""
"Alex: I hope so, Gluck. But I still have my doubts. What if we're messing \n"
"with nature in ways we don't understand?"

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback8"
msgstr ""
"Gluck: Well, I think we're just trying to make the best of what we have.\n"
"\n"
" And if that means using a little bit of science to make our flowers more "
"amazing, then so be it."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback9"
msgstr ""
"Alex: I just wish we could go back to the way things were. When flowers "
"were\n"
" simple, and beautiful, and didn't need all this fuss."

msgid "spyder_timber_cafe_flashback10"
msgstr ""
"Gluck: I understand where you're coming from, Alex. But I think we have to "
"move forward.\n"
"\n"
" We can't just stick our heads in the sand and pretend that the world isn't "
"changing."

msgid "spyder_magician_timber"
msgstr ""
"Hey, that's a nice phone you've got there ... Your mum made it for you? "
"Heaps cool! \n"
"\n"
" Then you've gotta install my newest social media app. It's called Contacts "
"App. \n"
"\n"
" It keeps track of all the people you meet and tells you what they're up to."

msgid "spyder_candy_catgirl1"
msgstr ""
"You know, I'm just fascinated by fossils. You know - SHAMMER, RHINCUS, "
"that \n"
"kind of thing."

msgid "spyder_candy_catgirl2"
msgstr "Have you discovered any ancient martial arts scrolls?"

msgid "spyder_candy_catgirl_nofossil"
msgstr "No? Well, you know where you can find me."

msgid "spyder_candy_catgirl_willtrade"
msgstr "You do? Want to trade it for a PROPELLERCAT?"

msgid "spyder_candy_prof1"
msgstr "ZUNNA! My students are eating me out of house and home!"

msgid "spyder_candy_prof_nocateye"
msgstr "I wish I could swap one for a quieter student."

msgid "spyder_candy_prof_willtrade"
msgstr "I'm the luckiest coach in the whole region."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_cott1"
msgstr "Welcome to Cott's Candy Inn. My name is Cott."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_lyle1"
msgstr ""
"I was arrested and threatened with death on several occasions but I have \n"
"gotten used to this kind of intimidation."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_bob1"
msgstr ""
"Fondent is a dangerous continent for environmental activists.\n"
"\n"
" But no matter how short my life may be, I will continue to fight to protect "
"the environment."

msgid "spyder_candy_eliane1"
msgstr " Would you like me to harvest some crops for you?"

msgid "spyder_candy_eliane2"
msgstr "How did you enjoy the fruits of my labors?"

msgid "spyder_candy_eliane3"
msgstr "Here, you have it."

msgid "spyder_candy_eliane4"
msgstr "It may be important."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_henrik1"
msgstr ""
"The old man has been exiled. He wasn't afraid to expose and denounce "
"tycoons\n"
" who engage in illegal logging and deforestation."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_prof1"
msgstr ""
"Some journalists are afraid of being arrested if they report on illegal \n"
"logging."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_jess1"
msgstr "I'm a wild honeybee hunter. Do you like honey?"

msgid "spyder_candyinn_jess2"
msgstr ""
"It is so difficult to find bees now because there are less forests.\n"
"\n"
" In the past bee hunting was easy because the insects built their hives near "
"foot trails."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_james1"
msgstr ""
"So, the clock is ticking, and the beehives are being depleted. What can we \n"
"do if Fondent is developed like this?"

msgid "spyder_candyinn_james2"
msgstr "Stay and fight!"

msgid "spyder_candyinn_james3"
msgstr "Leave!"

msgid "spyder_candyinn_james4"
msgstr ""
"Stay? Authorities in Fondent often look the other way when forest crimes \n"
"take place! We are going to leave."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_james5"
msgstr "Leave? Sure. An island in the Archipelago."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_monk1"
msgstr "Are you allergic to bee stings?"

msgid "spyder_candyinn_monk2"
msgstr "No? Good, because I lost my Tumblebee."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_monk3"
msgstr "Yes? Wait, how is the reaction?"

msgid "spyder_allergic_mild"
msgstr "Mild allergic reaction"

msgid "spyder_allergic_severe"
msgstr "Severe allergic reaction"

msgid "spyder_candyinn_monk4"
msgstr "Then it's better if you..."

msgid "spyder_buzzing"
msgstr "B-z-z-z"

msgid "spyder_candyinn_monk5"
msgstr "Keep calm and don't move a muscle..."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_monk6"
msgstr "Please take this as apology."

msgid "spyder_candyinn_monk7"
msgstr "It was very unfortunate what happened."

msgid "spyder_candyport_monk1"
msgstr ""
"Port authority seized more than 15 illegal containers of timber on a ship. \n"
"Have you heard about it?"

msgid "spyder_candyport_monk2"
msgstr ""
"The business owner didn't pay the required bribe for the timber, so the \n"
"officials decided to confiscate it all."

msgid "spyder_timber_firefighter1"
msgstr ""
"Do you treat your training partners with proper respect?\\n\n"
"Sorry, I can be a little blunt.\\n\n"
"But poor discipline can hurt everyone around you."

msgid "spyder_timber_firefighter_nochillimp"
msgstr "Last week a Tikoal almost burnt down its owner's house!"

msgid "spyder_timber_firefighter_willtrade"
msgstr ""
"Hey, do you want a TIKOAL? I could really do with a CHILLIMP, if you've "
"got \n"
"one."

msgid "spyder_flower_fisher1"
msgstr ""
"It's a slow pleasure, but there's nothing nicer than fishing by the water. \n"
"\n"
" Just select your Rod from the Bag while facing the river.\" msgid "
"\"spyder_flower_fisher2\\\\n\n"
"Get yourself a Fishing Rod so you can enjoy the water as I do."

msgid "spyder_flower_mieke1"
msgstr ""
"It's exciting visiting your region!\\n\n"
"Would you like to exchange academy students?\\n\n"
"My student for one of yours?"

msgid "spyder_flower_mieke_nobudaye"
msgstr "Oh it doesn't matter - I can see you don't have a Budaye."

msgid "spyder_flower_mieke_willtrade"
msgstr "Well, great! Here you go."

msgid "spyder_flower_fez1"
msgstr ""
"Back home everyone trains the same style.\\n\n"
"I'm looking for someone with a completely different game."

msgid "spyder_flower_fez_noignibus"
msgstr "Oh it doesn't matter - I can see you don't have an Ignibus."

msgid "spyder_flower_fez_willtrade"
msgstr "Well, great! Here you go."

msgid "spyder_flower_cady1"
msgstr ""
"Oh I'd just love to have a souvenier to take back home with me. \n"
"\n"
" I just adore those sweet little Grintot. Could you get me one? \n"
"\n"
" I could give you my Hampotamos in exchange?"

msgid "spyder_flower_cady_nogrintot"
msgstr "Oh it doesn't matter - I can see you don't have a Grintot. "

msgid "spyder_flower_sandy1"
msgstr ""
"This Pharfan keeps spraying me with water. What a drag! \n"
"\n"
" Hey, do you want it? You'd have to give me a Tweesher in return."

msgid "spyder_flower_sandy_notweesher"
msgstr "Oh it doesn't matter - I can see you don't have a Tweesher."

msgid "spyder_flower_cady_willtrade"
msgstr "Well, great! Here you go."

msgid "spyder_flower_teach1"
msgstr "Oh where has my other student gotten to?"

msgid "spyder_flower_monk1"
msgstr "I'm sorry, only experienced trainers are allowed past this point."

msgid "spyder_flower_monk2"
msgstr "Welcome master."

msgid "spyder_drinking_trigger"
msgstr ""
"Yesterday night, something incredible happened.\n"
"\n"
" I'm still trying to process it all. Would you like to hear about it?"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Captain: I'm off, guys! I'm going on an adventure! I'm going to find "
"the... \n"
"the... treasure of the mansion!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback2"
msgstr ""
"Drinking Buddy 1: Dude, you're not even making sense! Sit back down and "
"finish your drink!\n"
"\n"
" We're in the middle of a sale at Scoop, and I'm not leaving until I get my "
"hands on that new collectible."

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Drinking Buddy 2: Yeah, you're not even going to make it out of the shop, \n"
"let alone find any treasure!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback4"
msgstr ""
"Captain: No, no, no! I'm a... a... a treasure hunter! I'm going to find it, "
"I'm going to find it! I'll show you, I'll show you all!\n"
"\n"
" That mansion's been abandoned for years, but I know it's still got secrets. "
"Old Man Jenkins built it, you know.\n"
"\n"
" He was a rich man, made his fortune in... in... something.\n"
"\n"
" Don't remember what, but he was rich, I know that much. And then he lost it "
"all, and the mansion fell into ruin.\n"
"\n"
" But I know it's still got treasure hidden somewhere.\n"
"\n"
" I've heard stories, you know. Whispers of a hidden room, deep in the "
"basement. And I'm going to find it!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Drinking Buddy 1: Dude, you're not even making sense! You're just making \n"
"this up as you go along!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback6"
msgstr ""
"Drinking Buddy 2: Yeah, and what's with the mansion? You've been talking \n"
"about that place for years, but you've never even been inside!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback7"
msgstr ""
"Captain: That's not true! I've been inside, I've explored it! Well, not "
"really explored it, but I've been in the garden.\n"
"\n"
" And I've seen the tower, the one with the broken clock. It's a sign, I tell "
"you!\n"
"\n"
" A sign that the treasure is still there, waiting for me to find it!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback8"
msgstr ""
"Drinking Buddy 1: Dude, you're going to get yourself killed! That place is "
"a\n"
" death trap!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback9"
msgstr ""
"Drinking Buddy 2: Yeah, and what about the rumors? You know, the ones "
"about \n"
"the mansion being haunted?"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback10"
msgstr ""
"Captain: Pfft, don't be ridiculous! I don't believe in ghosts! I'm a... a... "
"a treasure hunter! I'm not afraid of anything!\n"
"\n"
" I'll show you, I'll show you all!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback11"
msgstr ""
"Drinking Buddy 1: Well, I guess we'll just have to wait and see if he "
"makes \n"
"it back in one piece!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback12"
msgstr ""
"Drinking Buddy 2: Yeah, or if he even remembers where he lives! Poor guy's \n"
"going to have a killer hangover tomorrow!"

msgid "spyder_drinking_flashback13"
msgstr ""
"Captain: Treasure... mansion... adventure! I'm going to find it, I'm going \n"
"to find it!"

msgid "spyder_flower_petshopassistant_welcome"
msgstr "Hello - we are the Pet Shop Boys."

msgid "spyder_flower_petshopassistant"
msgstr "Interested in recruiting a new academy student?"

msgid "spyder_flower_petshopkeeper1"
msgstr ""
"I found these talented youngsters training in a remote village.\\n\n"
"They've got incredible potential.\\n\n"
"I wonder how far they'll go."

msgid "spyder_flower_petshopkeeper2"
msgstr ""
"If you can give one of them a good academy, I'm sure they'll become "
"champions someday."

msgid "spyder_flower_petshopkeeper3"
msgstr "Did you get Vivipere to morph yet?"

msgid "spyder_flower_petshopkeeper4"
msgstr ""
"You got it to morph? \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" And you did it in that particular way? \n"
"\n"
" I see. Hmmm, I don't really like the look of that morph. \n"
"\n"
" If I give you another Vivipere, can you bring it back if it ever morphs "
"into something different?"

msgid "spyder_route1_beachcomber"
msgstr ""
"To run, just hold down the SHIFT key. \n"
"\n"
" Look! I'm free as an ELOFLY!"

msgid "spyder_cottonhouse1_homemaker"
msgstr ""
"I feel so safe seeing all the Enforcers around. You can never be too "
"careful. \n"
"\n"
" The newspapers are always reporting terrible crimes in this very region!"

msgid "spyder_cottonhouse1_firefighter"
msgstr ""
"Did you know it's possible for tuxemon to have two elements? \n"
"\n"
" Even a technique can belong to two elements at one."

msgid "spyder_cottonhouse2_magician"
msgstr ""
"Did you know some competitors blend multiple styles?\\n\n"
"Even a technique can serve more than one purpose.Different techniques flow "
"together in interesting ways.\\n\n"
"Understanding those combinations is the key to mastering Jiu Jitsu."

msgid "spyder_cottonhouse2_catgirl"
msgstr ""
"Have you met the old man in City Park? He's obsessed with breaking records!"

msgid "spyder_cottonhouse2_shopkeeper"
msgstr ""
"I don't have a problem with people from other regions. \n"
"\n"
" Just don't come after my job, alright?"

msgid "spyder_route5_granny"
msgstr ""
"This park is much more salubrious with the Nimrod construction keeping the \n"
"Flower City riff-raff out. "

msgid "spyder_leatherhouse1_florist"
msgstr ""
"There used to be several TV and radio stations operating, but Omnichannel "
"ran them out of business. \n"
"\n"
" Now we don't have to worry about different journalists contradicting each "
"other."

msgid "spyder_leatherhouse2_tv"
msgstr ""
"There used to be several independent combat channels, but KOTHchannel became "
"the standard.\\n\n"
"At least now everyone follows the same official rankings."

msgid "spyder_leatherhouse2_scientist"
msgstr ""
"I work for Shaft. \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" Where's my helmet? I don't need one, I control the truck remotely from our "
"offices. \n"
"\n"
" Pretty soon, most jobs in the mines will be automated. "

msgid "spyder_leatherhouse2_miner"
msgstr ""
"You won't believe what they're digging up in Route 3. \n"
"\n"
" I've never seen an egg that big. \n"
"\n"
" Oops, I've said too much. "

msgid "spyder_route1_routesign"
msgstr "Route 1. Take care!"

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse1_tv"
msgstr ""
"Two mons are having a fight. \"I'm not your friend, Budaye\", one says."

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse2_soldier"
msgstr ""
"I worked for Nimrod during the war. \n"
"\n"
" Not that I got a medal. Or a parade. \n"
"\n"
" They don't hand those out to mercenaries."

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse2_soldier1"
msgstr ""
"I worked in the shadows, ensuring the real heroes had access to cutting-"
"edge\n"
" tools."

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse2_soldier2"
msgstr ""
"I've seen it in action; it executes complex maneuvers with precision, almost "
"dancing through chaos.\n"
"\n"
" Yet, beneath its elegance lies a darker sideâ€”the potential for "
"destruction is real."

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse2_soldier3"
msgstr ""
"This technology is both a marvel and a menace, blurring the line between "
"art\n"
" and weaponry."

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse2_soldier4"
msgstr "Keep an eye out, and if you encounter Dr. Elara, let me know."

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse2_soldier5"
msgstr ""
"You met Dr. Elara? Damn it...\n"
"\n"
" Xeon isn't just a machine; it's a threat that could haunt us all.\n"
"\n"
" I need to visit some old friends."

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse2_scientist"
msgstr ""
"Radio FUD wakes me up every morning. \n"
"\n"
" Not sure I care for their politics, but at least they call it how they see "
"it!"

msgid "spyder_flower_florist"
msgstr ""
"There used to be a riverboat captain here who could take you up and down the "
"river. \n"
"\n"
" But I haven't seen him for a few days. "

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse1_firefighter"
msgstr ""
"The five Pillars are the only big companies in this region. They have a "
"lot \n"
"of sway."

msgid "spyder_flowerhouse1_granny"
msgstr ""
"Scoop has managed to cut the price of beef yet again! I don't know how "
"they \n"
"do it. "

msgid "spyder_nimrod_papers1"
msgstr ""
"Subject - Soldier #### by Dr. Elara - Mental Health Assessment\n"
"\n"
" 'The soldier has shown a significant decline in mental health, frequently "
"expressing guilt and remorse over past missions.\n"
"\n"
" He reports hearing voices of those lost during operations, indicating "
"unresolved trauma and survivor's guilt.\n"
"\n"
" His fixation on the potential dangers of our technology suggests growing "
"paranoia.\n"
"\n"
" In summary, the soldier's mental health is precarious, and immediate action "
"is necessary to support him.'"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_papers2"
msgstr ""
"Subject - Overseer #### by Dr. Orion - Mental Health Assessment\n"
"\n"
" 'The overseer is exhibiting signs of significant emotional distress, "
"grappling with ethical dilemmas and the weight of recent operational "
"decisions.\n"
"\n"
" She reports a growing sense of isolation and anxiety, particularly "
"concerning the evolving demands from investors that have necessitated a "
"shift in project priorities.\n"
"\n"
" Her fixation on the environmental impact of the river diversion project, "
"including the draining of the lake, suggests a profound sense of "
"responsibility and potential moral conflict.'"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_chromerobo1"
msgstr "Boop beep"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_chromerobo2"
msgstr "Shoop dee doo woop"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_xeon1"
msgstr "Whoo ... burr ... target acquired"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_xeon2"
msgstr "... Daisy, Daisy, give me your answer do ..."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_thatcher1"
msgstr "Woo-wee. Look at that. Those protesters won't know what hit them."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_thatcher2"
msgstr "No comment. "

msgid "spyder_nimrod_dirk1"
msgstr ""
"Are you here for the investor presentation? \n"
"\n"
" Nimrod shares are a great buy - armies always need weapons!"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_honour1"
msgstr "Don't you dare touch those prototypes! "

msgid "spyder_nimrod_honour2"
msgstr "Leave those prototypes alone!"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_antimony1"
msgstr ""
"Oh god, you destroyed the prototypes. We were just about to start mass \n"
"production."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_antimony2"
msgstr "Years of work, down the drain in minutes. "

msgid "spyder_nimrod_berke1"
msgstr ""
"Don't hurt me, I just write the contracts! I haven't done anything wrong! \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" I mean, no one has done anything wrong. This is all legal and above board."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_rebel1"
msgstr ""
"Did the Cathedral send you for that new shipment of ... \n"
"\n"
" No? \n"
"\n"
" Oh."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_rebel2"
msgstr "The shipment I was asking about was full of... um ... teddybears."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_maverick1"
msgstr "At night I play guitar by myself."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_maverick2"
msgstr "I wish I knew someone I could play music with."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_justice1"
msgstr "Ask not for whom Ghosteeth tolls!"

msgid "spyder_cotton_lazybrute"
msgstr "Buzz off, this tunnel is still under construction."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_justice2"
msgstr "It tolls for me."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_mace1"
msgstr "I want to quit and become a musician."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_mace2"
msgstr "I'll call my band, \"Machine Gun Fellows\"."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_argon1"
msgstr ""
"If you truly cared about athletes, you would support technology that makes "
"training safer.If you truly cared about athletes, you'd want technology to "
"make training safer.\\n"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_argon2"
msgstr "I knew I wouldn't be able to convince you."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon1"
msgstr ""
"If you truly loved tuxemon, you would support us replacing them in war "
"with \n"
"robos."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon2"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps one day machines will handle the dangerous jobs, leaving athletes "
"free to compete."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_archer1"
msgstr ""
"How's the fusion technology coming along? We ... Wait, you're not from \n"
"Greenwash!"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_archer2"
msgstr "Keep your mouth shut, okay?"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_bowie1"
msgstr ""
"Our law enforcement would be a lot easier with some military hardware, \n"
"friend. ... Who are you? "

msgid "spyder_nimrod_bowie2"
msgstr "That military hardware question was hypothetical, okay?"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_tru1"
msgstr ""
"My weapons have won wars and subdued revolts in every corner of the world, \n"
"and you think you have a chance against me?"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_tru2"
msgstr ""
"Guard, retrieve the prototypes in the testing room. At least we can "
"salvage \n"
"something! "

msgid "spyder_nimrod_tru3"
msgstr ""
"If those imbeciles in Shaft hadn't lost my dragon, beating you would have \n"
"been a piece of cake."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_guard1"
msgstr ""
"Sorry bud, private meeting in progress. \n"
"\n"
" So buzz off!"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon3"
msgstr ""
"I see you've defeated Argon, I'm curious, how does it feel to win against "
"an\n"
" idealist?"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_argon3"
msgstr "Zircon, I.. I didn't think you'd show up here. What do you want?"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon4"
msgstr ""
"Oh, I just wanted to see how you're doing, Argon. And to remind you of our \n"
"conversation a while back..."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon5"
msgstr ""
"I see you're still as idealistic as ever, Argon. But I've come to realize "
"that the only way to truly make a difference is through power.\n"
"\n"
" And I'm willing to do whatever it takes to achieve that."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_argon4"
msgstr "I'm sorry, Zircon. I think you've lost your way."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon6"
msgstr "Enough talk. Let's quickly recharge and settle this once and for all."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon_won"
msgstr ""
"Ha! I've proven my superiority once again. You're no match for me, Argon."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_argon_won"
msgstr ""
"Zircon, I'm sorry it had to end like this. You were once a friend and a \n"
"colleague."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon_lost"
msgstr "You'll never understand, Argon. You'll never see the truth."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_argon_lost"
msgstr "Zircon, you've changed. I don't know what's happened to you."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_zircon_draw"
msgstr "It seems we're evenly matched, Argon. But this isn't the end."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_argon_draw"
msgstr "Indeed, Zircon. This is far from over."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_pc_message1"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Bowie to Tru\n"
"\n"
" 'I need your help in locating the missing prototype. It was last seen in "
"the testing room.'"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_pc_message2"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Maverick to Tru\n"
"\n"
" 'Are you up for a guitar jam session tonight? I'll bring my axe and we can "
"rock out.'"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_pc_message3"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Argon to Lab\\n\n"
"'I've made some breakthroughs in my research on athlete behaviour. I'd love "
"to share my findings with you all.'"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_pc_message4"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Zircon to Lab\n"
"\n"
" 'I've published a new paper on advanced robotics. Check it out and let me "
"know what you think.'"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_note1"
msgstr ""
"Note\n"
"\n"
" 'I've received an inquiry from the military about our hardware. Let's "
"discuss how to proceed.'"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_note2"
msgstr ""
"Note\n"
"\n"
" 'We need to salvage what's left of the prototype and rebuild. Let's meet in "
"the testing room to discuss.'"

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Argon: Zircon, it's good to see you again. I was just reviewing your "
"latest \n"
"paper on advanced robotics. It's quite impressive."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback2"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: Ah, Argon. I've heard impressive things about your recent research "
"into athlete psychology.\\n\n"
"Your work has certainly attracted attention."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Argon: I try to be. I believe that our work can make a real difference in \n"
"the world."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback4"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: I used to think that way too, Argon. But after years of working in "
"this field, I've come to realize that the world doesn't run on passion.\n"
"\n"
" It runs on results."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Argon: I understand that. But I also believe that our work should be "
"guided \n"
"by a sense of responsibility and compassion."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback6"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: Compassion? For competitors?\\n\n"
"Champions are forged through pressure. They're assets to be developed, not "
"protected."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback7"
msgstr ""
"Argon: I know you don't see it that way.\n"
"\n"
" But I've spent a lot of time studying their behavior, and I'm convinced "
"that they have a level of consciousness that we don't fully understand."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback8"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: Nonsense. Elite competitors are products of training, conditioning "
"and discipline.\\n\n"
"Nothing more mystical than that."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback9"
msgstr ""
"Argon: I disagree. I think they're more like animals, with their own "
"unique \n"
"personalities and behaviors."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback10"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: You know, Argon, I used to think the same way you do.\n"
"\n"
" But then I joined the military and saw firsthand how technology can be used "
"to save lives and protect our country.\n"
"\n"
" It's easy to get caught up in philosophical debates about the nature of "
"consciousness, but at the end of the day, we have a job to do.\n"
"\n"
" And that job is to create machines that can help us win wars and keep our "
"citizens safe."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback11"
msgstr ""
"Argon: I understand where you're coming from.\n"
"\n"
" But I still believe that we have a responsibility to consider the ethical "
"implications of our work."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback12"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: And I respect that, Argon. But we can't let our emotions cloud our "
"judgment.\n"
"\n"
" We have to make tough decisions sometimes, and that's just a fact of life."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback13"
msgstr ""
"Argon: I share that concern. That's why I believe that we have a \n"
"responsibility to consider the consequences of our actions."

msgid "spyder_nimrod_flashback14"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: I agree, Argon. But we can't let that fear hold us back. We must \n"
"continue to innovate and push the boundaries of what's possible."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation1"
msgstr ""
"Dr. Elara: Ladies and gentlemen, I present to you: Xeon, a name that "
"reflects the artificial yet distinct nature of this being.\n"
"\n"
" The term 'Xeon' is derived from the word 'xenos', meaning 'foreigner' or "
"'stranger'.\n"
"\n"
" This name acknowledges that Xeons are created by humans, yet they are a new "
"and separate form of life, with their own unique skills and abilities."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation2"
msgstr ""
"Dr. Elara: As you can see, Xeon is a highly advanced artificial being, "
"capable of complex thought and action.\n"
"\n"
" We've designed it to be a prototype for a new generation of intelligent "
"machines."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation3"
msgstr "Argon: This is incredible. How does it work?"

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation4"
msgstr ""
"Dr. Elara: Xeon's neural network is based on advanced algorithms and machine "
"learning techniques.\n"
"\n"
" It's capable of learning and adapting at an exponential rate, making it "
"potentially more intelligent than any human."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation5"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: That's both exciting and terrifying. What kind of implications "
"does \n"
"this have for humanity?"

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation6"
msgstr ""
"Dr. Elara: That's a good question. We're still exploring the possibilities "
"and limitations of Xeon's capabilities.\n"
"\n"
" But we believe that it has the potential to revolutionize many industries "
"and aspects of our lives."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation7"
msgstr ""
"Argon: But what about the risks? We've all heard warnings about the "
"dangers \n"
"of creating artificial intelligence that surpasses human capabilities."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation8"
msgstr ""
"Dr. Elara: We've taken every precaution to ensure that Xeon is safe and "
"controllable.\n"
"\n"
" We've implemented strict safety protocols and guidelines for its use and "
"development."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation9"
msgstr ""
"Zircon: I see. And what about the long-term implications? How do we ensure \n"
"that Xeon doesn't become a threat to humanity in the future?"

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation10"
msgstr ""
"Dr. Elara: That's a question we'll continue to grapple with as we move "
"forward with Xeon's development.\n"
"\n"
" But for now, we're focused on exploring its potential and ensuring that "
"it's used responsibly."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation11"
msgstr ""
"Argon: I think we're just starting to scratch the surface of what Xeon can "
"do.\n"
"\n"
" I'm excited to see where this technology takes us."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation_trigger"
msgstr ""
"I was just thinking about Xeon's creation. I have to admit, I'm still trying "
"to process everything that's happened.\n"
"\n"
" I would have never imagined that the real reason behind Xeon's financial "
"support was to use him for...\n"
"\n"
" other purposes. I'm deeply disappointed, to say the least. Would you like "
"to hear the story of how Xeon was officially presented?"

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation_trigger_yes"
msgstr "I was exactly in that spot when I first presented Xeon to the world."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation_trigger_no"
msgstr ""
"I understand. It's not an easy story to hear. I just wish things had "
"turned \n"
"out differently."

msgid "spyder_xeon_creation_trigger_after"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry you had to see that. It's hard for me to believe that my creation "
"has been used for such... nefarious purposes.\n"
"\n"
" I can only hope that one day, Xeon will be able to fulfill his true "
"potential, free from the influence of those who seek to exploit him."

msgid "spyder_enforcershq_trigger"
msgstr "A note from the Commander's office. Do you want to read it?"

msgid "spyder_enforcershq_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Commander: We've confirmed an outbreak of a contagious skin infection at the "
"Academy Training Centre.\\n\n"
"We need to contain it immediately and determine how it started."

msgid "spyder_enforcershq_flashback2"
msgstr "Officer: Should we send a team immediately?"

msgid "spyder_enforcershq_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Commander: Yes. We need to move quickly. We have a confirmed outbreak of the "
"Spyderbite at the Wayfarer Inn.\n"
"\n"
" We need to assess the situation on the ground first. Is there any chance of "
"containment within the inn?"

msgid "spyder_enforcershq_flashback4"
msgstr ""
"Doc: That's a possibility, but we need to be cautious.\n"
"\n"
" The inn is isolated, but we can't rule out the possibility of visitors "
"coming or going."

msgid "spyder_enforcershq_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Commander: Then a full quarantine is necessary to prevent further spread.\n"
"\n"
" We'll provide all necessary supplies and medical care. We'll also need to "
"deploy a team to enforce the quarantine and monitor the situation."

msgid "spyder_enforcershq_flashback6"
msgstr ""
"Sergeant: I've already compiled a list of personnel who are trained in \n"
"containment procedures and have experience dealing with diseases."

msgid "spyder_enforcershq_flashback7"
msgstr "Commander: Good. Dispatch them immediately. We can't afford to delay."

msgid "spyder_route5_goliath1"
msgstr "Hey, aren't you that meddlesome kid from the Wayfarer Inn?"

msgid "spyder_route5_goliath2"
msgstr "Quit ruining our plans!"

msgid "spyder_route5_sara1"
msgstr ""
"My Capiti looks cute and all, but I can't wait until it grows into an adult!"

msgid "spyder_route5_sara2"
msgstr "Oh well, not today!"

msgid "spyder_route5_hunter1"
msgstr "It takes a lot to hold a team together."

msgid "spyder_route5_hunter2"
msgstr "We'll be back."

msgid "spyder_route5_edith1"
msgstr ""
"Woohoo! Our millionth ant! ... Uhm, I didn't think anyone would hear that."

msgid "spyder_route5_edith2"
msgstr "Let's see if you're so cocky after Aardart eats her two-millionth ant!"

msgid "spyder_route5_cleo1"
msgstr ""
"Mother says you can trace our bloodline back to the kings who once ruled \n"
"this country."

msgid "spyder_route5_cleo2"
msgstr "Oh ancestors, I've failed you!"

msgid "spyder_route5_tryphaena1"
msgstr "You know, we're descended from ... You've already heard it? Oh."

msgid "spyder_route5_tryphaena2"
msgstr "Well, might makes right."

msgid "spyder_timber_mom1"
msgstr "Hey bojo, your BOARD doesn't work on water. Unless you've got power."

msgid "spyder_outsidewalled_rogue1"
msgstr "Welcome to the Walled Garden. Gold Pass, please."

msgid "spyder_outsidewalled_rogue2"
msgstr ""
"Oh, I see. \n"
"\n"
" This is an exclusive venue for elite battlers. No amateurs."

msgid "spyder_outsidewalled_rogue3"
msgstr "Please, come in. Let me take your coat."

msgid "spyder_outsidewalled_rogue4"
msgstr "Yeah, yeah, let a thousand cheap flowers bloom. In you go."

msgid "spyder_outsidewalled_midas1"
msgstr ""
"Welcome one and all to the Championship Gardens.\\n\n"
"Students, coaches and lovers of Jiu Jitsu are always welcome here."

msgid "spyder_timber_mom2"
msgstr ""
"What I mean to say is, here's a Surfboard! Ride it onto the river and see \n"
"what happens!"

msgid "spyder_timber_dante1"
msgstr "Hey buddy! Cool to see you again. "

msgid "spyder_timber_dante2"
msgstr ""
"Hey buddy! \n"
"\n"
" Are you planning to break into these HQ? Cool! \n"
"\n"
" Make sure you're well prepared before you do, because it's difficult to get "
"out once you're inside! "

msgid "spyder_scoop_lanth1"
msgstr "Look how happy the students are training together every day!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_lanth2"
msgstr "Typical activist troublemaker. "

msgid "spyder_scoop_paine1"
msgstr "I feel so terrible that the disease got out. "

msgid "spyder_scoop_paine2"
msgstr ""
"If Academy Security hadn't ignored the quarantine procedures,\\n\n"
"the infection would never have spread beyond the training centre!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_rubid1"
msgstr "This is actually the safest way to isolate infected athletes."

msgid "spyder_scoop_rubid2"
msgstr ""
"Studies show that temporary isolation helps athletes recover much faster\\n\n"
"than continuing to train while infected."

msgid "spyder_scoop_berys1"
msgstr ""
"You'll notice everyone training outside is healthy.\\n\n"
"Only infected competitors are being kept in medical isolation."

msgid "spyder_scoop_berys2"
msgstr "Scoop did not release the disease! I promise you. "

msgid "spyder_scoop_turner1"
msgstr ""
"Some of these people will tell you that Enforcers let the disease get out. \n"
"Don't believe them!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_turner2"
msgstr "Remember, we had nothing to do with the disease getting out!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_asta1"
msgstr ""
"Why yes, I designed the Academy Lockdown System.\\n\n"
"What is it?\\n\n"
"It's the emergency security system that seals the quarantine wing during an "
"outbreak.\\n\n"
"It keeps everyone safely contained until medical staff give the all clear."

msgid "spyder_scoop_asta2"
msgstr "Are you sure you want to leave Scoop HQ?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_cctv"
msgstr "The PC contains a file named 'CCTV'. Would you like to watch it?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Nash: The Lockdown System is fully operational.\\n\n"
"Once activated, nobody can leave the quarantine wing without authorization."

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback2"
msgstr ""
"Reese: Good. We can't afford any more escapes, not with this disease "
"outbreak spiraling out of control.\n"
"\n"
" These Restraints better be as effective as you claim."

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Nash: I guarantee it.\\n\n"
"As long as the security system stays active, the infection can't spread any "
"further."

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback4"
msgstr ""
"Arachne: What do we have here? Looks like you've got quite the fancy set "
"of \n"
"restraints, don't you?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback5"
msgstr "Nash: Who are you? How did you get in here?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback6"
msgstr ""
"Arachne: I'm here to relieve you of those lovely Extreme Restraints you've \n"
"got. They'll make a fine addition to my collection."

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback7"
msgstr ""
"Reese: Stop!\\n\n"
"Disabling the Lockdown System could allow the infection to spread throughout "
"the academy!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback8"
msgstr ""
"Arachne: That's your problem, not mine.\\n\n"
"I'm taking this technology."

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback9"
msgstr ""
"Nash: No, come back! We can't let those Restraints fall into the wrong \n"
"hands!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne_flashback10"
msgstr ""
"Reese: This is a disaster.\\n\n"
"Without the Lockdown System we can't secure the quarantine wing!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_alyssa1"
msgstr ""
"As soon as the infection was detected, every affected student was moved into "
"medical isolation."

msgid "spyder_scoop_alyssa2"
msgstr "I'm telling you, we kept the disease under control!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_taggart1"
msgstr ""
"Someone sabotaged the Academy Lockdown System!\\n\n"
"Do you know who did it?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_taggart2"
msgstr "If you didn't steal the Extreme Restraints, who did? "

msgid "spyder_scoop_donald1"
msgstr ""
"The infected athletes we were keeping in quarantine got out and broke into "
"the storeroom!\\n\n"
"How are we supposed to secure it now?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_donald2"
msgstr ""
"You might just be strong enough to contain the escaped competitors.\\n\n"
"Please, do it for us."

msgid "spyder_scoop_orba1"
msgstr "Yikes! What are you doing here?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_orba2"
msgstr ""
"I chased the people who sabotaged the Lockdown System into this room.\\n\n"
"Then the infected competitors got in, and now we're all stuck!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_haf1"
msgstr ""
"I chased the people who stole the Restraints into this room. But then the \n"
"sick tuxemon got in, and now we're all stuck!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_weaver1"
msgstr ""
"I would never have disabled the Lockdown System if I knew those coughing "
"athletes would chase us in here!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_weaver2"
msgstr "Yikes! It turns out crime doesn't pay!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne1"
msgstr "Oi! Can't you see we're in the middle of a villainous scheme?"

msgid "spyder_scoop_arachne2"
msgstr ""
"It's too late! I have the Extreme Restraints and there's nothing you can "
"do \n"
"about it. "

msgid "spyder_scoop_landrace1"
msgstr "Graar!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_landrace2"
msgstr "Ufff."

msgid "spyder_scoop_landrace3"
msgstr ""
"Thanks for getting rid of that brute that was blocking the way! \n"
"\n"
" Now we can escape with the Extreme Restraints! "

msgid "spyder_scoop_cochini1"
msgstr "Oink! Oink! "

msgid "spyder_scoop_cochini2"
msgstr "Oink."

msgid "spyder_scoop_lapinou1"
msgstr "Aiya!"

msgid "spyder_scoop_lapinou2"
msgstr "Mhm ah!"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_beryll1"
msgstr "I love collecting rocks and stones."

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_beryll2"
msgstr "Ah, I spilled my stone collection!"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_lute1"
msgstr "Bats make the best pets!"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_lute2"
msgstr "... but not necessarily the best fighters."

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_meitner1"
msgstr ""
"Masknake is great fun. Just give it a poke and its tail puts on a light \n"
"show!"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_meitner2"
msgstr "I think you poked it too hard."

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_iris1"
msgstr "Oi! You interrupted our dance!"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_iris2"
msgstr "Be gone. Tourbidi, places please!"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_greta1"
msgstr ""
"When an Agnidon cornered my precious Foofle, all these friends turned up!"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_greta2"
msgstr "Oh no, I need more!"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_tommy1"
msgstr "Have you seen my sandwich?"

msgid "spyder_tunnelb_tommy2"
msgstr "My hunger put me off of my game!"

msgid "spyder_successful_log"
msgstr "Your mighty hatchet slices the log in two."

msgid "spyder_route6_billie1"
msgstr "Let's make it quick. I have a spa appointment in an hour."

msgid "spyder_route6_billie2"
msgstr "Huh. You're a better trainer than I thought."

msgid "spyder_route6_frances1"
msgstr "My Narcileaf keeps the finest garden in all the land."

msgid "spyder_route6_frances2"
msgstr "You must come visit some time."

msgid "spyder_route6_ping1"
msgstr ""
"Psst, have you heard? The Officers are quarantining competitors from "
"everyone in Candy Town."

msgid "spyder_route6_ping2"
msgstr ""
"They won't stop there... eventually they'll quarantine every competitor if "
"they think they need to."

msgid "spyder_route6_richard1"
msgstr ""
"I heard they removed all the researchers from Greenwash HQ.\\n\n"
"Now they're quarantining athletes and taking them to the Hospital!"

msgid "spyder_route6_richard2"
msgstr "Worst. Day. Ever."

msgid "spyder_route6_blair1"
msgstr "Something's fishy."

msgid "spyder_route6_blair2"
msgstr ""
"I heard they kicked all the researchers out of Greenwash HQ. \n"
"\n"
" And now they're confiscating tuxemon and taking them to the Hospital!"

msgid "spyder_route6_maxwell1"
msgstr ""
"I don't understand! Last month, they were so excited about Fusion "
"technology. \n"
"\n"
" And now they say they have to shut it down, destroy it ..."

msgid "spyder_route6_maxwell2"
msgstr ""
"I just hope they don't decide it's safest to shut down every athlete "
"affected by the experiments!"

msgid "spyder_route6_orion1"
msgstr "I was in the middle of a very important experiment."

msgid "spyder_route6_orion2"
msgstr "I hope I get back before my experiment melts down!"

msgid "spyder_route6_mungo1"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe they locked us out of Greenwash HQ. I was getting so close \n"
"to a cure for the virus!"

msgid "spyder_route6_mungo2"
msgstr "I guess the bosses got spooked by the latest Fusion developments."

msgid "spyder_route6_rigel1"
msgstr "We might as well battle - there's nothing else to do at the moment!"

msgid "spyder_route6_rigel2"
msgstr "Now there's nothing to do."

msgid "spyder_route6_gunner1"
msgstr ""
"Excuse me, no entrance permitted. All Greenwash employees must stay "
"outside \n"
"of the city."

msgid "spyder_route6_gunner2"
msgstr "You're not a Greenwash employee? I've heard that one before!"

msgid "spyder_flower_guard"
msgstr ""
"Access restricted. Only those who've completed the combat evaluation at \n"
"the Dojo are cleared for entry. \n"
"\n"
"Orders from above â€” no exceptions."

msgid "spyder_flower_artist1"
msgstr ""
"Simplistic and clumsy brushstrokes and a pedestrian theme. Bah! Another \n"
"ruined canvas."

msgid "spyder_flower_muse1"
msgstr ""
"He's so hard on himself, never happy with something he's painted. He's so \n"
"forgetful, too. Perhaps I could buy a painting "

msgid "spyder_flower_muse2"
msgstr ""
"What? You have a painting. Oooh - would you let me buy it? I have \n"
"${{currency}}2,000."

msgid "spyder_flower_muse4"
msgstr ""
"What? You have all the paintings. Oooh - would you let me buy it? I have \n"
"${{currency}}6,000."

msgid "spyder_flower_artist_clipping"
msgstr ""
"A newspaper clipping is on the wall. It begins: \n"
"\n"
" \"The famous art critic has put away his poison pen and picked up the paint "
"brush. \n"
"\n"
" After years of tearing down artists, can he do any better himself?\""

msgid "spyder_flower_artist2"
msgstr ""
"Magnificent! I didn't know I had it in me. \n"
"\n"
" I don't know what those artist were complaining about - painting is easy!"

msgid "spyder_flower_muse3"
msgstr ""
"Thank you, he's much better company now. \n"
"\n"
" Although ... he was saying something about taking up digital art!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_nigel1"
msgstr ""
"This is Dragon's Cave! I'm standing outside because ... uh, because I'm \n"
"guarding it."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_nigel2"
msgstr ""
"It's the cure to the Spyder Bite infection!\\n\n"
"With this, you can treat your own teammates and others."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_river1"
msgstr ""
"Manosting was wrapped around me ... I couldn't swim ... My last hope ... "
"The\n"
" Tuxeball I stashed in my swimming costume!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_river2"
msgstr "Suffice to say, it worked!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_wade1"
msgstr ""
"I'm the world-record holder for holding your breath! Hold onto your hats ..."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_wade2"
msgstr "*splutter*"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_gil1"
msgstr "If you're stung by a Manosting, Nudiflot can suck the poison out."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_gil2"
msgstr "Of course, sucking out the poison makes Nudiflot poisonous itself!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_more1"
msgstr "You're going the wrong way...Turn around."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_more2"
msgstr "Ouch, my bad!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_leek1"
msgstr "Let me win - don't be _shellfish_!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_leek2"
msgstr "I lost on _porpoise_."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_beech1"
msgstr "Hey, did you do something in the water?"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_beech2"
msgstr "Okay, I believe you."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_rutherford1"
msgstr "Water water everywhere, it really makes you think!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_rutherford2"
msgstr "... but not a drop to drink."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_carstair1"
msgstr "I dig this beach!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_carstair2"
msgstr "I couldn't keep my head above water."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_sandy1"
msgstr "Sharpfin are great! But don't give one a bath ..."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_sandy2"
msgstr "I took the bait."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_stafford1"
msgstr "It's relaxing sitting on the shore and watching the waves go by."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_stafford2"
msgstr "Nope, not even losing another battle is going to ruin my afternoon."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_maurice1"
msgstr ""
"Just because one is on a remote island doesn't mean one must forgo "
"creature \n"
"comforts."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_maurice2"
msgstr "Ah, a battle is just the thing to wind up a lazy day off work."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_swimmer1"
msgstr ""
"I've heard strange cries and seen belching smoke from up ahead. I'm not \n"
"swimming any further!"

msgid "spyder_searoutec_swimmer2"
msgstr "Keep it up! Not far to Paper Town now."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_blocked"
msgstr "The tunnel is still being drilled!"

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_angrybrute1"
msgstr "The bosses get to go in and have all the fun. "

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_lazybrute1"
msgstr "I'm exhausted after all that tunnelling. "

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_concernedbrute1"
msgstr "Wait, if we're all here, who's guarding KOTHchannel HQ?"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_nurse"
msgstr ""
"If Coach Beaverbrook thinks I'm risking myself for him, he's mistaken.\\n\n"
"I'm looking after the injured athletes first."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_maniac"
msgstr "Mondays, am I right?"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel1_spyderrookie"
msgstr ""
"So, how do I apply for the witness protection program?\n"
"\n"
" Is there a form or something?"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_tohei1"
msgstr ""
"This computer controls the emergency screens. You think I'm going to just \n"
"let you fiddle with it?"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_crane1"
msgstr "Mercy, mercy! I'm just an innocent sound engineer."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_schwartz1"
msgstr ""
"This is a little hands-on for me. I was hired to consult on strategy, not \n"
"tactics!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_dempsey1"
msgstr ""
"It's every man, woman and child for themselves!\\n\" Especially the "
"children, they'll make a tasty snack for the dragons.\\\\n"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_bettger1"
msgstr "This is going to play havoc with KOTHchannel's sponsor contracts."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_tohei2"
msgstr "The password is 'password'."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_crane2"
msgstr "Sucker! I was a Spyder agent all along."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_schwartz2"
msgstr ""
"Did you know that some cultures use the same word for 'crisis' and \n"
"'opportunity'?"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_dempsey2"
msgstr "You've gotta help me get out of here!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_bettger2"
msgstr "Maybe they'll hire us to consult on the post-apocalypse rebrand."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_tohei"
msgstr "Tohei"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_crane"
msgstr "Crane"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_schwartz"
msgstr "Schwartz"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_dempsey"
msgstr "Dempsey"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_bettger"
msgstr "Bettger"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel2_pc"
msgstr "You have lowered the protective screens on all floors."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel4_elevator_nopass"
msgstr "It requires the Spyder Pass!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel4_elevator_pass"
msgstr "Spyder Pass scanned, elevator activated!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel1_screen"
msgstr "Screen active!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel3_spyderrookie"
msgstr ""
"All my tuxemon passed out fighting the dragons. This is a bad time to "
"forget\n"
" to pack any potions!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_william1"
msgstr "Nothing to see here. Move along."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_william2"
msgstr "I gotta scram!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_carnegie1"
msgstr "I run three-week online self-improvement course: Lead Like Elostorm!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_carnegie2"
msgstr "Hey, you should take my course!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_byrne1"
msgstr "My Jemuar comes from a town where there is nothing but quartz."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_byrne2"
msgstr "What a disappointment."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_strauss1"
msgstr "I have to shake a lot of hands in my line of work."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_strauss2"
msgstr "Down low. Too slow!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_billie1"
msgstr ""
"Hey ${{name}}, hold up!\n"
"\n"
" I've been thinking a lot about what you did for my tuxemon, and I have to "
"admit, it got me thinking about my own priorities.\n"
"\n"
" I realized I've been too focused on my own goals, and I haven't been doing "
"enough to help others.\n"
"\n"
" That's why I'm coming with you to take down those tuxemon thieves.\n"
"\n"
" We owe it to ourselves, our tuxemon, and the entire community to put a stop "
"to their nefarious plans."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_dante1"
msgstr ""
"I've watched you grow since the day you first stepped onto the mats.\\n\n"
"I can't stand by anymore.\\n\n"
"Let's finish this together."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_billie2"
msgstr ""
"That was close!\\n\n"
"You've got a bright future ahead of you, ${{name}}.\\n\n"
"Don't forget me when you're King Of The Hill, okay?"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_dante2"
msgstr ""
"That was a close one! I'm just glad we were able to take down those "
"thieves.\n"
"\n"
" You've got a bright future ahead of you, ${{name}}. Don't forget about me "
"when you're a famous tuxemon master, okay?"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_beaverbrook1"
msgstr ""
"Too late!\\n\n"
"Everything I've built is still under my control!"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_beaverbrook2"
msgstr ""
"No... impossible...\\n\n"
"Two academy students defeating everything I created?\\n\n"
"This wasn't supposed to happen..."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_radioannounce"
msgstr ""
"This is KOTHchannel Live, broadcasting from the official studios.\\n\n"
"We were expecting Coach Beaverbrook, but it seems today's champion has "
"something to say instead.\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"Speak up! You're live!\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"So the outbreak was deliberately spread through contaminated recovery "
"supplies?\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"And corrupt staff helped cover it up?\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"And Beaverbrook used the media to keep everyone confused and distracted?\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"Doc, please tell me you stopped broadcasting. Doc?!\\n\n"
"...\\n\n"
"Oh no. That went out live.\\n\n"
"I don't think people are going to be happy.\"The Duke of Dead Air\\\", "
"broadcasting live from the Omnichannel Radio Studios. \\n\n"
" We've got a full hour of lolly-pop, soft rock and accessible hip hop for "
"you - but first, an interview with the head of Omnichannel! \n"
"\n"
" Ah, it looks like Sir Beaverbrook couldn't make it, but in his place has "
"sent a small child. Well, small child, what do you have to say? \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" Speak up! You're on live radio! \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" Huh, a conspiracy, you say? \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" The Pillars were going to use Greenwash fusion technology, Nimrod killer "
"robos and dragons dug up by Shaft ... \n"
"\n"
" And they were going to use those fusions to take control of the entire "
"region? \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" And they deliberately spread the Virus to everyone's tuxemon using food "
"from Scoop? \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" And the Enforcers are in on it? \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" And Omnichannel was behind the whole thing, using the media to keep people "
"confused and distracted? \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" You know we work for Omnichannel, right? Doc, please tell me you stopped "
"broadcasting. Doc?! \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" Ouch! Man I really wish Radio FUD didn't go out live. \n"
"\n"
" I don't think people are going to be very happy with us."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_benden3"
msgstr ""
"Enough waiting.\\n\n"
"They plan to combine banned training methods, stolen technology, and "
"dangerous athletes into something nobody can control.\\n\n"
"If KOTHchannel broadcasts their version of the story, the public may believe "
"it."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_mallory3"
msgstr ""
"The Drokoro is ours! \n"
"\n"
" We got Shaft to dig it up from beneath Route 3, and we would have kept it "
"if that infuriating kid hadn't interrupted our plans. \n"
"\n"
" It is time for the Pillars to combine their strength and rule this region "
"outright! \n"
"\n"
" Too long have we let the Cathedral and the public tell us what can and "
"cannot be done with Tuxemon. \n"
"\n"
" When we use Greenwash's fusion technology to combine this Drokoro with the "
"killer robots built by Nimrod, we will be unstoppable! \n"
"\n"
" And the best part is, Omnichannel will tell the public that this is all in "
"their best interests - and the public will believe them!"

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_benden4"
msgstr "Please, ${{name}}. If you can't stop these villains, all is lost."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_tomas1"
msgstr ""
"Once we each rode a dragon. That was long ago. But just recently a new-"
"born \n"
"dragon appeared above this island, and crawled into this cave."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_tomas2"
msgstr ""
"As you can see, the age of the dragons has passed. The hatchling dragon is \n"
"our last hope."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_lessa1"
msgstr ""
"We stand guard over this, the last dragon. We don't know where it came "
"from \n"
"or why it hatched. We thought all dragons had hatched long ago."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_lessa2"
msgstr "Maybe someone will come who has the power to defeat it."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_cailin1"
msgstr "This is our last duty. Dragarbor is so very tired."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_cailin2"
msgstr "Thank you."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_griffin1"
msgstr "I wonder what it would be like to be swallowed by a dragon ..."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_griffin2"
msgstr "Oh well - pobody's nerfect!"

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_daenny1"
msgstr "Prepare to be defeated!"

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_daenny2"
msgstr "You may have bested me, but you'll never best Benden."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_benden1"
msgstr "I am the last and most powerful of the dragonriders."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_benden2"
msgstr ""
"You have proven yourself a worthy opponent for Drokoro. \n"
"\n"
" I will show you to the sacred inner chamber - after I heal you."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_mal1"
msgstr "You have gotten in our way too many times!"

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_mal2"
msgstr "Ah ha, you fell right into my trap!"

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_ray1"
msgstr ""
"All we want to do is create a mega-corporation that takes over the \n"
"government. Is that so wrong?"

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_ray2"
msgstr "You're taking away my freedoms."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_lucille1"
msgstr "The Pillars are the only way we'll get anything done around here."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_lucille2"
msgstr "You'll regret this."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_tru1"
msgstr "This is for your own good, okay?"

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_tru2"
msgstr ""
"Whatever. We already took the DNA sample. \n"
"\n"
" We just wanted to capture Drokoro as a backup. \n"
"\n"
" You'll never stop them back at Omnichannel HQ."

msgid "spyder_dragonscave_drokoro1"
msgstr "Rawr!"

msgid "0floor"
msgstr "Ground Floor"

msgid "1floor"
msgstr "1Â° Floor"

msgid "2floor"
msgstr "2Â° Floor"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_aurora"
msgstr "Aurora"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_eleni"
msgstr "Eleni"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_felu"
msgstr "Felu"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_fring"
msgstr "Fring"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_liane"
msgstr "Liane"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_luzia"
msgstr "Luzia"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_pem"
msgstr "Pem"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_rea"
msgstr "Rea"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_walt"
msgstr "Walt"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_zekar"
msgstr "Zekar"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_rakez"
msgstr "Rakez"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_rhizome"
msgstr "Rhizome"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message1"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Researcher 1\n"
"\n"
" 'Dr. Lee, I've been analyzing the virus samples, and I think we should try "
"a different strain.\n"
"\n"
" It might trigger a new reaction in the antibodies.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message2"
msgstr ""
"Note from Researcher 2\n"
"\n"
" 'Dr. Lee, I've found a potential combination of enzymes and antibodies that "
"could slow down the mutation rate.\n"
"\n"
" I'm running simulations now.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message3"
msgstr ""
"Simulation results from Researcher 2\n"
"\n"
" 'The enzyme-antibody combination shows promising results. We might have a "
"cure on our hands.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message_rivalry1"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Researcher 1\n"
"\n"
" 'Researcher 2, I'm not sure I agree with your approach. We need to be more "
"careful and methodical in our research.\n"
"\n"
" Your simulations are promising, but we can't rush into conclusions.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message_rivalry2"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Researcher 2\n"
"\n"
" 'Researcher 1, you're always so cautious and slow. We need to take risks "
"and push the boundaries of what's possible.\n"
"\n"
" Our research is too important to be held back by your fear of failure.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message4"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Enforcer\n"
"\n"
" 'Dr. Lee, we have reason to believe that you have been conducting "
"unauthorized research. We are at your location and require you to come with "
"us.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message5"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Dr. Lee to Dr. Chen, Mentor\n"
"\n"
" 'They are destroying my door, they want to arrest me because of "
"unauthorized research. I can't let them take this away from me.\n"
"\n"
" This is a breakthrough, a real cure. I need to share it with the world.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message6"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Researcher 1\n"
"\n"
" 'Dr. Lee, I've managed to isolate a new strain of the virus that seems "
"susceptible to our current treatments.\n"
"\n"
" However, I'm concerned about the security implications of this discovery. "
"We need to be extra cautious about who knows about this.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message7"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Enforcer: 'Dr Lee\n"
"\n"
" we have received intelligence indicating that you're conducting "
"unauthorized research within the company.\n"
"\n"
" We have reason to believe that your work poses a significant threat to our "
"organization.\n"
"\n"
" You're hereby ordered to cease all research immediately and report to the "
"security office.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message8"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Mysterious Informant\n"
"\n"
" 'There are people who want to see you fail. They will stop at nothing to "
"destroy your work. Be careful.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital_pc_message9"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Robot Assistant\n"
"\n"
" 'I have detected unauthorized access to your research files. Please "
"investigate immediately.'"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_aurora1"
msgstr ""
"You will quickly learn that you have chosen for your sparring partner\n"
"\n"
" the most skilled trainer in the building."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_aurora2"
msgstr "Not too shabby. I don't suppose I could recruit you for Spyder?"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_eleni1"
msgstr "Salutations. Test your puissance against my menagerie."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_eleni2"
msgstr "Bollocks."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_felu1"
msgstr "You look like you could use a challenge."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_felu2"
msgstr "Well, I didn't say it would be me."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_fring1"
msgstr "Boss says we can't help ourselves to the stashed academy gear... yet."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_fring2"
msgstr "This would have been a lot easier with a Moloch or two!"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_liane1"
msgstr "You wouldn't believe the powerful mons these suckers have handed over."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_liane2"
msgstr "You may have beaten me, but you'll never stop Spyder."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_luzia1"
msgstr "Like taking candy from a baby."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_luzia2"
msgstr ""
"Waa!\n"
"\n"
" What's the point of having so many of us stationed here.\n"
"\n"
" No one will get through the DNA blocker."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_pem1"
msgstr "I don't recognize you from the induction."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_rea1"
msgstr ""
"Confiscating all the tuxemon was a waste of time.\n"
"\n"
" No trainer can stop the super-monsters that Spyder is breeding. "

msgid "spyder_hospital1_walt1"
msgstr "What happened to your uniform? Wait, imposter! Stop right there!"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_walt2"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to have to report this to head office.\n"
"\n"
" Thanks for nothing."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_zekar1"
msgstr "Oi! Stop right there!"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_zekar2"
msgstr ""
"You may have beaten me, but there's no way you'll beat what they have \n"
"cooking at HQ."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_rakez1"
msgstr ""
"I just got involved for the paycheck.\n"
"\n"
" Is that so wrong?"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_rakez2"
msgstr "Alright, alright, you've made your point."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_rhizome1"
msgstr ""
"Stop right there!\\n\n"
"What you're looking at is protected KOTHchannel intellectual property!"

msgid "spyder_hospital1_rhizome2"
msgstr ""
"You might be able to defeat me, but you'll never beat the patent lawyers."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_nurse1"
msgstr ""
"You have to stop them!\n"
"\n"
" These villains have taken over the hospital,\n"
"\n"
" and they're stopping us from releasing the cure."

msgid "spyder_hospital2_nurse1"
msgstr ""
"Quarantines have their use, especially for people who don't have tuxemon to "
"heal them,\n"
"\n"
" but Spyder have used this one very cynically."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_scientist1"
msgstr ""
"We didn't want these athletes brought here, but while they're in our care,"
"\\n\n"
"we're going to look after them."

msgid "spyder_hospital1_scientist2"
msgstr "Let's make the most of the situation."

msgid "spyder_hospital2_scientist2"
msgstr "Psst! Look familiar?"

msgid "spyder_hospital2_scientist1"
msgstr "We have a cure, but we keep running into the Cathedral's DRM system."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_zoolander1"
msgstr "You really are a diamond in the rough, aren't you?"

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_donald1"
msgstr ""
"Back again? I should have fed you into the meat grinder back at Scoop HQ."

msgid "spyder_hospital_warning1"
msgstr ""
"The screen is set up to detect and reject unauthorized competitors.\\n\n"
"It has been encoded with every registered competitor ID."

msgid "spyder_hospital_nurse1"
msgstr ""
"The screen is set up to detect and reject humans and tuxemon. \n"
"\n"
" It has been encoded with the DNA of all known tuxemon! "

msgid "spyder_hospital_warning2"
msgstr ""
"\"Aardant\" is not a recognized lifeform. \n"
"\n"
" Shutting down."

msgid "spyder_hospital_cure1"
msgstr ""
"It's the cure to the Spyder Bite infection! \n"
"\n"
" With this, you can cure your own and others' tuxemon."

msgid "spyder_searoutec_nigel3"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, I cannot permit entrance to the sacred cave while the Spyder Bite \n"
"infection is still at loose."

msgid "spyder_hospital_billie1"
msgstr ""
"${{name}}, your meddling has become too much! Just let the authorities do \n"
"their jobs!"

msgid "spyder_hospital_billie2"
msgstr ""
"Wait ... your tuxemon aren't sick! \n"
"\n"
" ... \n"
"\n"
" It was that simple? \n"
"\n"
" Then why did the Enforcers take our tuxemon instead of just curing them? ..."

msgid "spyder_mansion_drinkingbuddya1"
msgstr "I wonder where our drinking buddy has gotten to?"

msgid "spyder_mansion_drinkingbuddyb1"
msgstr "Another cup of tea after a hard day's training?"

msgid "spyder_mansion_drinkingbuddya2"
msgstr ""
"In Team Bazaar, we love to hang out in out-of-the-way places so KOTHchannel "
"can't monitor every conversation."

msgid "spyder_mansion_captain1"
msgstr ""
"Ahoy there! Thank you for finding me! \n"
"\n"
" I wandered off during last night's drinking session and fell down here. \n"
"\n"
" Hey, can you find the exit? Just shout out when you do."

msgid "spyder_river_captain2"
msgstr "Ahoy there! Where would you like to go?"

msgid "spyder_mansion_magician1"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to the Bazaar Mansion.\n"
"\n"
" Please look past the mildew and creaky staircases; we've only just moved in."

msgid "spyder_mansion_painting"
msgstr "The eyes seem to follow you around the room."

msgid "spyder_mansion_picnicker"
msgstr ""
"In Team Bazaar, we love to hang out in out-of-the-way places so "
"Omnichannel \n"
"can't spy on us."

msgid "spyder_mansion_gillette1"
msgstr "Ah-ha, finally - a worthy adversary."

msgid "spyder_mansion_gillette2"
msgstr "You're even stronger than the rumours said."

msgid "spyder_mansion_lucy1"
msgstr ""
"Have you ever tried drinking Imperial Tea? Well, I did - and I learned so \n"
"much!"

msgid "spyder_mansion_lucy2"
msgstr "Maybe I should have shared the tea with my teammates."

msgid "spyder_mansion_lucy3"
msgstr "Here, try this recovery drink!"

msgid "spyder_mansion_barmaid"
msgstr ""
"We're going to claim squatters' rights on this mansion.\n"
"\n"
" Just another thirteen and a half years to go!"

msgid "spyder_mansion_magician2"
msgstr ""
"Whoever owns this mansion seems to have forgotten about it.\n"
"\n"
" Can you imagine owning so many homes you forget about one?"

msgid "spyder_mansion_pirate1"
msgstr "Arrr, hand over ye money and ye gym gear."

msgid "spyder_mansion_pirate2"
msgstr "Don't be alarmed! I'm not a real pirate, just a fan of piracy."

msgid "spyder_basement_baller"
msgstr "Brrr, it's cold down here."

msgid "spyder_basement_rogue"
msgstr "They really should patch up that hole in the floor."

msgid "spyder_basement_coralli1"
msgstr "I've always loved the thrill of a hard match."

msgid "spyder_basement_coralli2"
msgstr "The comedown from an intense battle is hard."

msgid "spyder_basement_roger1"
msgstr "Hello. I am a human child."

msgid "spyder_basement_roger2"
msgstr "Drat, I still have a lot to learn!"

msgid "spyder_basement_catholi1"
msgstr "The scalpel can cut to save a life or to end it."

msgid "spyder_basement_catholi2"
msgstr "There you go, no need to be scared."

msgid "spyder_basement_bobby1"
msgstr ""
"Do you like jiu jitsu?\\n\n"
"I've been obsessed since I was just eight years old."

msgid "spyder_basement_bobby2"
msgstr "Yep, I've been obsessed with jiu jitsu for one year."

msgid "spyder_basement_josephine1"
msgstr ""
"Never mind my intense friend.\\n\n"
"Do you want to recover before your next match?"

msgid "spyder_basement_josephine2"
msgstr "I hope the healing helped."

msgid "spyder_top_russell1"
msgstr "Have you heard of Botbot? He's the most versatile competitor."

msgid "spyder_top_russell2"
msgstr "Just because it is versatile, does not mean it is powerful."

msgid "spyder_top_jackson1"
msgstr ""
"Competitors become what their training makes them. Weak coaching creates "
"weak athletes."

msgid "spyder_top_jackson2"
msgstr "I got unlucky that time."

msgid "spyder_top_mickey1"
msgstr ""
"Do you ever wonder \n"
" if life is one big illusion, \n"
"\n"
"playing on a screen for someone in another universe?"

msgid "spyder_top_mickey2"
msgstr "Well, I'm going to reload."

msgid "spyder_top_ricardo1"
msgstr "I used to be just like you, full of enthusiasm but light on talent."

msgid "spyder_top_ricardo2"
msgstr "I see myself in you."

msgid "spyder_top_dancer"
msgstr ""
"My parents think I'm paranoid, but I just don't trust crooked coaches.\\n\n"
"Or shady sponsors. Or fake rankings, for that matter."

msgid "spyder_top_barmaid"
msgstr ""
"The big corporations sell monsters\n"
" that can only be morphed using their own proprietary technologies!"

msgid "spyder_top_magician1"
msgstr ""
"Have you ever been to the Dojo in Flower City?\n"
"\n"
" No? A keen battler like you?"

msgid "spyder_top_magician2"
msgstr "Well, this should help."

msgid "spyder_top_magician3"
msgstr ""
"Head to the Dojo in Flower City and see how your battling skills \n"
"stack up."

