msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_aquemini1"
msgstr "Welcome to our grove, mortal."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_aquemini2"
msgstr "Pray you survive your visit."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_ignatia1"
msgstr "We are more than we appear."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_ignatia2"
msgstr "You are more than you appear."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_petra1"
msgstr "Crack nature's molds!"

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_petra2"
msgstr "Ungrateful man."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_ferris1"
msgstr "Do you realize you disturb the slumber of centuries?"

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_ferris2"
msgstr "Maybe it is time for us to go into the world."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_sylvia1"
msgstr "The seasons turn with Volcoli's dance."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_sylvia2"
msgstr "We nymphs wax and wane in power with the passing of the seasons."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_boy_healthy"
msgstr ""
"Wow, your monsters look really healthy! That's so great.\n"
"\n"
" You must be rich to be able to look after them so well.\n"
"\n"
" Hey -- if I gave you my buddy RUFF, you'd look after her, right?"

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_boy_yes"
msgstr "*SNIFF* I'm going to miss you, buddy. But it's for the best."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_boy_no"
msgstr "Oh. Yeah. Fair enough. It's real expensive, I know."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_boy_not_healthy"
msgstr ""
"Hey, your monsters are in rough shape. I understand what you're going "
"through.\n"
"\n"
" My WOLFFSKY got herself hurt, but we can't afford the doctor's fees just "
"now to look after her. It's rough."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_dad1"
msgstr ""
"I feel bad. When we got him that WOLFFSKY for his birthday, we never "
"realized how much the vet fees would be.\n"
"\n"
" We just can't afford them. And then RUFF got in that fight ..."

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_boy_after"
msgstr "Hey, how's RUFF going? You're taking good care of her, right?"

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_boy_question"
msgstr "Return RUFF to boy?"

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_boy_after_yes"
msgstr ""
"Oh wow! Oh wow! You just made my day. My week! My year! I missed RUFF so "
"much.\n"
"\n"
" *SNIFF* You're the best!"

msgid "spyder_dryadsgrove_boy_after_no"
msgstr ""
"*SNIFF* I understand. It's easy to get attached, and RUFF looks like he's \n"
"doing really well. Bye RUFF."

