msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback_trigger"
msgstr ""
"Watch something else? A recorded episode of King Of The Hill League is "
"available."

msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Reporter: Wow, what a clash! Crimson's Agnigon is really putting the "
"pressure on Sapphire's Fribbit!\n"
"\n"
" Look at that! Agnigon unleashed a devastating Breathe Fire!"

msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback2"
msgstr ""
"Billie: Overrated. Agnigon's moves are predictable. Any decent trainer "
"could\n"
" see that coming."

msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Reporter: Fribbit is taking a beating! But look at that! Fribbit counters \n"
"with a powerful Ice Storm! It's a direct hit!"

msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback4"
msgstr "Billie: Ice Storm? Weak."

msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Reporter: This is getting intense! Agnigon is down! Fribbit wins! What a \n"
"stunning upset!"

msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback6"
msgstr ""
"Billie: Amateur. Agnigon should have used Supernova. A direct hit would "
"have\n"
" ended the fight in seconds."

msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback7"
msgstr ""
"Reporter: This was an incredible display of skill and strategy from \n"
"Sapphire."

msgid "spyder_billie_tv_flashback8"
msgstr ""
"Billie: Skill? Luck. Any decent trainer could have predicted Agnigon's \n"
"downfall."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback_trigger"
msgstr "Do you want to uncover a piece of Billie's backstory?"

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback1"
msgstr "Granny: You look upset, dear. Is everything alright?"

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback2"
msgstr "I don't know, Grandma. My parents are always arguing about me."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Granny: Oh, honey. That must be hard. But remember, you don't have to "
"agree \n"
"with everything they say."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback4"
msgstr "But they're my parents. I'm supposed to respect them."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Granny: Of course, you should. But respect doesn't mean obedience. It "
"means \n"
"understanding and valuing their love for you."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback6"
msgstr "I know, but it's so hard."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback7"
msgstr ""
"Granny: Life is full of challenges, dear. But remember, you're not alone. \n"
"I'm always here for you."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback8"
msgstr "I just wish they could understand me."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback9"
msgstr ""
"Granny: Sometimes, it takes time for people to see things from a different "
"perspective.\n"
"\n"
" But in the meantime, you can focus on what you can control. What makes you "
"happy?"

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback10"
msgstr ""
"Spending time with my friends, training hard, and exploring new places."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback11"
msgstr ""
"Granny: Remember, it's okay to pursue your own passions, even if they "
"don't \n"
"always align with your parents' expectations."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback12"
msgstr "Thank you, Grandma. I needed to hear that."

msgid "spyder_billie_flashback_end"
msgstr ""
"Oh dear, how much I would like you to be close to me, Bernard...\n"
"\n"
" I remember when you were first diagnosed, and you said, 'We'll face this "
"together, as a team.'\n"
"\n"
" Sometimes it feels like it was just yesterday that you were here with me.\n"
"\n"
" I see so much of you in Billie... it's like you're still with me, guiding "
"me through her."

msgid "spyder_papertown_restinbed"
msgstr "You awake fully rested!"

