msgid "spyder_dojo_zhao1"
msgstr ""
"How are you finding the Dojo?...\n"
"\n"
" You should become a monk here. You already have the vow of silence covered!"

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu1"
msgstr "Let me tell you how Morphing works."

msgid "spyder_dojo_yin1"
msgstr "Let me tell you how Stats works."

msgid "spyder_dojo_zhu1"
msgstr "Let me tell you how Tastes work."

msgid "spyder_dojo_xiang1"
msgstr "Let me tell you how Techniques work."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu2"
msgstr ""
"I have developed a training method that helps competitors revisit earlier "
"fundamentals."

msgid "spyder_dojo_yin2"
msgstr ""
"Monsters have six Stats: HP, Melee, Ranged, Armor, Dodge and Speed.\n"
"\n"
" HP determines how much Damage they can take from attacks before passing "
"out.\n"
"\n"
" Melee determines how much Damage their melee and touch attacks do.\n"
"\n"
" Ranged determines how much Damage their ranged and reach attacks do.\n"
"\n"
" Armor reduces Damage from melee and reach attacks.\n"
"\n"
" Dodge reduces Damage from ranged and touch attacks.\n"
"\n"
" A higher Speed makes it more likely that monster will act first in battle."

msgid "spyder_dojo_zhu2"
msgstr ""
"Every monster has two Tastes: Warm and Cold.\n"
"\n"
" A Warm Taste makes the monster 10 percent better in one Stat:\n"
"\n"
" Speed for Peppy Taste, Melee for Salty Taste, Armor for Hearty Taste,\n"
"\n"
" Ranged for Zesty Taste and Dodge for Refined Taste.\n"
"\n"
" A Cold Taste makes the monster 10 percent worse in one Stat:\n"
"\n"
" Speed for Mild Taste, Melee for Sweet Taste,\n"
"\n"
" Armor for Soft Taste, Ranged for Flakey Taste and Dodge for Dry Taste."

msgid "spyder_dojo_xiang2"
msgstr ""
"In combat, monsters can choose from up to four techniques that they know.\n"
"\n"
" Techniques have an accuracy, which determines how likely they are to "
"occur.\n"
"\n"
" If a technique has a Power, that determines how much Damage it does.\n"
"\n"
" Some techniques impose a condition on the user or the target,\n"
"\n"
" or both - and the technique's Potency determines how likely that is to "
"occur.\n"
"\n"
" Some techniques, once used, take a while to become available again."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu3"
msgstr ""
"I have developed a potion that reverts a tuxemon back to its base form."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu3a"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, but you haven't reached your first belt promotion yet.\\n\n"
"This training won't be much use to you at the moment."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu3b"
msgstr ""
"Ah, I see you've earned your first belt promotion.\\n\n"
"Ask my student if you're interested in reviewing your fundamentals."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu3c"
msgstr ""
"Impressive, you've reached an advanced belt milestone.\\n\n"
"Ask my student if you're interested in refining your earlier game."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu3d"
msgstr ""
"Feel free to ask my students, if you're interested in the Button Potion. \n"
"\n"
"Either of them might be prepared to apply it, depending on their current "
"research."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu_student1"
msgstr ""
"You're interested in a fundamentals reset session?\\n\n"
"That'll be ${{currency}}500, if you're willing to part with it."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu_student1_stage"
msgstr ""
"Have you reached an advanced belt milestone yet?\\n\n"
"Return when you have, and I can help you revisit your intermediate game."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu_student1a"
msgstr ""
"A small price to pay for the knowledge gained.\\n\n"
"Revisiting earlier fundamentals has its uses."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu_student1b"
msgstr ""
"I can help an advanced competitor revisit their intermediate game.\\n\n"
"The insights from reviewing earlier stages are invaluable to my research."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu_student1c"
msgstr ""
"I see. Well, if you're not interested or can't afford it, I won't pressure "
"you. The Button Potion is a rare and valuable item, after all.\n"
"\n"
" Maybe another time, then?"

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu_student2_stage"
msgstr ""
"Have you reached your first belt promotion?\\n\n"
"Come back when you have, and I can help you revisit your original "
"fundamentals."

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu_nochoice"
msgstr ""
"I'm ready to assist, but please choose the competitor who will take the "
"reset session."

msgid "spyder_dojo_zhu3"
msgstr ""
"I have developed a session that changes a competitor's training focus.\\n\n"
"Shall I apply the Focus-Changer session for ${{currency}}50?"

msgid "spyder_dojo_zhu3a"
msgstr ""
"I'm afraid you don't have enough funds to afford the Taste-Changer Potion."

msgid "spyder_dojo_xiang3"
msgstr ""
"I have developed a session that allows a competitor to re-learn a forgotten "
"technique.\\n\n"
"Shall I apply the Re-Learner session for ${{currency}}200?"

msgid "spyder_dojo_xiang3a"
msgstr "Not enough to cover the cost of the Re-Learner Potion."

msgid "spyder_dojo_xiang3b"
msgstr ""
"The Re-Learner session worked. The forgotten technique has been restored."

msgid "spyder_dojo_xiang3c"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, the Re-Learner session had an unexpected side effect,\\n\n"
"and the competitor forgot one of their current techniques."

msgid "spyder_dojo_xiang3d"
msgstr ""
"Be cautious, young competitor. The Re-Learner session is potent and may have "
"unintended consequences on athletes with limited technique pools.\\n\n"
"I advise using it only on those who have reached a high level of mastery."

msgid "spyder_dojo_wan"
msgstr "Master Wan"

msgid "spyder_dojo_toph"
msgstr "Monk Toph"

msgid "spyder_dojo_sokka"
msgstr "Monk Sokka"

msgid "spyder_dojo_yangchen"
msgstr "Monk Yangchen"

msgid "spyder_dojo_kataro"
msgstr "Monk Kataro"

msgid "spyder_dojo_iroh"
msgstr "Monk Iroh"

msgid "spyder_dojo_zhu"
msgstr "Zhu"

msgid "spyder_dojo_zhao"
msgstr "Zhao"

msgid "spyder_dojo_yin"
msgstr "Yin"

msgid "spyder_dojo_xiang"
msgstr "Xiang"

msgid "spyder_dojo_fu"
msgstr "Fu"

msgid "spyder_dojo_wan1"
msgstr ""
"On this level, you must prove your mastery of the elements that make up "
"everything in the universe."

msgid "spyder_dojo_wan2"
msgstr ""
"Every monster is composed of one or two elements, \n"
"\n"
" and every technique that they can perform is composed of one or two "
"elements. \n"
"\n"
" A monster's element determines which elements it resists, and which "
"elements it is weak against. \n"
"\n"
" It takes half damage from techniques of the element it is resistant to, \n"
"\n"
" and double from techniques of the element it is weak against."

msgid "spyder_dojo_wan3"
msgstr ""
"Each monk in this room specializes in monsters of a particular element, \n"
"\n"
" but each has found a way to develop their strengths and to mitigate their "
"weaknesses. \n"
"\n"
" Talk to me once you have defeated them all."

msgid "spyder_dojo_wan4"
msgstr ""
"Congratulations. \n"
"\n"
" Now prove what you have learned in battle against me."

msgid "spyder_dojo_toph1"
msgstr ""
"I may coach pressure-based athletes, but they all have strong takedowns or "
"submissions.\\n\n"
"I use that to overwhelm your defenses, even if you think you know the "
"matchup."

msgid "spyder_dojo_toph2"
msgstr ""
"Of course, this strategy depends on your opponents having low Armor and "
"Dodge stats. \n"
"\n"
" Good job. Let me heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_sokka1"
msgstr ""
"My competitors each blend a second style or know techniques with multiple "
"uses.\\n\n"
"That makes their strengths and weaknesses harder to predict."

msgid "spyder_dojo_sokka2"
msgstr ""
"Of course, dual types still have some weaknesses - sometimes twice as many "
"as others. \n"
"\n"
" Good job. Let me heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_yangchen1"
msgstr ""
"My guard players all know strong passing counters,\\n\n"
"so if you send a pure pressure passer against me,\\n\n"
"we'll meet it with movement and frames."

msgid "spyder_dojo_yangchen2"
msgstr ""
"Of course that strategy doesn't work if non-Metal types are using Metal "
"techniques. \n"
"\n"
" Good job. Let me heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_kataro1"
msgstr ""
"My wrestlers know techniques that work around their weaknesses,\\n\n"
"whether that's using pressure to slow opponents down\\n\n"
"or fixed damage tactics when clean attacks are hard to find."

msgid "spyder_dojo_kataro2"
msgstr ""
"Of course, these mitigating strategies carry an opportunity cost. \n"
"\n"
" Good job. Let me heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_iroh1"
msgstr ""
"I am a striking specialist.\\n\n"
"Each of my competitors knows striking attacks and one other style.\\n\n"
"I'll always have someone who can target a weakness."

msgid "spyder_dojo_iroh2"
msgstr ""
"Of course, they do still have their Fire weaknesses. \n"
"\n"
" Good job. Let me heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_tu"
msgstr "Master Tu"

msgid "spyder_dojo_ares"
msgstr "Monk Ares"

msgid "spyder_dojo_orion"
msgstr "Monk Orion"

msgid "spyder_dojo_hephastus"
msgstr "Monk Hephastus"

msgid "spyder_dojo_hermes"
msgstr "Monk Hermes"

msgid "spyder_dojo_saturn"
msgstr "Monk Saturn"

msgid "spyder_dojo_thri"
msgstr "Riddler Thri"

msgid "spyder_dojo_tu1"
msgstr ""
"On this level you must prove your mastery of the six vital statistics of "
"tuxemon:\n"
"\n"
" HP, Melee, Ranged, Armor, Dodge and Speed."

msgid "spyder_dojo_tu3"
msgstr ""
"Each monk in this room specializes in monsters with one very high stat.\n"
"\n"
" To overcome this, you will have to make clever use of your own creatures' "
"stats. \n"
"\n"
" Talk to me once you have defeated them all."

msgid "spyder_dojo_tu4"
msgstr ""
"Congratulations.\n"
"\n"
" Now prove what you have learned in battle against me"

msgid "spyder_dojo_ares1"
msgstr ""
"My competitors have great Melee or Ranged stats, or both, so their attacks "
"hit hard."

msgid "spyder_dojo_ares2"
msgstr ""
"Here is a TM you may find useful: Scope.\\n\n"
"It tells you a competitor's statistics,\\n\n"
"so you can target weak defensive areas properly.\\n\n"
"I'll also help you recover."

msgid "spyder_dojo_orion1"
msgstr ""
"My team all have excellent Dodge stats,\n"
"\n"
" making it very difficult to get a successful ranged attack off against them."

msgid "spyder_dojo_orion2"
msgstr ""
"Here is a TM that you may find useful: Shadow Boxing.\n"
"\n"
" It uses your Melee and their Dodge,\n"
"\n"
" allowing your strong melee attackers to get around an enemy with high "
"Armor.\n"
"\n"
" I'll also heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_hephastus1"
msgstr ""
"My team all have excellent Armor, so melee attacks just bounce off of their "
"thick hides."

msgid "spyder_dojo_hephastus2"
msgstr ""
"Here is a TM that you may find useful: Blade.\n"
"\n"
" It goes before most other moves, allowing a slow creature to get the "
"advantage.\n"
"\n"
" I'll also heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_hermes1"
msgstr ""
"My team are lightning-quick, with high Speed.\n"
"\n"
" By the time you get around to attacking, we'll have already defeated you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_hermes2"
msgstr ""
"Here is a TM that you may find useful: Panjandrum.\n"
"\n"
" Its damage is a portion of the target's maximum HP,\n"
"\n"
" so it's as effective against high HP foes as it is against low HP ones.\n"
"\n"
" I'll also heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_saturn1"
msgstr "My team are tough as nails, with incredibly high HP."

msgid "spyder_dojo_saturn2"
msgstr ""
"Here is a TM that you may find useful: All In.\n"
"\n"
" It heals you a little, improving your odds of holding out against durable "
"monsters.\n"
"\n"
" I'll also heal you."

msgid "spyder_dojo_thri1"
msgstr ""
"Congratulations, you have proven yourself an excellent trainer. \n"
"\n"
" You will face only one further adversary: me!"

msgid "spyder_dojo_thri2"
msgstr ""
"You are a true master of battle and have earned a reward. \n"
"\n"
" Tell me, do you favor strength or strategy?"

msgid "spyder_dojo_strength"
msgstr "In that case, take this SAMPSACK. Its power is unrivalled."

msgid "spyder_dojo_strategy"
msgstr "In that case, take this SAMPSAGE. Its cunning is unrivalled."

msgid "spyder_dojo_billie1"
msgstr ""
"Hey cheapskate! I'm training here too. You know, this Competitor Database "
"thing isn't half bad.\\n\n"
"I bet you only like it because it's free, though."

msgid "spyder_dojo_billie2"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm, I can tell from your Competitor Database edits that you know your "
"stuff."

msgid "spyder_dojo_billie3"
msgstr "Billie has added their competitor data to the Competitor Database."

msgid "spyder_wayfarerinn_sign"
msgstr "Welcome to the Wayfarer Inn! "

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_note"
msgstr ""
"Haha, suckers - you'll never find me. \n"
"\n"
" It's on the Omnichannel CEO's letterhead."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_intro"
msgstr ""
"The PC contains a file named 'Cut Intro'. Would you like to watch the cut \n"
"scenes?"

msgid "spyder_walled_osman"
msgstr "Osman"

msgid "spyder_walled_musa"
msgstr "Musa"

msgid "spyder_walled_augustus"
msgstr "Augustus"

msgid "spyder_walled_fugger"
msgstr "Fugger"

msgid "spyder_walled_rufus"
msgstr "Rufus"

msgid "spyder_walled_alexander"
msgstr "Alexander"

msgid "spyder_walled_carnegie"
msgstr "Carnegie"

msgid "spyder_walled_crassus"
msgstr "Crassus"

msgid "spyder_walled_girard"
msgstr "Girard"

msgid "spyder_walled_vanderbilt"
msgstr "Vanderbilt"

msgid "spyder_walled_ford"
msgstr "Ford"

msgid "spyder_walled_astor"
msgstr "Astor"

msgid "spyder_walled_midas"
msgstr "Midas"

msgid "spyder_walled_osman1"
msgstr "Do you want to buy Tuxcoin?"

msgid "spyder_walled_osman2"
msgstr "I wish I have bought Tuxcoin ten years ago."

msgid "spyder_walled_musa1"
msgstr "Why do you keep asking such obvious questions?"

msgid "spyder_walled_musa2"
msgstr "Let's skip it."

msgid "spyder_walled_augustus1"
msgstr "I wrote nine academic papers!"

msgid "spyder_walled_augustus2"
msgstr "But I'm unable to win a match!"

msgid "spyder_walled_fugger1"
msgstr "My new movie was not as good as I thought it would be."

msgid "spyder_walled_fugger2"
msgstr "Too many fight scenes."

msgid "spyder_walled_rufus1"
msgstr "Do you really want to play this game with me?"

msgid "spyder_walled_rufus2"
msgstr "You have won."

msgid "spyder_walled_alexander1"
msgstr "Do you mind waiting an extra hour so I can read more of my book?"

msgid "spyder_walled_alexander2"
msgstr "Lasted less than thirty seconds."

msgid "spyder_walled_carnegie1"
msgstr "I often wish I was born in a time before social media."

msgid "spyder_walled_carnegie2"
msgstr "Let me update my status!"

msgid "spyder_walled_crassus1"
msgstr "I'm going to buy an island."

msgid "spyder_walled_crassus2"
msgstr "But which one?"

msgid "spyder_walled_girard1"
msgstr "Why not go back to them and tell them you changed your mind?"

msgid "spyder_walled_girard2"
msgstr "Who popped up in your mind?"

msgid "spyder_walled_vanderbilt1"
msgstr ""
"People have justifications for hurting others, but they are rarely good \n"
"justifications."

msgid "spyder_walled_vanderbilt2"
msgstr "What's your justification?"

msgid "spyder_walled_ford1"
msgstr "Did you hear about the big earthquake in ocean?"

msgid "spyder_walled_ford2"
msgstr "There was a tsunami alert!"

msgid "spyder_walled_astor1"
msgstr "What should you do if you find a spider on your bed?"

msgid "spyder_walled_astor2"
msgstr "Capture and sell!"

msgid "spyder_walled_billie1"
msgstr ""
"Well hello, ${{name}}.\n"
"\n"
" You scrub up alright.\n"
"\n"
" Don't worry, I'm not going to battle you.\n"
"\n"
" I don't want my win rate to get any worse."

msgid "spyder_walled_midas1"
msgstr "I guess they're just giving out Academy Passes to everyone these days."

msgid "spyder_walled_midas2"
msgstr ""
"... ... ...\n"
"\n"
" I founded the Walled Garden as a sanctuary for the better class of person\n"
"\n"
" to hone their battle skills and network with fellow members of the elite.\n"
"\n"
" But seeing you, a...\n"
"\n"
" what is the word?\n"
"\n"
" I want to say 'hoi polloi'? 'Villein'?\n"
"\n"
" Seeing a pleb like you triumph has made me reconsider.\n"
"\n"
" From this day on, I am going to open the Walled Garden to all comers.\n"
"\n"
" Anyone who wants to test their mettle can do so here."

msgid "spyder_cottonhouse1_tvwatch"
msgstr ""
"It's the latest reality show: athletes complete grappling challenges\\n\n"
"on a remote island."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_guard"
msgstr "Alright, alright, nothing to see here."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_gregor1"
msgstr "I spend all day watching my CATEYE - I'm going to catch it blinking!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_chip1"
msgstr "I have developed unmatched computing power!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_clarence1"
msgstr "My competitors are unstoppable when the lights are bright!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_gregor2"
msgstr "Ugh, it didn't even blink when it fainted!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_chip2"
msgstr "Needs more power!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_clarence2"
msgstr "There was a cloud!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_louis1"
msgstr ""
"The rules of this battle are the simple laws of natural selection: only "
"the \n"
"strong survive!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_louis2"
msgstr "May I introduce you to the Gaia Hypothesis?"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_lewis1"
msgstr ""
"Hey, this is an active emergency.\n"
"\n"
" Get out of here!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_lewis2"
msgstr "Great, now I've got nothing to fight the fires with."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_hunt1"
msgstr ""
"Come work at Greenwash, they said.\n"
"\n"
" Perform experiments that blur the line between science and madness, they "
"said.\n"
"\n"
" Look where that got me!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_hunt2"
msgstr "There's no future in STEM, kid."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_alex1"
msgstr ""
"I order all my flowers from Greenwash.\n"
"\n"
" They have varieties that I've never seen before!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_alex2"
msgstr ""
"Here's my card in case you ever need a flower arrangement.\n"
"\n"
" I do weddings, funerals, birthdays..."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_gluck1"
msgstr ""
"Say what you will about genetic engineering, hydroponics and chemical "
"fertilizers,\n"
"\n"
" but you can't argue with the results."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_gluck2"
msgstr ""
"That settles it,\n"
"\n"
" I'm giving Narcileaf another dose of fertilizer when we get home."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_firefighter"
msgstr ""
"I could battle you, but I prefer to appeal to your reason and common sense.\n"
"\n"
" If you don't get out of here, the building might fall on you!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_broer1"
msgstr ""
"Every day, I sedate all the monsters so they can be observed safely.\n"
"\n"
" I forget ONE TIME, and everyone makes a huge fuss."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_broer2"
msgstr "Whatever. Here, have a potion."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_lewie1"
msgstr ""
"Just some broken glass and escaped monsters.\n"
"\n"
"  I was hoping for a fire."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_lewie2"
msgstr "I like fire a normal amount."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_morehouse1"
msgstr ""
"They said to get out,\n"
"\n"
"  but I'm not leaving without my notebook of scientific observations."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_morehouse2"
msgstr "I'm sure my notebook is around here somewhere."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_dempsey1"
msgstr "This is fine."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_heidenstam1"
msgstr "This has been one heck of a work experience placement."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_heidenstam2"
msgstr "Gee, thanks a bunch."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_louis"
msgstr "Louis"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_clarence"
msgstr "Clarence"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_chip"
msgstr "Chip"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_gregor"
msgstr "Gregor"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_lewis"
msgstr "Lewis"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_hunt"
msgstr "Hunt"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_alex"
msgstr "Alex"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_gluck"
msgstr "Gluck"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_broer"
msgstr "Broer"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_lewie"
msgstr "Lewie"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_morehouse"
msgstr "Morehouse"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_dempsey"
msgstr "Dempsey"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_heidenstam"
msgstr "Heidenstam"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator1"
msgstr ""
"... No? You're here to investigate why the Greenwash staff went on "
"strike\\n\n"
"and got locked out by Academy Security?"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator2"
msgstr "While you're here you might as well see the De-Fossilator in action."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator3"
msgstr "Ah, I see you have a toothed bird fossil. Shall I de-fossilate it?"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator4"
msgstr "It worked! The fossil turned into a Rhincus!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator5"
msgstr "Ah, I see you have an ancient dog fossil. Shall I de-fossilate it?"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator6"
msgstr "It worked! The fossil turned into a Shammer!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator7"
msgstr "Maybe another time then."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator8"
msgstr "Ah, I see you have two ancient fossils. Shall I de-fossilate both?"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_fossilisator9"
msgstr "It worked! The fossils turned into a Shammer and a Rhincus!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_looten1"
msgstr "Prepare to face the power of my experimental training squad!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_looten2"
msgstr ""
"Well, I guess fusion technology isn't quite there yet.\n"
"\n"
" We've been working on it for years!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_looten3"
msgstr ""
"Here's the closest we've come — a strange hybrid of wrestling pressure and "
"old-school jiu jitsu.\\n\n"
"Not exactly the unstoppable champion KOTHchannel wanted us to create.\\n\n"
"I mean... uh! You didn't hear that from me."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_looten4"
msgstr ""
"The funny thing is, because of its fusion DNA, it makes DNA screeners "
"behave\n"
" all funny."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_moreau1"
msgstr "You shouldn't be here! "

msgid "spyder_greenwash_moreau2"
msgstr "The fusion experiment blew up!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_dippel1"
msgstr "Maybe we went too far â€¦"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_dippel2"
msgstr "Or not far enough! "

msgid "spyder_greenwash_aissa1"
msgstr "Stay out - Greenwash has this all under control."

msgid "spyder_greenwash_aissa2"
msgstr "We're all going to die!"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_aissa"
msgstr "Aissa"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_dippel"
msgstr "Dippel"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_moreau"
msgstr "Moreau"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_note1"
msgstr ""
"Note from Dempsey\n"
"\n"
" 'Fusion experiment risks: unstable creatures, environmental damage, human "
"casualties. Must convince Looten to shut down experiment.'"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_pc_message1"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Selby to Looten\n"
"\n"
" 'I've been thinking a lot about the De-Fossilator and I have to admit, I'm "
"getting a bit uneasy about the whole thing.'"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_pc_message2"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Dempsey to Looten\n"
"\n"
" 'I've been reviewing the latest data from the fusion experiment and I have "
"to say, I'm getting a bit worried.\n"
"\n"
" The creatures we're creating are not what I expected. They're... unstable.'"

msgid "spyder_greenwash_pc_message3"
msgstr ""
"E-mail from Looten to Greenwash Staff\n"
"\n"
" As you are all aware, we are on the cusp of a major breakthrough with the "
"fusion experiment.\n"
"\n"
" I want to assure you that everything is under control and we are making "
"great progress.\n"
"\n"
" As you know, our previous test did not yield the results we had hoped for.\n"
"\n"
" We have learned from that experience and are preparing for a new test.\n"
"\n"
" It will incorporate the knowledge and insights we gained from the previous "
"failure.\n"
"\n"
" We have made significant adjustments to the experiment's parameters and are "
"confident that this new test will be a success.\n"
"\n"
" I want to assure you that we are taking all necessary precautions to ensure "
"the safety of our staff and the success of the experiment.\n"
"\n"
" Please disregard any rumors or concerns you may have heard.\n"
"\n"
" Keep up the good work, and let's make this next test a success!'"

msgid "spyder_pc_recorded_conversation"
msgstr "Found a recorded conversation on PC. Play back?"

msgid "spyder_fossilator_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Selby: I've done it! I've created a device that can reverse the \n"
"fossilization process. It's a breakthrough, a scientific miracle."

msgid "spyder_fossilator_flashback2"
msgstr ""
"Looten: Incredible! This could be a game-changer. Imagine the possibilities. "
"We could bring extinct creatures back to life.\n"
"\n"
" We could study them, learn from them, and even use them for our own "
"purposes."

msgid "spyder_fossilator_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Chip: But what about the ethical implications? Should we really be "
"interfering with the natural order of things?\n"
"\n"
" What if these creatures can't adapt to the modern world?"

msgid "spyder_fossilator_flashback4"
msgstr ""
"Looten: Ethics? We're scientists. Our job is to push the boundaries, to "
"explore the unknown. And besides, this could be a lucrative venture.\n"
"\n"
" We can charge a premium for de-fossilating rare and valuable creatures."

msgid "spyder_fossilator_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Selby: I understand your concerns, but I believe this technology could be "
"used for good.\n"
"\n"
" We could use it to study extinct ecosystems, to learn about climate change, "
"and even to help endangered species."

msgid "spyder_fossilator_flashback6"
msgstr ""
"Looten: That's a noble goal. But for now, let's focus on the potential "
"profits.\n"
"\n"
" We can charge a premium for de-fossilating rare and valuable creatures. "
"People will pay top dollar to have their own personal dinosaur."

msgid "spyder_fossilator_flashback7"
msgstr "Selby: I just hope we're making the right decision."

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback1"
msgstr ""
"Dempsey: I'm starting to think this whole thing is a bit out of control. "
"The\n"
" city's in chaos, and people are getting hurt."

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback2"
msgstr ""
"Looten: Out of control? What are you talking about? We're making progress. \n"
"The fusion experiment is almost ready."

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback3"
msgstr ""
"Dempsey: At what cost? The city's in chaos, and people are getting hurt. And "
"what about the ethics of it all?\n"
"\n"
" Creating creatures that could potentially harm humans and the environment?"

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback4"
msgstr ""
"Looten: Ethics? In the grand scheme of things, a few casualties are a small "
"price to pay for scientific advancement.\n"
"\n"
" We're pushing the boundaries of what's possible."

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback5"
msgstr ""
"Dempsey: I don't agree. We're playing God here. We're meddling with nature \n"
"in ways we don't fully understand."

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback6"
msgstr ""
"Looten: And what's wrong with that? We have the power to create life, to \n"
"shape the future. We're not just scientists; we're pioneers."

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback7"
msgstr "Dempsey: Pioneers? Or mad scientists? We're crossing a line."

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback8"
msgstr ""
"Looten: You're just a pessimist. You'll see the benefits eventually.\n"
"\n"
" The creatures we create will revolutionize society."

msgid "spyder_dempsey_flashback9"
msgstr "Dempsey: I hope you're right. But I'm starting to doubt it."

msgid "spyder_leathergym_board"
msgstr "Chad ${{var:chad_points}} vs Brad ${{var:brad_points}}"

