msgid "spyder_leathershaft2_dude"
msgstr ""
"Shaft is is one of the largest mining companies in the region,\n"
"\n"
"especially those that contribute to the communities."

msgid "spyder_leathershaft2_achievement"
msgstr ""
"Shaft is proud to join the top businesses in this race toward a net-zero "
"economy\n"
"\n"
"because we believe that climate change is not only one of the greatest risks "
"facing Fondent,\n"
"\n"
"but also one of the greatest opportunities for sustainable innovation."

msgid "spyder_leathershaft2_pc"
msgstr "Shaft promotional video on TuxTube."

msgid "spyder_leathershaft2_papers"
msgstr ""
"This leaflet from the Shaft aims to gain the trust of the Fondent's people."

msgid "spyder_leathershaft2_skeptic"
msgstr ""
"I don't trust Shaft. My geologist friend joined a team to explore the river "
"basin\n"
"\n"
"to determine the impact of deforestation and mining on the river and water "
"quality.\n"
"\n"
"This will mark the first ever evaluation of carbon and mercury production in "
"mining ponds,\n"
"\n"
"and their subsequent impact on water flowpaths, ever conducted in Fondent."

msgid "spyder_leathershaft1_sign"
msgstr "Journey to the Center of the Earth!"

msgid "spyder_leathershaft1_miner1"
msgstr ""
"It is important to protect indigenous people, land... but we cannot "
"criminalize the miners\n"
"\n"
"who are looking for a living to survive. What matters is that the miners are "
"protected!"

msgid "spyder_leathershaft1_beryll1"
msgstr ""
"In Fondent alone there are about a dozen locations where illegal or artisan "
"mining is going on\n"
"\n"
"but Shaft is viewed as evil."

msgid "spyder_leathershaft1_roxby1"
msgstr ""
"Some islands in the archipelago are completely taken over by mining. It is "
"not possible to differentiate\n"
"\n"
"between an indigenous community and a mining area. There is not even water "
"to drink. Shaft is against!"

msgid "spyder_leathershaft1_rutherford1"
msgstr ""
"Shaft leader is a thinker and doer. She is not a talker. She has met twice "
"with the miners. It shows quality.\n"
"\n"
"It shows her plans for Fondent. Our leader has been consistent when it comes "
"to climate change."

msgid "spyder_leathershaft1_surat1"
msgstr ""
"To streamline the mining sector, someone started giving certificates to "
"qualified miners.\\n\n"
"The entity? KOTHchannel. And Shaft is the scapegoat."

msgid "spyder_papermanor_oldman"
msgstr ""
"I have two sons and a niece. The first is a sailor, and last year he went to "
"the Archipelago.\n"
"\n"
"The second is a Captain and he transports people. My niece is playing "
"outside."

msgid "spyder_candyhouse2_captain"
msgstr ""
"I'm writing a book about my journey to the Archipelago. It is composed of "
"nine volcanic islands.\n"
"\n"
"About 1,400 km (870 mi) west of Paper Town, about 1,500 km (930 mi) north "
"west of Candy Town."

msgid "spyder_omnichannel_sign"
msgstr "KOTHchannel HQ: The Official Home of King Of The Hill"

msgid "spyder_confusedperson"
msgstr "Confused Guy"

msgid "test_lamp"
msgstr ""
"Hello stranger!\n"
"\n"
"My name is Lampy, lord of all lamps.\n"
"\n"
"Say hello to the trash can."

msgid "test_trash"
msgstr ""
"Did Lord Lampy tell you about me?\n"
"\n"
"Go away please! I'd like to rest in peace."

msgid "test_tree"
msgstr ""
"It is me! I am tree!\n"
"\n"
"You are a butt. I breathe your farts."

msgid "professor_dialog"
msgstr ""
"Professor:\n"
"\n"
"Ah, yes. The very person I've been wanting to meet.\n"
"\n"
"I've heard that you want to learn about Tuxemon.\n"
"\n"
"Tuxemon are little animals, some call them monsters, that we befriend and "
"use to battle other Tuxemon.\n"
"\n"
"I was wondering, I just received three new Tuxemon for research and I would "
"like to give you one.\n"
"\n"
"Which one would you like?"

msgid "professor_dialog6.1"
msgstr "Professor: An excellent choice! Hydrone is a fluid guard player."

msgid "professor_dialog6.2"
msgstr "Professor: A superb choice! Rockitten is a pressure-heavy wrestler."

msgid "professor_dialog6.3"
msgstr ""
"Professor: A great choice! Fruitera is a flexible movement-based grappler."

msgid "professor_dialog7"
msgstr ""
"Professor: I hope to see you around! I'm about to head on a journey, so \n"
"maybe we'll meet up sometime."

msgid "manhattan_beach_uncle_jeff_opening"
msgstr ""
"Uncle Jeff: \n"
"\n"
" Having fun in the sand, my dear ${{name}}?\n"
"\n"
"Oh! We have lost track of time. You are almost late for your first day of "
"Fire Nation elementary school.\n"
"\n"
"As a gift I will give you your first Tuxemon. You will most certainly need "
"it at school.\n"
"\n"
"Which one would you like?"

msgid "manhattan_beach_uncle_jeff_hydrone"
msgstr ""
"Uncle Jeff: Interesting choice! Hydrone is a fluid guard player.\\n\n"
"You two may not click at first, but a calm guard game can balance your fiery "
"tendencies.\\n\n"
"Now run to class! Hurry!"

msgid "manhattan_beach_uncle_jeff_rockitten"
msgstr ""
"Uncle Jeff: Wise choice! Rockitten is a pressure-heavy wrestler.\\n\n"
"Pressure and intensity can shape a strong competitor.\\n\n"
"Good. Now hurry and run to class!"

msgid "manhattan_beach_uncle_jeff_fruitera"
msgstr ""
"Uncle Jeff: Very interesting. Fruitera is a movement-based grappler.\\n\n"
"Agility and timing can breathe life into any game.\\n\n"
"Now get to school!"

msgid "eclipse_beginning1"
msgstr ""
"I... I still can't believe what happened. Is this really the right path?"

msgid "eclipse_beginning2"
msgstr ""
"Calm Voice: Argon, you've always been one to question everything. But "
"sometimes, there's no right or wrongâ€”only action."

msgid "eclipse_beginning3"
msgstr ""
"Action without purpose is meaningless. Chrome Robo... just a machine, yet... "
"why do I still see its eyes?"

msgid "eclipse_beginning4"
msgstr ""
"Familiar Voice: Argon, you did what you had to. Chrome Robo was a threat. No "
"more, no less. Let it go."

msgid "eclipse_beginning5"
msgstr ""
"Let it go? You make it sound so simple. But it wasn't just bolts and "
"circuits... there was something there, something deeper.\n"
" Am I losing myself? Or have I already?"

msgid "eclipse_beginning6"
msgstr ""
"Reflective Voice: You need to decide what matters to you now. What lies "
"beyond the horizon, Argon? Is it redemption, or ruin?"

msgid "eclipse_beginning7"
msgstr ""
"Cold Voice: Hesitation leads to weakness, weakness leads to failure. "
"Destroying Chrome Robo was only the beginning, Argon.\n"
" You've stepped into a stormâ€”there's no turning back now."

msgid "eclipse_beginning8"
msgstr ""
"No turning back... I'm starting to feel that. But what if the road ahead "
"only brings destruction?"

msgid "eclipse_beginning9"
msgstr ""
"Compassionate Voice: Argon, the road is yours to walk, no matter how jagged "
"it seems.\n"
" You still carry the light of compassionâ€”it will guide you, even if you "
"can't see the way."

msgid "eclipse_beginning10"
msgstr "Can I still hold onto compassion... without losing myself?"

msgid "eclipse_event2_1"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Compassion: You've chosen this path for a reason. Keep moving "
"forward, Argon.\n"
" Don't lose sight of what's right."

msgid "eclipse_event2_2"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Doubt: Every step you take, you leave something behind. Your ideals "
"won't save youâ€”or anyone else."

msgid "eclipse_event2_3"
msgstr ""
"Unknown Voice: You think this road is yours to walk? Your choices aren't as "
"free as you believe, Argon."

msgid "eclipse_event3_1"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Memory: Argon? By the processors, it's really you! It's been a long "
"time.\n"
" Tell meâ€¦ do you still believe in what we once talked about?"

msgid "eclipse_event3_2"
msgstr ""
"I knew it. You always saw the bigger picture, Argon. Stay on that pathâ€¦ "
"the world needs people like you."

msgid "eclipse_event3_3"
msgstr ""
"Oh, Argon. I guess even you couldn't hold on forever. But don't let this "
"destroy who you are."

msgid "eclipse_event4_1"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Challenge: Well, look who it is. Argon, still fighting the good "
"fight, I assume?\n"
" Tell me, have you grown tired of clinging to your ideals yet?"

msgid "eclipse_event4_2"
msgstr ""
"Hmph. Idealism is a fool's comfort, Argon. But maybe you'll prove me wrong. "
"Doubt it, though."

msgid "eclipse_event4_3"
msgstr ""
"Ha! Finally, some clarity. Just remember, Argon, the world doesn't wait for "
"dreamers."

msgid "eclipse_event5_1"
msgstr ""
"TuxeVault... the institution that funded my dreamsâ€”and my nightmares. Am I "
"here for redemption or reckoning?"

msgid "eclipse_event5_2"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Judgment: Redemption and reckoning are illusions, Argon. What you "
"seek is truthâ€”and truth rarely comforts."

msgid "eclipse_event6_1"
msgstr ""
"Whispered Voice: This is where power lies, disguised as virtue. Do you feel "
"safe here, Argon? You shouldn't."

msgid "eclipse_event6_2"
msgstr ""
"Echo of the Past: You stood in labs just like these once. Healing, creating, "
"destroyingâ€¦ Was it worth it?"

msgid "eclipse_event7_1"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Temptation: Drown your regrets here, Argon. It's easier than facing "
"them, isn't it?"

msgid "eclipse_event7_2"
msgstr ""
"Fragment of Memory: We laughed once, in a place like this. Before it all "
"fell apart. Do you remember, Argon?"

msgid "eclipse_event8_1"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Wisdom: You carry heavy burdens, child. But storms pass, and even "
"the tallest trees find the light again."

msgid "eclipse_event8_2"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Warning: The old academy casts long shadows. Be wary of what you "
"find here, Argon—it may consume you."

msgid "eclipse_event9_1"
msgstr ""
"Voice of the Vault: You return to the place that built you, Argon. But "
"foundations crack, and dreams rot.\n"
" Will you rebuildâ€”or burn it down?"

msgid "eclipse_event9_2"
msgstr ""
"I said I came for redemptionâ€¦ but maybe I came to see what's left of me "
"here."

msgid "eclipse_event9_3"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Judgment: Redemption and reckoning are illusions, Argon. What you "
"seek is truthâ€”and truth rarely comforts."

msgid "eclipse_event9_4"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Compassion: You carry pain, but also purpose. This place may have "
"broken youâ€”but it can still shape you."

msgid "eclipse_event9_5"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Doubt: You think you've come back stronger. But strength fades. And "
"this place remembers everything."

msgid "eclipse_event9_6"
msgstr ""
"Voice of Temptation: Forget redemption. Forget reckoning. Just walk away, "
"Argon. Let the past bury itself."

msgid "eclipse_event9_7"
msgstr ""
"If truth is all that's left, then I'll face itâ€”no matter how dark it gets. "
"I won't walk away. Not this time.\n"
" If this place remembers everythingâ€¦ then it remembers who I used to be."

